ght/QiBar.md)。脸是 **Assister** |","content_concise":"1→# UI SWF line-by-line 总索引 — `decompiled/ui`\n\n壳：[`../shell/00-INDEX.md`](../shell/00-INDEX.md)。引擎 `net.play5d`：[`../engine/00-INDEX.md`](../engine/00-INDEX.md)（A–D 已闭合，屏幕层在 Batch C）。角色：[`../fighters/00-INDEX.md`](../fighters/00-INDEX.md)（A–G 已闭合）。\n\n本目录注 **8 个嵌入 UI SWF**（`decompiled/ui/**/scripts/**.as`）。镜像路径：`decompiled/ui/` 之后原样换成 `.md`。不改 `decompiled/`。不播 / 不重打包 SWF。\n\n**状态：本批 73 个 `.as` 全部 done。`decompiled/other/effect/**` 仍 pending，不要开始 effect。**\n\n对照总表（非逐行）：[`../../04-maps-ui-xml.md`](../../04-maps-ui-xml.md)。工厂：[`../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md`](../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md)。\n10→\n清单源：[`../_maps/ui-batch-files.txt`](../_maps/ui-batch-files.txt)。\n\n## 八个 SWF ↔ 引擎\n\n`ResUtils` 把 8 个 `[Embed]` SWF `loadBytes` 进 **`ApplicationDomain.currentDomain`**。之后 `getItemClass(swfClass, linkage)` 用该域 `getDefinition`。第一参只要池里有这个 SWF Class；**链接名跨库也能取到**（引擎有时把 `loading_fight_mc` 写成 `ResUtils.I.fight`，把 `seltwzmc` / `select_arrow_mc_*` 写成 `ResUtils.I.select`，把 `cover_bgimg` 写成 `common_ui`）。反编译目录按 SWF 分，以本批落点为准。\n\n| SWF 目录 | `.as` | `ResUtils` 字段 | 主导出 | 引擎入口 |\n|----------|------|-----------------|--------|----------|\n| [`common_ui/`](common_ui/scripts/common_ui_fla/MainTimeline.md) | 8 | `common_ui` | `logo_movie` / `mc_wzbtn` / `trans_mc` / `mc_congratulations` | `LogoState`、`MenuBtn`、`TransUI`、`CongratulateState` |\n20→| [`fight/`](fight/scripts/ui_fight.md) | 33 | `fight` | `ui_fight` | `FightUI` → `GameState` 屏幕层 |\n| [`gameover/`](gameover/scripts/stg_gameover_mc.md) | 1 | `gameover` | `stg_gameover_mc`（`GAME_OVER`） | `GameOverState` |\n| [`howtoplay/`](howtoplay/scripts/movie_howtoplay.md) | 3 | `howtoplay` | `movie_howtoplay` | `HowToPlayState` |\n| [`loading/`](loading/scripts/loading_cover_mc.md) | 12 | `loading` | `loading_cover_mc` / `loading_fight_mc` / `winner_stg_mc` | `GameLoadingState`、`LoadingState`、`WinnerState` |\n| [`select/`](select/scripts/stg_select.md) | 8 | `select` | `stg_select`（`SELECT`） | `SelectFighterStage` |\n| [`setting/`](setting/scripts/stg_set_ui.md) | 5 | `setting` | `stg_set_ui`（`SETTING`） | `SettingState` |\n| [`title/`](title/scripts/stg_title.md) | 3 | `title` | `stg_title`（`TITLE`） | `MenuState` |\n| **合计** | **73** | | | |\n\n```\n30→LogoState          → common_ui.logo_movie\nMenuState          → title.stg_title + MenuBtn(mc_wzbtn) 挂在 btnct\nHowToPlayState     → howtoplay.movie_howtoplay\nSelectFighterStage → select.stg_select + 格子/光标/已选条/地图\nSettingState       → setting.stg_set_ui + keyset_mc / key_set_dialog_mc\nGameLoadingState   → loading.loading_cover_mc\nLoadingState       → loading.loading_fight_mc（代码写 fight 库）+ SelectIndexUI\nGameState          → fight.ui_fight → FightUI / FightBar / QiBar / HitsUI\nGameOverState      → gameover.stg_gameover_mc + common_ui.select_arrow_mc\nWinnerState        → loading.winner_stg_mc（或 winner_stg_mc2）\n40→CongratulateState  → common_ui.mc_congratulations + mc_win_all\nStateCtrl          → common_ui.trans_mc（TransUI）\n```\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  RU[\"ResUtils 8 UI SWF → currentDomain\"] --> LOGO[\"LogoState logo_movie\"]\n  RU --> MENU[\"MenuState stg_title\"]\n  MENU --> BTN[\"MenuBtn mc_wzbtn\"]\n  MENU --> HTP[\"HowToPlayState movie_howtoplay\"]\n50→  HTP --> SEL[\"SelectFighterStage stg_select\"]\n  MENU --> SET[\"SettingState stg_set_ui\"]\n  SEL --> LD[\"LoadingState loading_fight_mc\"]\n  LD --> GS[\"GameState ui_fight\"]\n  GS --> HUD[\"FightBar / QiBar / HitsUI / startKOmc\"]\n  GS --> GO[\"GameOverState stg_gameover_mc\"]\n  GS --> WIN[\"WinnerState winner_stg_mc\"]\n  GS --> CONG[\"CongratulateState mc_congratulations\"]\n  RU --> TR[\"StateCtrl TransUI trans_mc\"]\n```\n60→\n## 共享模式\n\n### MenuBtn / 箭头 / 转场\n\n| 模式 | SWF 件 | 引擎 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| 主菜单钮 | `mc_wzbtn` + 嵌套 `wzimg_bgimg_5`（`bg` 两帧高亮） | [`MenuBtn`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/MenuBtn.md)：英文位图字藏掉，中文 `BitmapText` 才上屏 |\n| 公共箭头 | `common_ui.select_arrow_mc` | `GameOverState`、`SetBtnGroup` |\n| 出战序箭头 | `loading.select_arrow_mc_1/2`（引擎从 `select` 取名） | [`SelectIndexUI`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/select/SelectIndexUI.md) |\n70→| 转场遮罩 | `trans_mc` 标签 `fadin` / `fadout` / `stop` | [`TransUI`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/TransUI.md) **不听** COMPLETE，自己 `nextFrame` |\n| 设置左右三角 | `txt_arrow_mc` | [`SetBtn`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/SetBtn.md) 两枚，右箭头 `scaleX=-1` |\n\n### 条 / 脸槽\n\n| 模式 | SWF | 引擎 |\n|------|-----|------|\n| 顶栏 | `hpbar_mc`：`face1/2` + `bar1/2` + `energy1/2` + `timemc` + `win_p1/p2` + `scoremc` | [`FightBar`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md)。F25/F46 `COMPLETE` ↔ `fadin_fin` / `fadout_fin` |\n| HP | `hpbar_barmc.bar` 绿 + `redbar` 拖尾 | [`FighterHpBar`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FighterHpBar.md) |\n| 体力（不是气） | `energy_bar` | [`EnergyBar`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md)。`comicType` 切死神/火影字 |\n80→| 气 + 辅助 | `qbar_mc`：`barmc` 三格+满格、`fzqibar`、`facemc`、`readymc` | [`QiBar`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/QiBar.md)。脸是 **Assister** |","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/00-INDEX.md","offset":null,"limit":80,"raw_output":"# UI SWF line-by-line 总索引 — `decompiled/ui`\n\n壳：[`../shell/00-INDEX.md`](../shell/00-INDEX.md)。引擎 `net.play5d`：[`../engine/00-INDEX.md`](../engine/00-INDEX.md)（A–D 已闭合，屏幕层在 Batch C）。角色：[`../fighters/00-INDEX.md`](../fighters/00-INDEX.md)（A–G 已闭合）。\n\n本目录注 **8 个嵌入 UI SWF**（`decompiled/ui/**/scripts/**.as`）。镜像路径：`decompiled/ui/` 之后原样换成 `.md`。不改 `decompiled/`。不播 / 不重打包 SWF。\n\n**状态：本批 73 个 `.as` 全部 done。`decompiled/other/effect/**` 仍 pending，不要开始 effect。**\n\n对照总表（非逐行）：[`../../04-maps-ui-xml.md`](../../04-maps-ui-xml.md)。工厂：[`../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md`](../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md)。\n\n清单源：[`../_maps/ui-batch-files.txt`](../_maps/ui-batch-files.txt)。\n\n## 八个 SWF ↔ 引擎\n\n`ResUtils` 把 8 个 `[Embed]` SWF `loadBytes` 进 **`ApplicationDomain.currentDomain`**。之后 `getItemClass(swfClass, linkage)` 用该域 `getDefinition`。第一参只要池里有这个 SWF Class；**链接名跨库也能取到**（引擎有时把 `loading_fight_mc` 写成 `ResUtils.I.fight`，把 `seltwzmc` / `select_arrow_mc_*` 写成 `ResUtils.I.select`，把 `cover_bgimg` 写成 `common_ui`）。反编译目录按 SWF 分，以本批落点为准。\n\n| SWF 目录 | `.as` | `ResUtils` 字段 | 主导出 | 引擎入口 |\n|----------|------|-----------------|--------|----------|\n| [`common_ui/`](common_ui/scripts/common_ui_fla/MainTimeline.md) | 8 | `common_ui` | `logo_movie` / `mc_wzbtn` / `trans_mc` / `mc_congratulations` | `LogoState`、`MenuBtn`、`TransUI`、`CongratulateState` |\n| [`fight/`](fight/scripts/ui_fight.md) | 33 | `fight` | `ui_fight` | `FightUI` → `GameState` 屏幕层 |\n| [`gameover/`](gameover/scripts/stg_gameover_mc.md) | 1 | `gameover` | `stg_gameover_mc`（`GAME_OVER`） | `GameOverState` |\n| [`howtoplay/`](howtoplay/scripts/movie_howtoplay.md) | 3 | `howtoplay` | `movie_howtoplay` | `HowToPlayState` |\n| [`loading/`](loading/scripts/loading_cover_mc.md) | 12 | `loading` | `loading_cover_mc` / `loading_fight_mc` / `winner_stg_mc` | `GameLoadingState`、`LoadingState`、`WinnerState` |\n| [`select/`](select/scripts/stg_select.md) | 8 | `select` | `stg_select`（`SELECT`） | `SelectFighterStage` |\n| [`setting/`](setting/scripts/stg_set_ui.md) | 5 | `setting` | `stg_set_ui`（`SETTING`） | `SettingState` |\n| [`title/`](title/scripts/stg_title.md) | 3 | `title` | `stg_title`（`TITLE`） | `MenuState` |\n| **合计** | **73** | | | |\n\n```\nLogoState          → common_ui.logo_movie\nMenuState          → title.stg_title + MenuBtn(mc_wzbtn) 挂在 btnct\nHowToPlayState     → howtoplay.movie_howtoplay\nSelectFighterStage → select.stg_select + 格子/光标/已选条/地图\nSettingState       → setting.stg_set_ui + keyset_mc / key_set_dialog_mc\nGameLoadingState   → loading.loading_cover_mc\nLoadingState       → loading.loading_fight_mc（代码写 fight 库）+ SelectIndexUI\nGameState          → fight.ui_fight → FightUI / FightBar / QiBar / HitsUI\nGameOverState      → gameover.stg_gameover_mc + common_ui.select_arrow_mc\nWinnerState        → loading.winner_stg_mc（或 winner_stg_mc2）\nCongratulateState  → common_ui.mc_congratulations + mc_win_all\nStateCtrl          → common_ui.trans_mc（TransUI）\n```\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  RU[\"ResUtils 8 UI SWF → currentDomain\"] --> LOGO[\"LogoState logo_movie\"]\n  RU --> MENU[\"MenuState stg_title\"]\n  MENU --> BTN[\"MenuBtn mc_wzbtn\"]\n  MENU --> HTP[\"HowToPlayState movie_howtoplay\"]\n  HTP --> SEL[\"SelectFighterStage stg_select\"]\n  MENU --> SET[\"SettingState stg_set_ui\"]\n  SEL --> LD[\"LoadingState loading_fight_mc\"]\n  LD --> GS[\"GameState ui_fight\"]\n  GS --> HUD[\"FightBar / QiBar / HitsUI / startKOmc\"]\n  GS --> GO[\"GameOverState stg_gameover_mc\"]\n  GS --> WIN[\"WinnerState winner_stg_mc\"]\n  GS --> CONG[\"CongratulateState mc_congratulations\"]\n  RU --> TR[\"StateCtrl TransUI trans_mc\"]\n```\n\n## 共享模式\n\n### MenuBtn / 箭头 / 转场\n\n| 模式 | SWF 件 | 引擎 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| 主菜单钮 | `mc_wzbtn` + 嵌套 `wzimg_bgimg_5`（`bg` 两帧高亮） | [`MenuBtn`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/MenuBtn.md)：英文位图字藏掉，中文 `BitmapText` 才上屏 |\n| 公共箭头 | `common_ui.select_arrow_mc` | `GameOverState`、`SetBtnGroup` |\n| 出战序箭头 | `loading.select_arrow_mc_1/2`（引擎从 `select` 取名） | [`SelectIndexUI`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/select/SelectIndexUI.md) |\n| 转场遮罩 | `trans_mc` 标签 `fadin` / `fadout` / `stop` | [`TransUI`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/TransUI.md) **不听** COMPLETE，自己 `nextFrame` |\n| 设置左右三角 | `txt_arrow_mc` | [`SetBtn`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/SetBtn.md) 两枚，右箭头 `scaleX=-1` |\n\n### 条 / 脸槽\n\n| 模式 | SWF | 引擎 |\n|------|-----|------|\n| 顶栏 | `hpbar_mc`：`face1/2` + `bar1/2` + `energy1/2` + `timemc` + `win_p1/p2` + `scoremc` | [`FightBar`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md)。F25/F46 `COMPLETE` ↔ `fadin_fin` / `fadout_fin` |\n| HP | `hpbar_barmc.bar` 绿 + `redbar` 拖尾 | [`FighterHpBar`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FighterHpBar.md) |\n| 体力（不是气） | `energy_bar` | [`EnergyBar`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md)。`comicType` 切死神/火影字 |\n| 气 + 辅助 | `qbar_mc`：`barmc` 三格+满格、`fzqibar`、`facemc`、`readymc` | [`QiBar`](../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/QiBar.md)。脸是 **Assister** |\n","total_lines":266}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-cab930dc-0e0e-4adc-9c66-c72f410ac84b-6","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"1→# 角色 SWF line-by-line 总索引 — `decompiled/fighters`\n\n壳：[`../shell/00-INDEX.md`](../shell/00-INDEX.md)。引擎 `net.play5d`：[`../engine/00-INDEX.md`](../engine/00-INDEX.md)（A–D 已闭合）。\n\n本目录注 **角色 / 助战 SWF 时间轴**（`decompiled/fighters/**/scripts/**.as`）。镜像路径：`decompiled/fighters/` 之后原样换成 `.md`。不改 `decompiled/`。UI SWF 见 [`../ui/00-INDEX.md`](../ui/00-INDEX.md)（已闭合）。\n\n**状态：Batch A–G done。主战花名册闭合。UI SWF（`decompiled/ui/**`）已注。`decompiled/other/effect/**` 仍 pending，不要开始 effect。**\n\n对照总表（非逐行）：[`../../03-fighters.md`](../../03-fighters.md)。XML：`extracted/assets/config/fighter.xml`、`assist.xml`。\n10→\n## 批次\n\n| 批 | 范围 | `.as` | 索引 | 状态 |\n|----|------|------|------|------|\n| A | `aizen` `byakuya` `chad` `didala` + 全部 `fz/**` 助战 | 73 | [`00-BATCH-A-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-A-INDEX.md) | **done** |\n| B | `gaara` `grimmjow` `ichigo` `ichigo_zero` | 67 | [`00-BATCH-B-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-B-INDEX.md) | **done** |\n| C | `ikkaku` `itachi` `jiraiya` `juggo` `kakashi` `kakashi_sw` `karin` | 62 | [`00-BATCH-C-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-C-INDEX.md) | **done** |\n| D | `kenpachi` `kenshin` `killerbee` `konan` `lee` `madara` `mayuri` | 63 | [`00-BATCH-D-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-D-INDEX.md) | **done** |\n| E | `naruto` `naruto_xr` `neji` `obito` `orihime` | 67 | [`00-BATCH-E-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-E-INDEX.md) | **done** |\n20→| F | `orochimaru` `pain` `renji` `rukia` `sakura` `sasuke` `sasuke_xz` | 68 | [`00-BATCH-F-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-F-INDEX.md) | **done** |\n| G | `sasuke_xz_old` `soifon` `temari` `toushirou` `ulquiorra` `uryuu` `yin` | 68 | [`00-BATCH-G-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-G-INDEX.md) | **done** |\n\n清单源：[`../_maps/fighters-batch-A-files.txt`](../_maps/fighters-batch-A-files.txt) … `fighters-batch-G-files.txt`。\n\n`fz/**` 全部收在 A 批（助战 SWF，MainTimeline 短）。G 收完主战花名册剩余目录（含遗留 `sasuke_xz_old`）。不要把 `fz/` 再注一遍。\n\n## 角色 SWF 怎么接到引擎\n\n```\n30→LoadingState + GameLoader\n  loadFighter  → new FighterMain(mc) + FighterVO\n  loadAssister → new Assister(mc)\nGameCtrl.addFighter\n  FighterMain.initlize\n    setFighterCtrler / setEffectCtrler / setFighterMcCtrler\n    gotoAndStop(startFrame+1)     // XML sf=1 → 时间轴 F2\n    initMc(this.mc)               // 动作 MC → FighterMC\n  之后每帧 FighterMcCtrler.render\n    时间轴 parent.$mc_ctrler.setAttack / fire / addAttacker …\n40→```\n\n助战不走 `FighterMain`：`Assister` 构造就 `setAssistCtrler`；满 `fzqi` 才 `goFight()` 从第 2 帧播。\n\nA 批模式备忘（AI 面 / 全动作 / face / hurt sound）写在 [`00-BATCH-A-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-A-INDEX.md)。B 批（我爱罗 / 葛力姆乔 / 一护四形态 / 零段三形态）写在 [`00-BATCH-B-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-B-INDEX.md)。C 批（一角 / 鼬 / 自来也 / 重吾 / 卡卡西 / 神威 / 香磷）写在 [`00-BATCH-C-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-C-INDEX.md)。D 批（剑八 / 剑心两形态 / 奇拉比 / 小南 / 小李两形态 / 斑 / 涅茧利）写在 [`00-BATCH-D-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-D-INDEX.md)。E 批（鸣人三形态 / 仙人黄金 / 宁次 / 带土两形态 / 织姬）写在 [`00-BATCH-E-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-E-INDEX.md)。F 批（大蛇丸 / 佩恩 / 恋次 / 露琪亚两形态 / 樱 / 佐助两形态 / 须佐能乎）写在 [`00-BATCH-F-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-F-INDEX.md)。G 批（须佐旧档 / 碎蜂 / 手鞠 / 东狮郎两形态 / 乌尔奇奥拉两形态 / 雨龙 / 银）写在 [`00-BATCH-G-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-G-INDEX.md)。\n\n## 尚未开始\n\n- `decompiled/other/effect/**`（下一批；不要在 UI 批里开始）\n- 不要把 `fz/` 或主战 A–G 再注一遍\n50→- 不要把 `decompiled/ui/**` 再注一遍\n"}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"ReadFile","FileContent":{"content":"1→# 角色 SWF line-by-line 总索引 — `decompiled/fighters`\n\n壳：[`../shell/00-INDEX.md`](../shell/00-INDEX.md)。引擎 `net.play5d`：[`../engine/00-INDEX.md`](../engine/00-INDEX.md)（A–D 已闭合）。\n\n本目录注 **角色 / 助战 SWF 时间轴**（`decompiled/fighters/**/scripts/**.as`）。镜像路径：`decompiled/fighters/` 之后原样换成 `.md`。不改 `decompiled/`。UI SWF 见 [`../ui/00-INDEX.md`](../ui/00-INDEX.md)（已闭合）。\n\n**状态：Batch A–G done。主战花名册闭合。UI SWF（`decompiled/ui/**`）已注。`decompiled/other/effect/**` 仍 pending，不要开始 effect。**\n\n对照总表（非逐行）：[`../../03-fighters.md`](../../03-fighters.md)。XML：`extracted/assets/config/fighter.xml`、`assist.xml`。\n10→\n## 批次\n\n| 批 | 范围 | `.as` | 索引 | 状态 |\n|----|------|------|------|------|\n| A | `aize