,46,115,119,102,47,229,173,151,228,189,147,47,232,132,184,229,155,190,239,188,137,227,128,130,10,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],"stderr":[],"exit_code":0,"match_count":46,"file_matches":[{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/00-BATCH-D-INDEX.md","matches":[{"line_number":22,"content":"  → KyoClassLoader.addSwf(effect.swf)"},{"line_number":98,"content":"| `KyoClassLoader.addSwf` / `getClass` | 活。effect.swf |"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/kyo/loader/KyoClassLoader.md","matches":[{"line_number":3,"content":"一句话目的：按 URL/id 存 `ApplicationDomain`，`getClass(name, swfId)` 取出导出类。`AssetManager` **不用 `load()`**，effect.swf 由 `IAssetLoader.loadSwf` 拉完再 `addSwf`。"},{"line_number":11,"content":"  - `loadGraphics` 完成：`_swfLoader.addSwf(curUrl, loader)`（`curUrl` 为 `\"assets/effect.swf\"`）"},{"line_number":12,"content":"  - `getEffect(className)`：`_swfLoader.getClass(param1, \"assets/effect.swf\")` 再 `new`"},{"line_number":31,"content":"`AssetManager.getEffect` 显式传 `\"assets/effect.swf\"`，不靠 default。ZIP 路径必须与 `addSwf` 的 id 逐字相同。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/00-BATCH-B-INDEX.md","matches":[{"line_number":19,"content":"  → EffectModel.initlize          // effect.swf 已在 loadBasic 里"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/00-BATCH-C-INDEX.md","matches":[{"line_number":222,"content":"`EffectManager.getEffectView` 按 VO 旗互斥：`isSpecial` → `SpecialEffectView`；`isBuff` → `BuffEffectView`；`isSteelHit` → `SteelHitEffect`；否则 `EffectView`。闪光另池 `ShineEffectView`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md","matches":[{"line_number":33,"content":"ZIP (ZipCtrler / ZipAssetLoader)  →  fighter / map / XML / BGM / effect.swf"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/utils/EffectManager.md","matches":[{"line_number":9,"content":"- **Callers**：仅 `EffectCtrl`。`initlize` 里 `new EffectManager()`（L143）；`destory` 转调本类 `destory`（L124）；`doHitEffect` → `getEffectVOByHitVO`（L321）；`addEffect` → `getEffectView`（L500）；`shine` → `getShine`（L585）。"},{"line_number":22,"content":"`_viewCache` 的 key 是 **EffectVO 对象引用**（`Dictionary`），不是 `className`。`getEffectVOByHitVO` 每次 clone 新 VO，因此每种 HitVO 实例对应一条独立池。"},{"line_number":40,"content":"### `getEffectVOByHitVO`（L45–71）"},{"line_number":50,"content":"### `getEffectView`（L73–114）"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BishaFaceEffectView.md","matches":[{"line_number":3,"content":"一句话目的：从 `effect.swf` 取出 `bisha_face_mc`，把角色 SWF 导出的脸图塞进左右槽 `facemc1`/`facemc2`，再从第 2 帧播入场。只被 `BlackBackView.showBishaFace` 创建。"},{"line_number":13,"content":"  - `AssetManager.I.getEffect(\"bisha_face_mc\")`：每次 `new` 一个 MC 实例（`effect.swf` 符号 `symbol926`）。"},{"line_number":32,"content":"`mc = AssetManager.I.getEffect(\"bisha_face_mc\")`。`getEffect` 对每个名字 `new Class()`，这里每次必杀第一张脸都是新 MC。找不到符号则 `new null()` 炸。必须在 `effect.swf` 预载之后（`MainGame.loadGameBack` → `EffectModel.initlize` 同一批资源）。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BuffEffectView.md","matches":[{"line_number":9,"content":"- **工厂**：`EffectManager.getEffectView`：`isSpecial` 之后、`isSteelHit` 之前，`isBuff` → `new BuffEffectView(vo)`。池 key 是 EffectVO 引用。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SteelHitEffect.md","matches":[{"line_number":9,"content":"- **工厂**：`EffectManager.getEffectView`：非 special、非 buff、`isSteelHit` → `new SteelHitEffect(vo)`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SpecialEffectView.md","matches":[{"line_number":9,"content":"- **工厂**：`EffectManager.getEffectView` **最先**看 `isSpecial` → `new SpecialEffectView(vo)`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/MainGame.md","matches":[{"line_number":65,"content":"3. **`loadGameBack`**（L94–101）：`EffectModel.I.initlize()` 从 effect.swf 建特效表，然后调 `initBack`。壳在这里挂 `enterFrame`，等到 `isInTop` 再 `goLogo()`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/views/effects/EffectView.md","matches":[{"line_number":9,"content":"- **工厂**：`EffectManager.getEffectView(vo)`：池里找 `!isActive`，否则按旗 new 子类，最后才 `new EffectView(vo)`。池 key = **EffectVO 对象引用**（命中路径是 clone 后的 VO，每种 HitVO 实例一条池）。"},{"line_number":16,"content":"- **Callees**：`EffectCtrl.EFFECT_SMOOTHING`；`SoundCtrl.I.playEffectSound`；`KyoMath.asRadians` / `getPointByRadians`。"},{"line_number":32,"content":"getEffectView(vo)"},{"line_number":74,"content":"不 `start`。池里 new 出来 `isActive` 已是 true，要等 `start` 才真正播；`getEffectView` 只认 `isActive==false` 才复用，所以刚 new、还没 start 的不会被别人拿走（单线程）。"},{"line_number":93,"content":"6. VO.`sound` → `SoundCtrl.I.playEffectSound`。每次 start 都 new 一个 effect.swf 里的 Sound 播一遍，无法 stop。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/fighter/models/HitVO.md","matches":[{"line_number":10,"content":"- **clone**：`Bullet.setHitVO`、`FighterAttackerCtrler.fire`（改 `owner` 为子弹/Attacker）。`EffectManager.getEffectVOByHitVO` clone 的是 `EffectVO` 不是本类。"},{"line_number":14,"content":"- **hitType**：`EffectManager.getEffectVOByHitVO` → `EffectModel.getHitEffect(hitType)`。整型对应 `data.HitType` 常量。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/data/EffectModel.md","matches":[{"line_number":3,"content":"一句话目的：启动时把全部战斗特效登记成 `EffectVO` 并 `cacheBitmapData`。运行时 `EffectCtrl` / `EffectManager` 只通过 `getEffect` / `getHitEffect` / `getDefenseEffect` 取模板（命中特效还会被 `EffectManager` clone 一份改 shake）。"},{"line_number":10,"content":"  - `MainGame.initlize` 的 `loadGameBack`：配表 + `loadBasic`（含 `effect.swf`）完成之后 `EffectModel.I.initlize()`。必须在 `getEffect` 能取到 MC 之后，否则烘焙 NPE。"},{"line_number":11,"content":"  - `EffectCtrl`：`getEffect(id)`（`doEffectById`、必杀/替身/爆气/鬼步/buff/钢体、`doSpecialEffect`、`doBuffEffect`）；`getDefenseEffect(hitType)`。"},{"line_number":12,"content":"  - `EffectManager.getEffectVOByHitVO`：`getHitEffect(hitVO.hitType)`，没有则缓存 null。"},{"line_number":32,"content":"| `getEffect(id)` | 按字符串 id |"},{"line_number":44,"content":"先登记全部 VO，再逐条光栅化。只应调一次；再调会丢旧表、重新 `getEffect` 再画一遍（旧 BitmapData 不 dispose）。"},{"line_number":135,"content":"这些 id 也是普通 `getEffect` 能取到的；由 hit 7/8/9 的 `specialEffectId` 触发。"},{"line_number":162,"content":"### `getEffect`（L381–384）"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/data/EffectVO.md","matches":[{"line_number":3,"content":"一句话目的：描述一个可播放特效。`className` 是 `effect.swf` 里的 MC 符号；其它字段是命中时要触发的副作用。`cacheBitmapData` 把整段 MC 光栅化成 `BitmapDataCacheVO` 序列，运行时 `EffectView` 只播位图、不再实例化 MC。"},{"line_number":10,"content":"  - `EffectModel`：`initEffects` / `addHitEffect` / `addDefenseEffect` `new EffectVO(className, props)`；`initlize` 末尾对表里每一条 `cacheBitmapData`；`getEffect`/`getHitEffect`/`getDefenseEffect` 返回本对象。"},{"line_number":11,"content":"  - `EffectManager.getEffectVOByHitVO`：按 `HitVO` 克隆一份，改 `shake.y` 后缓存；`getEffectView` 按 `isSpecial`/`isBuff`/`isSteelHit` 选 `SpecialEffectView`/`BuffEffectView`/`SteelHitEffect`/`EffectView`。"},{"line_number":15,"content":"- **Callees**：`AssetManager.I.getEffect(className)`、`KyoUtils.setValueByObject` / `itemToObject`、`BitmapData`/`Matrix`/`Rectangle`、`BitmapDataCacheVO`。"},{"line_number":19,"content":"- `className`：SWF 导出名，大小写混用（`XG_bs` vs `xg_hitover`），必须与 `effect.swf` 一致。"},{"line_number":30,"content":"| `className` | `AssetManager.getEffect` 的符号名 |"},{"line_number":34,"content":"| `sound` | `SoundCtrl.playEffectSound` 的 id |"},{"line_number":60,"content":"2. `AssetManager.I.getEffect(className)` 取出 MC，`gotoAndStop(1)`。"},{"line_number":73,"content":"`getEffect` 找不到符号会在这里炸（? `AssetManager` 返回 null 则 NPE）。必须在 `effect.swf` 预载完成之后调，对应 `MainGame` 的 `loadGameBack` → `EffectModel.initlize`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterAttackerCtrler.md","matches":[{"line_number":10,"content":"- **主人绑定**：`FighterAttacker.setOwner`：主人是 `FighterMain` → `effect = owner.getCtrler().getEffectCtrl()`；是 `Assister` → `effect = owner.getCtrler().effect`。**共用主人特效实例**，不是自己 new。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/data/GameData.md","matches":[{"line_number":65,"content":"任一段失败：`Debugger.log` 中文，若 `fail != null` 再调。不继续后续 XML。全部成功才 `back()`。`GameLoadingState` 成功后再 `AssetManager.loadBasic`（音效/effect.swf/字体/脸图）。"}]}]},"locations":[]}
