3,76,111,103,105,99,66,97,115,101,46,109,100,10,56,51,58,96,116,104,105,115,91,105,100,93,96,32,228,190,157,232,181,150,229,173,144,231,177,187,230,138,138,230,139,155,229,188,143,229,144,141,229,129,154,230,136,144,32,42,42,112,117,98,108,105,99,32,229,173,151,230,174,181,42,42,239,188,136,96,97,116,116,97,99,107,96,47,96,115,107,105,108,108,49,96,47,96,98,105,115,104,97,96,226,128,166,239,188,137,227,128,130,229,159,186,231,177,187,232,135,170,229,183,177,230,178,161,230,156,137,232,191,153,228,186,155,229,173,151,230,174,181,227,128,130,10,10,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,47,98,118,110,45,51,46,51,47,114,101,118,101,114,115,101,47,108,105,110,101,45,98,121,45,108,105,110,101,47,101,110,103,105,110,101,47,103,97,109,101,47,98,118,110,47,102,105,103,104,116,101,114,47,99,116,114,108,101,114,47,70,105,103,104,116,101,114,75,101,121,67,116,114,108,46,109,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],"stderr":[],"exit_code":0,"match_count":23,"file_matches":[{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md","matches":[{"line_number":12,"content":"- **时间轴脑不在本文件**：`FighterMcCtrler`（2234 行）经 `_fighterCtrl.getMcCtrl()` 调本类的 `jump`/`addQi`/`useQi`/`useEnergy`/`hasEnergy`/`loseHp`（经 `beHit` 链）/`replaceSkill`/`energyExplode`/`clearHurtHits`/`currentHurtDamage`/`hurtBreakHit`/`getLastHurtHitVO`/`actionState`/`isSteelBody` 等。"},{"line_number":71,"content":"- `_replaceSkillFrame`：替身无敌剩余动画帧。"},{"line_number":151,"content":"5. `_replaceSkillFrame`：到 0 恢复可挨打。"},{"line_number":222,"content":"### `energyExplode`（L569–583）"},{"line_number":224,"content":"`EffectCtrl.energyExplode`；立刻超钢体。`new HitVO`：区域 `(-100,-200,200,210)` 经 `getCurrentRect` 变世界盒；`power=50`、`hitx=15*direct`、`hitType=5`、`hurtType=1`（击飞）。窗 10 动画帧，钢体 60 帧，期间 `isAllowBeHit=false`。`getCurrentHits` 在后 8 帧吐这个 VO。火影受身（`comicType!=1`）走这条。"},{"line_number":226,"content":"### `replaceSkill`（L585–595）"},{"line_number":228,"content":"特效 `replaceSkill`；`move(250*direct)` 瞬移；`idle()`；无敌；**立刻** `super.render()` + `renderAnimate()` 把位移和站立帧套上；`setDirectToTarget` 转身；30 动画帧后恢复可挨打。死神受身（`comicType==1`）。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterActionState.md","matches":[{"line_number":10,"content":"  - `FighterMcCtrler`：idle=0、freeze=40、attack=10、skill=11、bisha=12、超必=13、跳=14、冲=15、hurtAct=16、防=20、被打=21、击飞=22、开场=60、胜利=61、失败=62、万解=50。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/fighter/vos/FighterBuffVO.md","matches":[{"line_number":12,"content":"  - `EffectCtrl.doBuffEffect(name, fighter, this)`：给 `BuffEffectView.setBuff`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterAction.md","matches":[{"line_number":19,"content":"- `zhao*` = 招式键 skill 系；`bisha*` = 必杀；`bishaSUPERQi` 默认 300，其余气耗默认 100。"},{"line_number":50,"content":"| `bisha`/`bishaUP`/`bishaSUPER` | 必杀三路 | `bisha*` |"},{"line_number":53,"content":"| `attackAIR`/`skillAIR`/`bishaAIR` | 空中三路 | `*AIR` |"},{"line_number":58,"content":"- `bishaQi=100`、`bishaUPQi=100`、`bishaSUPERQi=300`、`bishaAIRQi=100`：`McCtrler.setBisha*(frame, qi)` 覆盖。`doBisha` 走 `FighterMain.useQi`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterBuffCtrler.md","matches":[{"line_number":16,"content":"- **Callees**：`FighterBuffVO`（`param2` 秒 × `FPS_GAME` 成帧）、`EffectCtrl.doEffectById` / `doBuffEffect`。动态 `_fighter[paramName]` 读写。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/ai/FighterAILogic.md","matches":[{"line_number":9,"content":"- **唯一调用**：`FighterAICtrl`。`initlize` `new FighterAILogic(AILevel, fighter)`；`renderAnimate` → `render()`；各 `moveLEFT/attack/bisha/…` 直接读对应 public 字段。"},{"line_number":35,"content":"**粘滞（?）**：`specialSkill`、`ghostStep` 早退路径不置 false，一旦变 true 可能一直保持到对象销毁。`ghostJump`/`ghostJumpDowm` 同样。"},{"line_number":45,"content":"进攻：`attack/attackAIR/skillAIR/bishaAIR/skill1/skill2/zhao1/zhao2/zhao3/catch1/catch2/bisha/bishaUP/bishaSUPER/assist/specialSkill/ghostStep/ghostJump/ghostJumpDowm`。"},{"line_number":141,"content":"**public**（基类其它 update 都是 private）。四招：`bisha/bs/bsmian` qi100 order100；`bishaUP/sbs/sbsmian` qi100 order100；`bishaSUPER/cbs/cbsmian` qi300 order200；`bishaAIR/kbs/kbsmian` qi100 order210。"},{"line_number":175,"content":"`ghostStep`：`defult` 全 0，仅目标 21 受击 `[0,0,0,0,0.1,0.2]`。"},{"line_number":177,"content":"`ghostJump`：目标相对 y 在 `(-100, -80)`（目标在上方约一跳）时建了 `_loc4_` 表，但调用 `getAIByFighterState(_loc1_)`——**用的是 ghostStep 那张表不是 `_loc4_`**（?）。否则 `ghostJump=false`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/AssisiterCtrler.md","matches":[{"line_number":11,"content":"- **SWF 高频 API**（`decompiled/fighters/fz/*/scripts/*_fla/MainTimeline.as`）：`defineAction`、`effect.bisha/endBisha/shine/dash/slowDown`、`move`/`damping`/`moveToTarget`/`setDirectToTarget`、`justHit`、`setHitTarget`、`fire`、`addAttacker`、`checkHitOwner`、`endAct`、`finish`、`setApplyG`。夜一/sai 经 `getOwner().getBuffCtrl()` 给主人上 buff。"},{"line_number":34,"content":"返回 `_effectCtrl`。SWF 写 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha(false)` 等。未 `initAssister` 则 null。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/ai/FighterAILogicBase.md","matches":[{"line_number":83,"content":"`this[id]` 依赖子类把招式名做成 **public 字段**（`attack`/`skill1`/`bisha`…）。基类自己没有这些字段。"}]}]},"locations":[]}
