{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-633d42d2-265b-4617-89d8-9280db6831bb-60","title":"write","kind":"write","status":"pending","toolName":"write","rawInput":{"file_path":"/tmp/gen_effect_md.py","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"Generate line-by-line Chinese annotations for effect.swf scripts.\"\"\"\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nOUT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/effect\")\nSRC_ROOT = \"decompiled/other/effect/scripts\"\n\nE_CTRL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/EffectCtrl.md\"\nE_MGR = \"../../engine/game/bvn/utils/EffectManager.md\"\nE_VO = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectVO.md\"\nE_MODEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectModel.md\"\nE_VIEW = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/EffectView.md\"\nE_SPEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SpecialEffectView.md\"\nE_BUFF = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BuffEffectView.md\"\nE_STEEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SteelHitEffect.md\"\nE_FACE = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BishaFaceEffectView.md\"\nE_BLACK = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BlackBackView.md\"\nE_FEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterEffectCtrl.md\"\nE_SND = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/SoundCtrl.md\"\nE_AM = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/AssetManager.md\"\nE_HIT = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/HitType.md\"\n\n# SWF sprite metadata: name -> (char_id, frames, places, labels)\nSPRITES = {\n    \"xg_ice_ing\": (48, 26, 12, [(\"F5\", \"loop\"), (\"F6\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_fire_ing\": (73, 25, 12, [(\"F12\", \"loop\"), (\"F13\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\": (104, 23, 15, [(\"F8\", \"loop\"), (\"F9\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing\": (131, 21, 13, [(\"F6\", \"loop\"), (\"F7\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_buff_speed\": (140, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_power\": (141, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\": (158, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\": (159, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\": (160, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_defense\": (161, 8, 4, []),\n    \"XG_jump_air\": (172, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_jump\": (181, 10, 4, []),\n    \"XG_luodi\": (196, 10, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitover\": (217, 24, 10, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\": (246, 18, 14, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\": (261, 14, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\": (280, 18, 9, []),\n    \"XG_ghost_step\": (313, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\": (336, 11, 11, []),\n    \"XG_rush_air\": (365, 22, 14, []),\n    \"XG_rush\": (386, 20, 10, []),\n    \"xg_catch_hit\": (397, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_xdash\": (446, 25, 24, []),\n    \"XG_tishen2\": (467, 18, 10, []),\n    \"XG_tishen\": (470, 35, 25, []),\n    \"XG_kanx2\": (507, 17, 18, []),\n    \"XG_kanx\": (508, 21, 10, []),\n    \"XG_kan2\": (519, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_kan\": (532, 12, 6, []),\n    \"XG_hitfloor\": (543, 13, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyqx\": (554, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyq\": (571, 10, 9, []),\n    \"XG_fykanx\": (602, 19, 15, []),\n    \"XG_fykan\": (603, 15, 7, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx2\": (634, 13, 15, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx\": (651, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_qdj\": (662, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_mffyx\": (663, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_mffy\": (678, 11, 7, []),\n    \"XG_mfdjx\": (679, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_mfdj\": (690, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_leidian\": (701, 12, 5, []),\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\": (712, 5, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice2\": (743, 22, 15, []),\n    \"XG_ice_fy\": (754, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice\": (765, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\": (776, 12, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fzbs\": (787, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fire_fy\": (802, 15, 8, []),\n    \"XG_fire\": (825, 23, 11, []),\n    \"XG_dian_fy\": (828, 16, 8, []),\n    \"XG_cbs\": (841, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bs\": (842, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bsq\": (875, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_bdj\": (894, 9, 9, []),\n    \"XG_baoqi\": (911, 15, 8, []),\n    \"bisha_face_mc\": (926, 71, 168, [(\"F71\", \"destory\")]),\n}\n\n# sounds: name -> (char_id, embed_file, samples, rate_code, datalen)\n# rate 1=11025, 2=22050\nSOUNDS = {\n    \"snd_xdash\": (1, \"1_snd_xdash.mp3\", 25144, 2, 4994),\n    \"snd_fykan\": (2, \"2_snd_fykan.mp3\", 13750, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_hit2\": (3, \"3_snd_hit2.mp3\", 16128, 2, 3434),\n    \"snd_cbs\": (4, \"4_snd_cbs.mp3\", 29952, 2, 6769),\n    \"snd_fzbs\": (5, \"5_snd_fzbs.mp3\", 20160, 2, 4559),\n    \"snd_mfdjx\": (6, \"6_snd_mfdjx.mp3\", 9216, 1, 1673),\n    \"snd_jump\": (7, \"7_snd_jump.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_bs\": (8, \"8_snd_bs.mp3\", 13248, 1, 2401),\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\": (9, \"9_snd_hit_heavy.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_fz\": (10, \"10_snd_fz.mp3\", 8992, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit_dian\": (11, \"11_snd_hit_dian.mp3\", 17792, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_baoqi1\": (12, \"12_snd_baoqi1.mp3\", 21572, 2, 4370),\n    \"snd_hit_ice\": (13, \"13_snd_hit_ice.mp3\", 32128, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_def\": (14, \"14_snd_def.mp3\", 13824, 2, 3129),\n    \"snd_hit_fire\": (15, \"15_snd_hit_fire.mp3\", 51350, 2, 9778),\n    \"snd_hitfloor\": (16, \"16_snd_hitfloor.mp3\", 26262, 2, 5202),\n    \"snd_luodi\": (17, \"17_snd_luodi.mp3\", 3990, 2, 1250),\n    \"snd_dash_air\": (18, \"18_snd_dash_air.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\": (19, \"19_snd_hitfloor_heavy.mp3\", 33888, 2, 6450),\n    \"snd_dash\": (20, \"20_snd_dash.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_ghost_step\": (21, \"21_snd_ghost_step.mp3\", 15968, 2, 3330),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\": (22, \"22_snd_hitfloor_low.mp3\", 15296, 2, 3226),\n    \"snd_hit1\": (23, \"23_snd_hit1.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_baoqi\": (24, \"24_snd_baoqi.mp3\", 31505, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_hit_cache\": (25, \"25_snd_hit_cache.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_defx\": (26, \"26_snd_defx.mp3\", 14842, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_kan1\": (27, \"27_snd_kan1.mp3\", 7423, 2, 1874),\n    \"snd_fykanx\": (28, \"28_snd_fykanx.mp3\", 29951, 2, 5930),\n    \"snd_kan2\": (29, \"29_snd_kan2.mp3\", 9024, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit10\": (30, \"30_snd_hit10.mp3\", 10368, 2, 2394),\n    \"snd_hit11\": (31, \"31_snd_hit11.mp3\", 30848, 2, 6034),\n}\n\nRATE_HZ = {1: 11025, 2: 22050}\n\n\ndef dur(samples, rate):\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    ms = samples / hz * 1000\n    return f\"{ms:.0f} ms（{samples} samples / {hz} Hz）\"\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# MovieClip catalog\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# each: title, purpose, hook (markdown), extra (optional extra sections)\n\nMCS = {}\n\n\ndef add_mc(name, title, purpose, hook, extra=None, unused=False, vo_ids=None, view=\"EffectView\"):\n    MCS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"extra\": extra or \"\",\n        \"unused\": unused,\n        \"vo_ids\": vo_ids or [],\n        \"view\": view,\n    }\n\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸段火花\",\n    \"爆气演出后半段（`explodeSp2`）的爆炸剪辑。黑底结束时在角色原坐标播一次。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) 登记 id `explodeSp2`，`className=XG_baoqi`，`sound=snd_baoqi`。启动时 [`EffectVO.cacheBitmapData`]({vo}) 经 [`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) `new` 本类，逐帧光栅化后丢掉 MC。\n\n运行时 [`EffectCtrl.endEnergyExplode`]({ctrl})（`energyExplode` 倒数 0.7s 到期）`doEffectById(\"explodeSp2\")` → [`EffectManager.getEffectView`]({mgr}) 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。触发链：角色 SWF / [`FighterMain.energyExplode`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) → `$effect_ctrler.energyExplode` → [`FighterEffectCtrl`]({fec})。\n\n无 `isSpecial`/`isBuff`/`isSteelHit`。无 `blendMode`（默认 `normal`）。无 freeze/shine/shake。\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, vo=E_VO, am=E_AM, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, fec=E_FEC\n    ),\n    extra=\"前半段是 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md)（`explodeSp` + `snd_baoqi1`）。两段坐标都是调用瞬间的 fighter x/y。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bdj\",\n    \"遗留「绊打击」火花（未登记）\",\n    \"effect.swf 导出的短命中剪辑。`EffectModel` **没有**用这个 `className`。像早期普攻火花，被 `XG_qdj` / `XG_kan2` 取代。\",\n    \"\"\"[`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) 仍能按名 `new` 本类，但 [`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) / `initHitEffect` 从未写入 `_effect`。`doEffectById` / `getHitEffect` 都走不到。启动 `cacheEffects` 也不烘焙本剪辑。\n\n命名：`bdj` ≈ 绊打击。9 帧、每帧都有 Place，比现行轻拳 `XG_qdj`（12 帧）更短。\"\"\".format(am=E_AM, model=E_MODEL),\n    unused=True,\n    extra=\"同类遗留：[`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md)、[`XG_kanx`](XG_kanx.md)、[`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md)、[`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md)、[`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bs\",\n    \"必杀黑底火花\",\n    \"普通必杀（非超必）时在角色头顶偏上播的 add 混合火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha`：`className=XG_bs`，`sound=snd_bs`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.bisha(false, face?)`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.bisha`]({ctrl})：justRenderAnimate + pause + 黑底 + 可选 [`bisha_face_mc`](bisha_face_mc.md) 特写 + 本剪辑在 `(x, y-50)` + 藏地图。超必走 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md)（`bisha_super`），不走本类。\n\n万解 `wanKai` **不用**本类，强制 `bisha_super`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bsq\",\n    \"爆气起手火花\",\n    \"爆气/霸体爆发的前半段（`explodeSp`）。pause + 黑底期间先播这一段。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `explodeSp`：`XG_bsq` + `snd_baoqi1`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.energyExplode`]({ctrl})：pause、黑底（不 fadIn）、藏地图、在 fighter 坐标 `doEffectById(\"explodeSp\")`，然后 `_explodeSkillFrame = 0.7 * FPS_GAME`。到期 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md)。\n\n角色侧同时开超钢体、造 `HitVO`（power 50, hitType 5, 击飞）。本剪辑本身无 freeze/shine。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花\",\n    \"超必杀与万解共用的 add 火花。镜头 zoom 3.5 时播在 `(x, y-50)`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha_super`：`XG_cbs` + `snd_cbs` + `blendMode=add`。\n\n两条入口都到 [`EffectCtrl`]({ctrl})：\n\n- `$effect_ctrler.bisha(true, face?)` → `bisha(..., super=true)` → `cameraFocusOne` zoom 3.5 + 本剪辑\n- `$effect_ctrler.startWanKai(face?)` → `wanKai`：永远当超必，同样本剪辑\n\n普通必杀 `bisha(false)` 用 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md)，不用本类。时间轴长度与 `XG_bs` 同为 17 帧（FLA 里超必/必杀像同一套放大）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_dian_fy\",\n    \"电属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住电属性（hitType 9）时的防御火花。朝向跟攻击者。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initDefenseEffect`]({model}) `defense_9`：`XG_dian_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400ms，`blendMode=add`，`followDirect=true`，电色闪 `0x8288D2` alpha 0.2，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.doDefenseEffect`]({ctrl})：角色 `defenseType==0` 用原始 hitType；`==1` 只把斩系 1→2、6→3，**电仍是 9**。无 `specialEffectId`：防住不挂 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。\n\n未知防御类型回落 `defense_5`（[`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)），不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中火花\",\n    \"火属性攻击打中时的命中火花，并给受击者挂持续燃烧 `fire_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initHitEffect`]({model}) hitType **7 FIRE**：`XG_fire`，`snd_hit_fire`，add，freeze 400，火色闪 `0xFFFF67`，shake pow 6，**`specialEffectId=fire_ing`**。\n\n命中链：`FighterMcCtrler.doHitEffect` → [`EffectCtrl.doHitEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`EffectManager.getEffectVOByHitVO`]({mgr}) clone 本 VO（把 `pow` 抄到 `shake.y`）→ 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。`doEffectVO` 末尾对 `FighterMain` 再 `doSpecialEffect(\"fire_ing\")` → [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) + [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})。\n\n防御命中走 [`XG_fire_fy`](XG_fire_fy.md)，不挂燃烧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, spec=E_SPEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire_fy\",\n    \"火属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住火属性时的防御火花。防住不挂燃烧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_7`：`XG_fire_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，火色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n无 `specialEffectId`。朝向用攻击者 `direct`（`EffectCtrl` + VO.`followDirect`）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻斩（hitType 1）时的短火花。轻防套餐：freeze 50ms、无闪无震。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_1`：`XG_fykan`，`snd_fykan`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1`（拳防角色）会把斩 1 改成拳 2，改播 [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)，看不到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重斩（hitType 6）时的重防火花。带白闪（shine 自带 `blendMode=screen`）和震屏。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_6`：`XG_fykanx`，`snd_fykanx`，freeze 400，add，shine 白 alpha 0.1 **且 shine.blendMode=screen**（其它重防 shine 没写 blend），`followDirect`，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n拳防角色把 6→3，改播 [`XG_fyqx`](XG_fyqx.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyq\",\n    \"轻拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻拳（hitType 2）时的短火花。也是斩→拳防映射的落点。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_2`：`XG_fyq`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1` 时轻斩也会落到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyqx\",\n    \"重拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重拳（hitType 3）时的重防火花。拳防角色挡重斩也走这里。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_3`：`XG_fyqx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 alpha 0.1，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\",\n    \"死神辅助出场火花\",\n    \"死神阵营（`comicType!=1`）助战进场时的短火花。声用 `snd_dash`（不是 `snd_fz`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_bleach`：`XG_fz_bleach_mc` + `snd_dash`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.assisterEffect`]({ctrl})：`comicType==1` → [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)，否则本类。`FighterEventCtrl.addAssister` 与 `AssisiterCtrler.finish` 调。\n\n助战 SWF 自己还会 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 等，那是另一套必杀黑底，不是本剪辑。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\",\n    \"火影辅助出场火花\",\n    \"火影阵营（`comicType==1`）助战进场火花。声用 `snd_fz`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_naruto`：`XG_fz_naruto_mc` + `snd_fz`。\n\n与死神出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 成对。替身 [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md) 也复用 `snd_fz`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀火花（未登记）\",\n    \"导出名像「辅助必杀」。`EffectModel` 未登记。配对音 [`snd_fzbs`](snd_fzbs.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"助战进场只用 `fz_bleach` / `fz_naruto`。助战时间轴若 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 走的是全局 `XG_bs`/`XG_cbs`，不是本类。\n\n10 帧短剪辑。启动不烘焙。\"\"\".format(),\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步残影火花\",\n    \"鬼步移动时脚下/身后的 add 火花。走路循环在鬼步状态下反复 `doEffectById`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ghost_step`：`XG_ghost_step`，`snd_ghost_step`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n两条声：**VO 的 `snd_ghost_step`** 在 `EffectView.start` 播；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`]({ctrl}) 另外 `SoundCtrl.playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（主 SWF 嵌入，不在本库）。\n\n触发：`$effect_ctrler.ghostStep` 开演出（pause + 黑底 + justRender 物理仍走）；之后 [`FighterEffectCtrl.walk`]({fec}) 若 `_inGhostStep` 则反复本 id，而不是 `step1/2/3` 脚步。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0 的着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor`：`XG_hitfloor` + `snd_hitfloor`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(0)`]({ctrl}) ← [`FighterEffectCtrl.hitFloor`]({fec})。强度 1 走 [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)；强度 2 走 [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md) **外加** [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 烟。\n\n主动落地（跳下）是 [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md) `touch_floor`，不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中火花\",\n    \"冰属性打中时的命中火花，并挂持续冰冻 `ice_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **8 ICE**：`XG_ice`，`snd_hit_ice`，add，`specialEffectId=ice_ing`，freeze 400，冰色闪 `0xA3E5F5`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_ice_ing`](xg_ice_ing.md)。遗留变体 [`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md) 未登记。防御走 [`XG_ice_fy`](XG_ice_fy.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice2\",\n    \"遗留冰击火花（未登记）\",\n    \"22 帧冰剪辑，比现行 [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)（11 帧）长一倍。`initHitEffect(8)` 用的是 `XG_ice`，本类不进表。\",\n    \"\"\"无 `EffectVO`、不烘焙、无声绑定。像旧版冰命中或另一套冰爆。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice_fy\",\n    \"冰属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住冰属性时的防御火花。防住不挂冰冻。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_8`：`XG_ice_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，冰色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump\",\n    \"起跳尘\",\n    \"地面起跳时脚下的尘。坐标用 **display** x/y，不是逻辑坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump`：`XG_jump` + `snd_jump`。无 add。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.jump`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.jumpEffect`]({ctrl})。空中二段跳走 [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)，共用 `snd_jump`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump_air\",\n    \"空中跳火花\",\n    \"空中再跳（二段跳）的 add 火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump_air`：`XG_jump_air`，`snd_jump`，`blendMode=add`。地面跳 [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md) 无 add。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.jumpAirEffect`]({ctrl})。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan\",\n    \"遗留轻斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧轻斩剪辑（12 帧）。现行 hitType 1 用 [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)（10 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initHitEffect(1, \"XG_kan2\", …)`。钢体斩也用 `XG_kan2`。本类不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan2\",\n    \"轻斩命中 / 钢体斩火花\",\n    \"轻斩（hitType 1）命中火花；钢体受斩复用同一剪辑、另一份 VO。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 [`EffectVO`]({vo}) 都 `className=XG_kan2`，`cacheEffects` **各烘焙一次**：\n\n| id | 用途 | 声 | freeze | 其它 |\n|----|------|----|--------|------|\n| `hit_1` | 普通轻斩 | `snd_kan1` | 50ms | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_kan` | 钢体挨斩 | `snd_hit11` | 400ms | add，白闪 0.2，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit`，**无 shake** |\n\n普通路径 [`EffectView`]({view})；钢体 [`SteelHitEffect`]({steel})（`setTarget` 改色，freeze 结束 `resumeColor`）。\n\n遗留 [`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md) 不用。\"\"\".format(vo=E_VO, view=E_VIEW, steel=E_STEEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx\",\n    \"遗留重斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧重斩（21 帧）。现行 hitType 6 用 [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"钢体没有单独的重斩 id，重斩打钢体仍按 hitType 走 `steel_hit_kan` → `XG_kan2`。本类完全闲置。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx2\",\n    \"重斩命中火花\",\n    \"重斩（hitType 6）命中火花。重击套餐：400ms freeze + 白闪 + 震屏 + 随机旋转。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **6 KAN_HEAVY**：`XG_kanx2`，`snd_kan2`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake `pow:6, time:400`（[`EffectManager`]({mgr}) 把 pow 抄到 `shake.y`）。\n\n无 `isSteelHit`。无 `specialEffectId`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, mgr=E_MGR),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_leidian\",\n    \"电属性命中火花\",\n    \"电属性打中时的命中火花（**hardlight** 混合），并挂持续感电 `shock_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **9 ELECTRIC**：`XG_leidian`，`snd_hit_dian`，**`blendMode=hardlight`**（命中表里唯一 hardlight），`specialEffectId=shock_ing`，freeze 400，电色闪 `0x8288D2`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。遗留 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 未用。防御 [`XG_dian_fy`](XG_dian_fy.md) 用 add 不是 hardlight。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地尘\",\n    \"自己跳下/落下触地的尘，不是受击砸地。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `touch_floor`：`XG_luodi` + `snd_luodi`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.touchFloor`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.touchFloorEffect`]({ctrl})。受击落地是 `hit_floor*`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdj\",\n    \"轻法命中 / 钢体法火花\",\n    \"轻法/忍术/鬼道（hitType 4）命中火花；钢体受法复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO，同 `className=XG_mfdj`，各烘焙一次：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_4` MAGIC | `snd_hit2`（和轻拳同一声） | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_mfdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n轻拳火花是 [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)，剪辑不同、声相同。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法命中 / 破防火花\",\n    \"重法（hitType 5）命中火花；破防 `break_def` **复用同一剪辑**、另一份 VO（freeze 更长、震的是 x 不是 pow）。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | shake | 其它 |\n|----|----|--------|-------|------|\n| `hit_5` MAGIC_HEAVY | `snd_mfdjx` | 400 | `pow:6, time:400` → 抄到 y | add，`randRotate`，白闪 0.2 |\n| `break_def` | `snd_mfdjx` | **500** | **`x:6, time:400`**（不是 pow） | add，**无** randRotate / shine |\n\n`FighterMcCtrler` 破防 `doEffectById(\"break_def\")`。爆气判定 hitType 也是 5，命中火花走 `hit_5` 这份，不是 break_def。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffy\",\n    \"轻法防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻法（hitType 4）时的短火花。声与轻拳防相同（`snd_def`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_4`：`XG_mffy`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffyx\",\n    \"重法防御火花 / 未知防御回落\",\n    \"挡住重法（hitType 5）时的重防火花。`getDefenseEffect` 对未登记类型（含抓 11）回落到本条。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_5`：`XG_mffyx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 **alpha 0.15**（其它重防 0.1，属性防 0.2），shake pow 6。\n\n`getDefenseEffect`：没有 `defense_N` 则用 `defense_5`。无 `defense_11`，抓技防住也会看到本火花。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdj\",\n    \"轻拳命中 / 钢体拳火花\",\n    \"轻拳/打击（hitType 2）命中火花；钢体挨打复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_2` DA | `snd_hit2` | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_qdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n遗留轻击声 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 未绑到任何 VO。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx\",\n    \"重拳命中火花\",\n    \"重拳（hitType 3）命中火花。重击套餐。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **3 DA_HEAVY**：`XG_qdjx`，`snd_hit_heavy`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n遗留 [`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md) 未用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx2\",\n    \"遗留重拳火花（未登记）\",\n    \"13 帧重拳变体。现行 hitType 3 用 [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"无 VO。命名 `qdjx2` 与斩系 `kan2`/`kanx2`「第二版」同一套替换习惯，但这条没切过去。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush\",\n    \"地面冲刺残影\",\n    \"地面 dash 时的残影剪辑。声绑的是 **`snd_dash_air`**，不是 `snd_dash`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash`：`XG_rush`，`sound=snd_dash_air`（地面/空中冲刺共用空中声）。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.dash`]({fec})：不在空中 → 本 id；在空中 → [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。`snd_dash` 实际给死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush_air\",\n    \"空中冲刺残影\",\n    \"空中 dash 残影。与地面冲刺共用 `snd_dash_air`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash_air`：`XG_rush_air` + `snd_dash_air`。22 帧，比地面 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md)（20 帧）略长。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen\",\n    \"替身第一段\",\n    \"死神受身/替身演出的第一段火花。pause + 黑底时立刻播在**位移前**的坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp`：`XG_tishen` + `snd_fz`（和火影辅助出场同一声）。\n\n[`FighterMain.replaceSkill`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) 先 `move(250*direct)`、idle、无敌；[`EffectCtrl.replaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再 pause、黑底、藏地图、本剪辑（坐标是调用瞬间，位移已发生）、hold 1 秒逻辑帧。第一拍 [`renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再播 [`XG_tishen2`](XG_tishen2.md)。\n\n火影受身走爆气 `energyExplode`，不走替身。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"本剪辑 35 帧，是 SWF 里最长的普通火花之一（必杀脸 71 帧除外）。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen2\",\n    \"替身第二段（无声）\",\n    \"替身黑底期间第 1 逻辑帧补上的第二段。VO 无 sound。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp2`：只有 `className=XG_tishen2`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl})：`frame==1` 时在记下的 pos 播本 id。1 秒后 `endReplaceSkill` resume。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺火花（未登记）\",\n    \"25 帧、几乎每帧 Place 的冲刺剪辑。现行 dash 用 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md) / [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。配对 [`snd_xdash`](snd_xdash.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"`xdash` ≈ 横冲。启动不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\",\n    \"KO 背景闪光\",\n    \"有人在必杀中被 KO 时垫到 GameState 最底的短循环背景。5 帧，靠 `holdFrame` 撑满约 2 秒。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `kobg`：裸 VO，无声、无 add。\n\n[`FightUI.playKO`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) 若任一方 `actionState` 12/13（必杀/超必）→ [`EffectCtrl.BGEffect(\"kobg\", 2)`]({ctrl})：\n\n1. `addEffect` 在 (0,0)\n2. `holdFrame = 2 * 30 = 60` 动画拍（后置 `--` 实际 61 拍 ≈ 2s@30fps）\n3. 再挂 remove 回调恢复地图；立刻 `getMap().setVisible(false)`\n4. `addChildAt(display, 0)` 到 **GameState**（不是 `_playerLayer`）\n\n[`EffectView`]({view}) 播到缓存末帧会绕回 0 直到 hold 到期。烘焙跳过最后一帧：5 帧 MC → 缓存 4 张循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, view=E_VIEW),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 循环光\",\n    \"防御 buff 持续期间跟随角色脚底的循环光。`isBuff=true` → `BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initBuffEffect`]({model}) id `buff_defense`：`xg_buff_defense`，add，`isBuff`。无声、无 `targetColorOffset`。\n\n[`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterBuffCtrler.md) 先 `doEffectById(\"buff_effect_defense\")` 播一次性 [`xg_buff_effect_defense`](xg_buff_effect_defense.md)，再 `doBuffEffect(\"buff_defense\")` → [`BuffEffectView`]({buff})：`loopPlay=true`，逻辑帧跟 `FighterBuffVO.finished`。到期 `remove`，不改色（表无 offset）。\n\n8 帧短循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, buff=E_BUFF),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上防御 buff 时的一次性爆发。**没有** `isBuff`，普通 `EffectView`，播完即删。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_defense`：只有 add。`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp` 经 `doEffectById`。17 帧。\n\n不要和持续光 [`xg_buff_defense`](xg_buff_defense.md) 搞混。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上攻击 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_power`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.attackUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_power`](xg_buff_power.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上速度 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_speed`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.speedUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_speed`](xg_buff_speed.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 循环光\",\n    \"攻击 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_power`：add，`isBuff`。`attackUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 循环光\",\n    \"速度 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_speed`：add，`isBuff`。`speedUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_catch_hit\",\n    \"抓取命中火花\",\n    \"抓技（hitType 11 CATCH）打中时的火花。无 add、无随机旋转；freeze 400ms。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **11**：`xg_catch_hit`，`snd_hit_cache`，freeze 400。没有 shine/shake/randRotate/blendMode。\n\n无 `defense_11`：挡住抓回落 [`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)。无 `hit_10` STONE。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing\",\n    \"感电持续环绕\",\n    \"电属性命中后挂在受击者身上的持续特效。`isSpecial` → `SpecialEffectView`。带 `loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initSpeicalEffect`]({model})（原拼写）id `shock_ing`：`xg_dian_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[50,-75,255]` 偏蓝紫。\n\n由 hitType 9 的 `specialEffectId` 触发 → [`EffectCtrl.doSpecialEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})：跟随 fighter，上色；`actionState` 落到 0/23/24（站立/倒地/弹起）则 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")` + `resumeColor`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F6 | [`EffectView.renderFrameLabel`]({view}) 看到 `\"loop\"` → `gotoAndPlay(1)`（位图下标 1，不是开头 0）。? 与 1-based 帧号错一位 |\n| `finish` | F7 | 基类忽略；`SpecialEffectView` 显式 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")`。key 是 MC 帧号 7，赋给 0-based `_curFrame`，可能错一位/越界。? |\n\n21 帧。烘焙跳过最后一帧 → 缓存 20。无 `loopPlay`（对比 buff）：持续段靠 `\"loop\"` 标签或片子够长；没有可靠 loop 时可能播完 autoRemove，角色还带着染色。?\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, spec=E_SPEC, view=E_VIEW\n    ),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n    extra=\"遗留更长变体 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 同样有 loop/finish，但表用的是本类。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\",\n    \"遗留感电持续（未登记）\",\n    \"23 帧感电环绕，标签 `F8:loop` / `F9:finish`。现行 `shock_ing` 用 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)（21 帧，loop 在 F6）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initSpeicalEffect` 只写 `xg_dian_ing`。本类不烘焙。标签布局与正式三条 special 同一套（先 loop 再 finish 紧挨着），像旧版电环。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_fire_ing\",\n    \"燃烧持续环绕\",\n    \"火属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色被染成全黑。`loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fire_ing`：`xg_fire_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[-255,-255,-255]`。hitType 7 的 `specialEffectId`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F12 | `renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | F13 | `SpecialEffectView` 在 idle/倒地/弹起时跳到这里，停止跟随并 `resumeColor` |\n\n25 帧 → 缓存 24。被打 21 / 击飞 22 **不**结束，火跟到落地或回 idle。死亡 30 不在 case 里，可能跟尸体到播完。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地火花（原拼写 fllor）\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2 的重砸地火花。符号名少一个 o：`fllor`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_heavy`：`className=xg_hitfllor_heavy`（必须逐字匹配），`snd_hitfloor_heavy`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(2)`]({ctrl}) **同时**再播 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md)（lighten 烟、无声）。本剪辑本身 normal 混合。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"引擎注释已标明这是原拼写，不是反编译错误。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1 的轻着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_low`：`xg_hitfloor_low` + `snd_hitfloor_low`。`hitFloorEffect(1)`。无烟。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\",\n    \"重砸地烟（lighten）\",\n    \"重砸地额外一层烟。`blendMode=lighten`，无声。只在强度 2 时和 heavy 火花一起播。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_yan`：只有 lighten。`hitFloorEffect(2)` 在 heavy 之后再 `doEffectById`。两份 View 同坐标叠画。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitover\",\n    \"KO 收招火花\",\n    \"KO 演出收招时的火花。裸 VO：无声、无 add。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_end`：`xg_hitover`。\n\n[`FightUI`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) KO：关 `freezeEnabled`、`doEffectById(\"hit_end\")`、shine、可选 `BGEffect(\"kobg\")`、shake、`slowDown(2,0)`。24 帧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_ice_ing\",\n    \"冰冻持续环绕\",\n    \"冰属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色加蓝。`loop`/`finish` 在很靠前的帧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ice_ing`：`xg_ice_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[0,0,255]`。hitType 8。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | **F5** | 三条 special 里 loop 最早。`renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | **F6** | 倒地/idle 跳结束段 |\n\n26 帧（special 里最长）→ 缓存 25。loop 在 F5 意味着循环体很短，前面 4 帧是入场。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Sounds\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSNDS = {}\n\n\ndef add_snd(name, title, purpose, hook, unused=False):\n    SNDS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"unused\": unused,\n    }\n\n\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸声\",\n    \"爆气后半段 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md) 的爆炸声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp2` VO.`sound`。`EffectView.start` → [`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) → [`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) `new` 本类。每次 start 新实例，无法 stop。\"\n    % (E_SND, E_AM),\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi1\",\n    \"爆气起手声\",\n    \"爆气前半段 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md) 的起手声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp` VO.`sound`。后半段换 [`snd_baoqi`](snd_baoqi.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_bs\",\n    \"必杀火花声\",\n    \"普通必杀火花 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha` VO.`sound`。超必用 [`snd_cbs`](snd_cbs.md)。黑底/特写无独立声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花声\",\n    \"超必与万解火花 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha_super` VO.`sound`。本库 22 kHz 里较长的一条。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash\",\n    \"死神辅助出场声（名义冲刺）\",\n    \"导出名像冲刺，实际绑在死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md)。\",\n    \"`fz_bleach` VO.`sound`。地面/空中 dash **不用**本类，用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。样本数与 `snd_dash_air` 同为 17952，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash_air\",\n    \"冲刺声（地面+空中共用）\",\n    \"地面 `dash` 与空中 `dash_air` 共用这一声。\",\n    \"`XG_rush` / `XG_rush_air` 的 VO.`sound` 都是本 id。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_def\",\n    \"轻防格挡声\",\n    \"轻拳防、轻法防共用。\",\n    \"`defense_2` [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)、`defense_4` [`XG_mffy`](XG_mffy.md)。轻斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykan`](snd_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_defx\",\n    \"重防/属性防格挡声\",\n    \"重拳防、重法防、火/冰/电防都用这一声。\",\n    \"`defense_3/5/7/8/9`。重斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykanx`](snd_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住轻斩的专门格挡声。\",\n    \"`defense_1` [`XG_fykan`](XG_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住重斩的专门格挡声。本库较长的防御音。\",\n    \"`defense_6` [`XG_fykanx`](XG_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fz\",\n    \"火影辅助出场 / 替身声\",\n    \"火影助战进场与替身第一段共用。\",\n    \"`fz_naruto` [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)、`replaceSp` [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md)。死神助战用 [`snd_dash`](snd_dash.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_fzbs`](XG_fzbs.md)。没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写这个 id。\",\n    \"[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) 仍能 `getEffect` 到本类，但引擎从不调。\" % E_SND,\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步火花声\",\n    \"`ghost_step` VO 自带的一声。与主 SWF 的 `snd_ghost_jump` 不是同一个。\",\n    \"[`XG_ghost_step`](XG_ghost_step.md) `EffectView.start` 播本类；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`](%s) 另外 `playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（main 嵌入）。走路循环反复 start 就会反复本声。\"\n    % E_CTRL,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit1\",\n    \"遗留轻击声（未引用）\",\n    \"短命中音。现行轻拳/轻法用 [`snd_hit2`](snd_hit2.md)，轻斩用 [`snd_kan1`](snd_kan1.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO 绑定。样本数与 [`snd_hit_cache`](snd_hit_cache.md) 同为 5344，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit10\",\n    \"遗留命中声（未引用）\",\n    \"中等长度命中音。表里没有 `snd_hit10`。钢体用 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。命名像旧编号序列 `hit1`…`hit11` 的第十号。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit11\",\n    \"钢体受击声\",\n    \"三条钢体火花共用这一声。\",\n    \"`steel_hit_kan` / `steel_hit_qdj` / `steel_hit_mfdj` 都是 `snd_hit11`。普通命中不用。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit2\",\n    \"轻拳 / 轻法命中声\",\n    \"轻打击与轻法共用。\",\n    \"`hit_2` [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)、`hit_4` [`XG_mfdj`](XG_mfdj.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_cache\",\n    \"抓取命中声\",\n    \"抓技打中的一声。id 是 cache（抓住）不是 cache 缓存。\",\n    \"`hit_11` [`xg_catch_hit`](xg_catch_hit.md)。样本数与未用的 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 相同。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_dian\",\n    \"电属性命中声\",\n    \"电属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_9` [`XG_leidian`](XG_leidian.md)。防御电用 [`snd_defx`](snd_defx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中声\",\n    \"火属性打中的一声。本库最长的 MP3。\",\n    \"`hit_7` [`XG_fire`](XG_fire.md)。约 2.3 s@22 kHz，可能含燃烧尾。持续 [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) 无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\",\n    \"重拳命中声\",\n    \"重打击（hitType 3）的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_3` [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)。11 kHz。重斩用 [`snd_kan2`](snd_kan2.md)，重法用 [`snd_mfdjx`](snd_mfdjx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中声\",\n    \"冰属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_8` [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)。持续冰环无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0。\",\n    \"`hit_floor` [`XG_hitfloor`](XG_hitfloor.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2。烟层 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 无声，只有本声。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_heavy` [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_low` [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_jump\",\n    \"跳跃声\",\n    \"地面跳与空中跳共用。11 kHz 短音。\",\n    \"`jump` [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md)、`jump_air` [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan1\",\n    \"轻斩命中声\",\n    \"轻斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_1` [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)。钢体斩改 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan2\",\n    \"重斩命中声\",\n    \"重斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_6` [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地声\",\n    \"自己触地。本库最短的一条。\",\n    \"`touch_floor` [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md)。约 180 ms。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法 / 破防声\",\n    \"重法命中与破防火花共用。11 kHz。\",\n    \"`hit_5` 与 `break_def` 都是本 id（剪辑都是 [`XG_mfdjx`](XG_mfdjx.md)）。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。现行冲刺用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。SWF 里 char id 1，像最早导出的音。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\n\ndef labels_md(labels):\n    if not labels:\n        return \"无帧标签、无 `addFrameScript`。\"\n    rows = \"\\n\".join(f\"| {fr} | `{name}` |\" for fr, name in labels)\n    return \"有标签：\\n\\n| 帧 | 标签 |\\n|----|------|\\n\" + rows\n\n\ndef write_mc(name):\n    meta = MCS[name]\n    cid, frames, places, labels = SPRITES[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    cache_n = frames - 1\n    lab = labels_md(labels)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未登记**：`EffectModel` 从不 `getEffect` 本 `className`。启动不烘焙。仍导出，[`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) 能 `new`。\"\n        % E_AM\n        if unused\n        else f\"运行时 **不**再 `new` 本 MC：只在 `EffectModel.initlize` → `cacheBitmapData` 时实例化一次，画成 {cache_n} 张位图（**最后一帧不烘**，见 [`EffectVO`]({E_VO})）。之后 [`EffectView`]({E_VIEW}) 只播 Bitmap。\"\n    )\n    extra = meta[\"extra\"]\n    extra_sec = f\"\\n{extra}\\n\" if extra else \"\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n{status}\n\nSWF：`assets/effect.swf` DefineSprite **char {cid}**（FFDec `symbol{cid}`），**{frames} 帧** @30fps，约 {places} 次 Place。{lab} 运行时无帧脚本。\n\n{extra_sec}\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends MovieClip`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol{cid}\")]`：FFDec 把 sprite {cid} 链到本类。真正运行不走 Flex Embed，靠 ZIP 里整份 `effect.swf` 的 SymbolClass。\n- **L6** 类名必须与 `EffectVO.className` / `AssetManager.getClass` 逐字相同（大小写敏感）。\n- **L9–12 ` {name}()`**：`super()`。无字段、无 `stop`、无标签脚本。时间轴默认从 F1 播到尾；烘焙时 `gotoAndStop(1)` 再 `nextFrame` 扫。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_snd(name):\n    meta = SNDS[name]\n    cid, embed, samples, rate, datalen = SOUNDS[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    d = dur(samples, rate)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未引用**：没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写本 id。`playEffectSound` 仍能 `getEffect` 到。\"\n        if unused\n        else \"运行时每次 `EffectView.start` 都 `new` 一份再 `Sound.play(0,0,transform)`，不循环、不 stop、不进对象池。\"\n    )\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n声音和 MC 走同一条 [`AssetManager.getEffect(className)`]({E_AM})：从 `\"assets/effect.swf\"` `getClass` 再 `new`。[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`]({E_SND}) 把返回值当 `Sound`。`playAssetSound` 走另一套 `sounds/` 加载器，**不**进本库。\n\n{status}\n\nSWF DefineSound **char {cid}**：MP3（fmt=2），{hz} Hz，16-bit mono，{d}，payload {datalen} B。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends Sound`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/{embed}\")]`：FFDec 拆出的 MP3。运行时是 SWF 里的 DefineSound，不是单独文件。\n- **L6** 类名 = `EffectVO.sound` 字符串。\n- **L9–12 `{name}()`**：`super()`。无循环点、无音量。音量靠 `SoundCtrl._sndTransform`。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_bisha():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"bisha_face_mc.md\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).bisha_face_mc` — 必杀特写脸底 MC\n\n一句话目的：必杀/万解黑底上的特写容器。左右槽 `facemc1`/`facemc2` 给角色 SWF 导出的脸 Bitmap；时间轴 71 帧，F71 标签 `destory` 且 `stop()`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/bisha_face_mc.as`（25 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不走** `EffectModel` / `EffectView` 光栅化。唯一实例化：[`BishaFaceEffectView`]({E_FACE}) 构造 `AssetManager.I.getEffect(\"bisha_face_mc\")` → 每次 `new` 一份活 MC。\n\n链：\n\n```\n$effect_ctrler.bisha / startWanKai\n  → FighterEffectCtrl.getFace (new 角色 bsface BitmapData)\n  → EffectCtrl.bisha / wanKai → showFace\n       比双方 display.x：自己在右 → 槽 2，否则 1\n  → BlackBackView.showBishaFace\n       第一次 new BishaFaceEffectView（本 MC）\n       setFace(slot, bmp) 拉伸 254×180 塞进 facemcN\n       fadIn → gotoAndPlay(2)\n```\n\n见 [`BlackBackView`]({E_BLACK})、[`EffectCtrl.showFace`]({E_CTRL})。替身/爆气/鬼步只有黑底，**不**挂本 MC。\n\n`fadOut` 拆特写；`BlackBackView` 把 `_bishaFace` 置 null，下次必杀再 new。多次必杀可能在黑底上堆停住的旧 MC。?\n\n## 时间轴\n\nSWF DefineSprite **char 926**（`symbol926`），**71 帧** @30fps，约 168 次 Place。嵌套未导出 sprite 922（5 帧）、923（1 帧空，F1 两个 depth 先放着）。\n\n| 帧 / 标签 | 行为 |\n|-----------|------|\n| F1 | 默认停在这里（构造未 play）。多半空/准备。槽位实例已在。 |\n| F2 | [`BishaFaceEffectView.fadIn`]({E_FACE}) `gotoAndPlay(2)` 入场起点 |\n| F2–F70 | 入场动画。无其它脚本 |\n| **F71 标签 `destory`**（原拼写） | `addFrameScript(70, frame71)` → `stop()`。之后停在末帧直到下次 fadIn 或黑底被摘 |\n\n无 `loop`。退场不是时间轴倒放，是整块 `BlackBackView` 从 `GameState` 摘掉。\n\n公开实例：\n\n| 字段 | 用途 |\n|------|------|\n| `facemc1` | 左槽（自己 x ≤ 对手，或无对手） |\n| `facemc2` | 右槽（自己 x > 对手） |\n\n脸图来自各角色 SWF `defineBishaFace` 的 BitmapData 类，不是本库。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class bisha_face_mc extends MovieClip`。\n\n### 字段（L9–11）\n\n- **L9** `facemc1:MovieClip`\n- **L11** `facemc2:MovieClip`\n\nFLA 实例名。`BishaFaceEffectView.setFace` 用 `mc[\"facemc\" + slot]` 动态取。槽号不是 1/2 或时间轴还没建实例则脸丢掉。\n\n### `bisha_face_mc()`（L13–17）\n\n- **L15** `super();`\n- **L16** `addFrameScript(70, this.frame71);` — 0-based 70 = 时间轴 **F71**。\n\n### `frame71`（时间轴 F71，L19–23）\n\n- **L21** `stop();` — 停在特写停留帧。标签名 `destory` 引擎不读；真正销毁是 `BishaFaceEffectView.destory` / 黑底 fadOut。\n\n无 `gotoAndPlay`、无 COMPLETE 事件。引擎也不听 COMPLETE。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_main():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"effect_fla\" / \"MainTimeline.md\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    md = f\"\"\"# `effect_fla.MainTimeline` — effect.swf 文档类（F1 停）\n\n一句话目的：`assets/effect.swf` 的文档类。根时间轴 8 帧、30fps；F1 `stop`。引擎从不 `new` 本类，只把整份 SWF `addSwf` 进 `KyoClassLoader`，按 **链接名** `getClass`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/effect_fla/MainTimeline.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`AssetManager.loadBasic`]({E_AM}) 拉 ZIP 内 `assets/effect.swf`，完成后 [`KyoClassLoader.addSwf`](../../engine/kyo/loader/KyoClassLoader.md)`(\"assets/effect.swf\", loader)`。之后：\n\n- `getEffect(className)` → `getClass(name, \"assets/effect.swf\")` → `new`\n- [`MainGame.loadGameBack`](../../engine/game/bvn/MainGame.md) → [`EffectModel.I.initlize`]({E_MODEL}) 对表里每个 `className` `cacheBitmapData`\n\nLoader 的 `content` 才是本 `MainTimeline`。引擎只留 domain，不把 content 加到舞台。F1 `stop` 防止这份 content 在内存里空转 8 帧循环。\n\n根时间轴 8 帧、无场景标签、无导出实例。真正用的是 SymbolClass 里那 88 个链接（57 个 MC + 31 个 Sound；本类是 char 0）。\n\n对照：UI 的 `common_ui_fla.MainTimeline` 同样 F1 停、同样只灌域。\n\nABC 调试路径习惯与 UI 相同（FLA 在 `…/fla/`）。本文件无 `[Embed]`——它就是这份 SWF 自己。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\nFLA 文档包 `effect_fla`。`public dynamic class MainTimeline extends MovieClip`。无公开字段。\n\n### `MainTimeline()`（L9–13）\n\n- **L11** `super();`\n- **L12** `addFrameScript(0, this.frame1);` — 0-based 0 = 时间轴 **F1**。\n\n### `frame1`（时间轴 F1，L15–18）\n\n- **L17** `stop();` — 文档停在空白。F2–F8 空，到不了。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    (OUT / \"scripts\").mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    # order: XG_* then bisha, MainTimeline, kobg, snd_*, xg_*\n    # write all MCS except bisha (custom)\n    for name in sorted(MCS, key=lambda n: n.lower()):\n        write_mc(name)\n    write_bisha()\n    write_main()\n    for name in sorted(SNDS):\n        write_snd(name)\n\n    # verify count\n    mds = list((OUT / \"scripts\").rglob(\"*.md\"))\n    print(f\"TOTAL md under scripts: {len(mds)}\")\n    expected = 89\n    if len(mds) != expected:\n        print(\"WARNING expected\", expected, \"got\", len(mds))\n        listed = {p.stem for p in mds}\n        print(\"files\", sorted(listed))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\"\"\"\n# end\n)\n"},"content":[],"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-633d42d2-265b-4617-89d8-9280db6831bb-60","status":null,"content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/tmp/gen_effect_md.py","oldText":"","newText":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"Generate line-by-line Chinese annotations for effect.swf scripts.\"\"\"\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nOUT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/effect\")\nSRC_ROOT = \"decompiled/other/effect/scripts\"\n\nE_CTRL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/EffectCtrl.md\"\nE_MGR = \"../../engine/game/bvn/utils/EffectManager.md\"\nE_VO = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectVO.md\"\nE_MODEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectModel.md\"\nE_VIEW = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/EffectView.md\"\nE_SPEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SpecialEffectView.md\"\nE_BUFF = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BuffEffectView.md\"\nE_STEEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SteelHitEffect.md\"\nE_FACE = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BishaFaceEffectView.md\"\nE_BLACK = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BlackBackView.md\"\nE_FEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterEffectCtrl.md\"\nE_SND = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/SoundCtrl.md\"\nE_AM = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/AssetManager.md\"\nE_HIT = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/HitType.md\"\n\n# SWF sprite metadata: name -> (char_id, frames, places, labels)\nSPRITES = {\n    \"xg_ice_ing\": (48, 26, 12, [(\"F5\", \"loop\"), (\"F6\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_fire_ing\": (73, 25, 12, [(\"F12\", \"loop\"), (\"F13\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\": (104, 23, 15, [(\"F8\", \"loop\"), (\"F9\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing\": (131, 21, 13, [(\"F6\", \"loop\"), (\"F7\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_buff_speed\": (140, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_power\": (141, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\": (158, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\": (159, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\": (160, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_defense\": (161, 8, 4, []),\n    \"XG_jump_air\": (172, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_jump\": (181, 10, 4, []),\n    \"XG_luodi\": (196, 10, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitover\": (217, 24, 10, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\": (246, 18, 14, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\": (261, 14, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\": (280, 18, 9, []),\n    \"XG_ghost_step\": (313, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\": (336, 11, 11, []),\n    \"XG_rush_air\": (365, 22, 14, []),\n    \"XG_rush\": (386, 20, 10, []),\n    \"xg_catch_hit\": (397, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_xdash\": (446, 25, 24, []),\n    \"XG_tishen2\": (467, 18, 10, []),\n    \"XG_tishen\": (470, 35, 25, []),\n    \"XG_kanx2\": (507, 17, 18, []),\n    \"XG_kanx\": (508, 21, 10, []),\n    \"XG_kan2\": (519, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_kan\": (532, 12, 6, []),\n    \"XG_hitfloor\": (543, 13, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyqx\": (554, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyq\": (571, 10, 9, []),\n    \"XG_fykanx\": (602, 19, 15, []),\n    \"XG_fykan\": (603, 15, 7, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx2\": (634, 13, 15, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx\": (651, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_qdj\": (662, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_mffyx\": (663, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_mffy\": (678, 11, 7, []),\n    \"XG_mfdjx\": (679, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_mfdj\": (690, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_leidian\": (701, 12, 5, []),\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\": (712, 5, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice2\": (743, 22, 15, []),\n    \"XG_ice_fy\": (754, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice\": (765, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\": (776, 12, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fzbs\": (787, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fire_fy\": (802, 15, 8, []),\n    \"XG_fire\": (825, 23, 11, []),\n    \"XG_dian_fy\": (828, 16, 8, []),\n    \"XG_cbs\": (841, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bs\": (842, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bsq\": (875, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_bdj\": (894, 9, 9, []),\n    \"XG_baoqi\": (911, 15, 8, []),\n    \"bisha_face_mc\": (926, 71, 168, [(\"F71\", \"destory\")]),\n}\n\n# sounds: name -> (char_id, embed_file, samples, rate_code, datalen)\n# rate 1=11025, 2=22050\nSOUNDS = {\n    \"snd_xdash\": (1, \"1_snd_xdash.mp3\", 25144, 2, 4994),\n    \"snd_fykan\": (2, \"2_snd_fykan.mp3\", 13750, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_hit2\": (3, \"3_snd_hit2.mp3\", 16128, 2, 3434),\n    \"snd_cbs\": (4, \"4_snd_cbs.mp3\", 29952, 2, 6769),\n    \"snd_fzbs\": (5, \"5_snd_fzbs.mp3\", 20160, 2, 4559),\n    \"snd_mfdjx\": (6, \"6_snd_mfdjx.mp3\", 9216, 1, 1673),\n    \"snd_jump\": (7, \"7_snd_jump.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_bs\": (8, \"8_snd_bs.mp3\", 13248, 1, 2401),\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\": (9, \"9_snd_hit_heavy.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_fz\": (10, \"10_snd_fz.mp3\", 8992, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit_dian\": (11, \"11_snd_hit_dian.mp3\", 17792, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_baoqi1\": (12, \"12_snd_baoqi1.mp3\", 21572, 2, 4370),\n    \"snd_hit_ice\": (13, \"13_snd_hit_ice.mp3\", 32128, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_def\": (14, \"14_snd_def.mp3\", 13824, 2, 3129),\n    \"snd_hit_fire\": (15, \"15_snd_hit_fire.mp3\", 51350, 2, 9778),\n    \"snd_hitfloor\": (16, \"16_snd_hitfloor.mp3\", 26262, 2, 5202),\n    \"snd_luodi\": (17, \"17_snd_luodi.mp3\", 3990, 2, 1250),\n    \"snd_dash_air\": (18, \"18_snd_dash_air.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\": (19, \"19_snd_hitfloor_heavy.mp3\", 33888, 2, 6450),\n    \"snd_dash\": (20, \"20_snd_dash.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_ghost_step\": (21, \"21_snd_ghost_step.mp3\", 15968, 2, 3330),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\": (22, \"22_snd_hitfloor_low.mp3\", 15296, 2, 3226),\n    \"snd_hit1\": (23, \"23_snd_hit1.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_baoqi\": (24, \"24_snd_baoqi.mp3\", 31505, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_hit_cache\": (25, \"25_snd_hit_cache.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_defx\": (26, \"26_snd_defx.mp3\", 14842, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_kan1\": (27, \"27_snd_kan1.mp3\", 7423, 2, 1874),\n    \"snd_fykanx\": (28, \"28_snd_fykanx.mp3\", 29951, 2, 5930),\n    \"snd_kan2\": (29, \"29_snd_kan2.mp3\", 9024, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit10\": (30, \"30_snd_hit10.mp3\", 10368, 2, 2394),\n    \"snd_hit11\": (31, \"31_snd_hit11.mp3\", 30848, 2, 6034),\n}\n\nRATE_HZ = {1: 11025, 2: 22050}\n\n\ndef dur(samples, rate):\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    ms = samples / hz * 1000\n    return f\"{ms:.0f} ms（{samples} samples / {hz} Hz）\"\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# MovieClip catalog\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# each: title, purpose, hook (markdown), extra (optional extra sections)\n\nMCS = {}\n\n\ndef add_mc(name, title, purpose, hook, extra=None, unused=False, vo_ids=None, view=\"EffectView\"):\n    MCS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"extra\": extra or \"\",\n        \"unused\": unused,\n        \"vo_ids\": vo_ids or [],\n        \"view\": view,\n    }\n\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸段火花\",\n    \"爆气演出后半段（`explodeSp2`）的爆炸剪辑。黑底结束时在角色原坐标播一次。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) 登记 id `explodeSp2`，`className=XG_baoqi`，`sound=snd_baoqi`。启动时 [`EffectVO.cacheBitmapData`]({vo}) 经 [`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) `new` 本类，逐帧光栅化后丢掉 MC。\n\n运行时 [`EffectCtrl.endEnergyExplode`]({ctrl})（`energyExplode` 倒数 0.7s 到期）`doEffectById(\"explodeSp2\")` → [`EffectManager.getEffectView`]({mgr}) 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。触发链：角色 SWF / [`FighterMain.energyExplode`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) → `$effect_ctrler.energyExplode` → [`FighterEffectCtrl`]({fec})。\n\n无 `isSpecial`/`isBuff`/`isSteelHit`。无 `blendMode`（默认 `normal`）。无 freeze/shine/shake。\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, vo=E_VO, am=E_AM, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, fec=E_FEC\n    ),\n    extra=\"前半段是 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md)（`explodeSp` + `snd_baoqi1`）。两段坐标都是调用瞬间的 fighter x/y。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bdj\",\n    \"遗留「绊打击」火花（未登记）\",\n    \"effect.swf 导出的短命中剪辑。`EffectModel` **没有**用这个 `className`。像早期普攻火花，被 `XG_qdj` / `XG_kan2` 取代。\",\n    \"\"\"[`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) 仍能按名 `new` 本类，但 [`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) / `initHitEffect` 从未写入 `_effect`。`doEffectById` / `getHitEffect` 都走不到。启动 `cacheEffects` 也不烘焙本剪辑。\n\n命名：`bdj` ≈ 绊打击。9 帧、每帧都有 Place，比现行轻拳 `XG_qdj`（12 帧）更短。\"\"\".format(am=E_AM, model=E_MODEL),\n    unused=True,\n    extra=\"同类遗留：[`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md)、[`XG_kanx`](XG_kanx.md)、[`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md)、[`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md)、[`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bs\",\n    \"必杀黑底火花\",\n    \"普通必杀（非超必）时在角色头顶偏上播的 add 混合火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha`：`className=XG_bs`，`sound=snd_bs`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.bisha(false, face?)`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.bisha`]({ctrl})：justRenderAnimate + pause + 黑底 + 可选 [`bisha_face_mc`](bisha_face_mc.md) 特写 + 本剪辑在 `(x, y-50)` + 藏地图。超必走 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md)（`bisha_super`），不走本类。\n\n万解 `wanKai` **不用**本类，强制 `bisha_super`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bsq\",\n    \"爆气起手火花\",\n    \"爆气/霸体爆发的前半段（`explodeSp`）。pause + 黑底期间先播这一段。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `explodeSp`：`XG_bsq` + `snd_baoqi1`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.energyExplode`]({ctrl})：pause、黑底（不 fadIn）、藏地图、在 fighter 坐标 `doEffectById(\"explodeSp\")`，然后 `_explodeSkillFrame = 0.7 * FPS_GAME`。到期 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md)。\n\n角色侧同时开超钢体、造 `HitVO`（power 50, hitType 5, 击飞）。本剪辑本身无 freeze/shine。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花\",\n    \"超必杀与万解共用的 add 火花。镜头 zoom 3.5 时播在 `(x, y-50)`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha_super`：`XG_cbs` + `snd_cbs` + `blendMode=add`。\n\n两条入口都到 [`EffectCtrl`]({ctrl})：\n\n- `$effect_ctrler.bisha(true, face?)` → `bisha(..., super=true)` → `cameraFocusOne` zoom 3.5 + 本剪辑\n- `$effect_ctrler.startWanKai(face?)` → `wanKai`：永远当超必，同样本剪辑\n\n普通必杀 `bisha(false)` 用 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md)，不用本类。时间轴长度与 `XG_bs` 同为 17 帧（FLA 里超必/必杀像同一套放大）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_dian_fy\",\n    \"电属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住电属性（hitType 9）时的防御火花。朝向跟攻击者。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initDefenseEffect`]({model}) `defense_9`：`XG_dian_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400ms，`blendMode=add`，`followDirect=true`，电色闪 `0x8288D2` alpha 0.2，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.doDefenseEffect`]({ctrl})：角色 `defenseType==0` 用原始 hitType；`==1` 只把斩系 1→2、6→3，**电仍是 9**。无 `specialEffectId`：防住不挂 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。\n\n未知防御类型回落 `defense_5`（[`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)），不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中火花\",\n    \"火属性攻击打中时的命中火花，并给受击者挂持续燃烧 `fire_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initHitEffect`]({model}) hitType **7 FIRE**：`XG_fire`，`snd_hit_fire`，add，freeze 400，火色闪 `0xFFFF67`，shake pow 6，**`specialEffectId=fire_ing`**。\n\n命中链：`FighterMcCtrler.doHitEffect` → [`EffectCtrl.doHitEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`EffectManager.getEffectVOByHitVO`]({mgr}) clone 本 VO（把 `pow` 抄到 `shake.y`）→ 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。`doEffectVO` 末尾对 `FighterMain` 再 `doSpecialEffect(\"fire_ing\")` → [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) + [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})。\n\n防御命中走 [`XG_fire_fy`](XG_fire_fy.md)，不挂燃烧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, spec=E_SPEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire_fy\",\n    \"火属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住火属性时的防御火花。防住不挂燃烧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_7`：`XG_fire_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，火色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n无 `specialEffectId`。朝向用攻击者 `direct`（`EffectCtrl` + VO.`followDirect`）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻斩（hitType 1）时的短火花。轻防套餐：freeze 50ms、无闪无震。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_1`：`XG_fykan`，`snd_fykan`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1`（拳防角色）会把斩 1 改成拳 2，改播 [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)，看不到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重斩（hitType 6）时的重防火花。带白闪（shine 自带 `blendMode=screen`）和震屏。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_6`：`XG_fykanx`，`snd_fykanx`，freeze 400，add，shine 白 alpha 0.1 **且 shine.blendMode=screen**（其它重防 shine 没写 blend），`followDirect`，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n拳防角色把 6→3，改播 [`XG_fyqx`](XG_fyqx.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyq\",\n    \"轻拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻拳（hitType 2）时的短火花。也是斩→拳防映射的落点。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_2`：`XG_fyq`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1` 时轻斩也会落到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyqx\",\n    \"重拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重拳（hitType 3）时的重防火花。拳防角色挡重斩也走这里。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_3`：`XG_fyqx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 alpha 0.1，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\",\n    \"死神辅助出场火花\",\n    \"死神阵营（`comicType!=1`）助战进场时的短火花。声用 `snd_dash`（不是 `snd_fz`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_bleach`：`XG_fz_bleach_mc` + `snd_dash`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.assisterEffect`]({ctrl})：`comicType==1` → [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)，否则本类。`FighterEventCtrl.addAssister` 与 `AssisiterCtrler.finish` 调。\n\n助战 SWF 自己还会 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 等，那是另一套必杀黑底，不是本剪辑。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\",\n    \"火影辅助出场火花\",\n    \"火影阵营（`comicType==1`）助战进场火花。声用 `snd_fz`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_naruto`：`XG_fz_naruto_mc` + `snd_fz`。\n\n与死神出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 成对。替身 [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md) 也复用 `snd_fz`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀火花（未登记）\",\n    \"导出名像「辅助必杀」。`EffectModel` 未登记。配对音 [`snd_fzbs`](snd_fzbs.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"助战进场只用 `fz_bleach` / `fz_naruto`。助战时间轴若 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 走的是全局 `XG_bs`/`XG_cbs`，不是本类。\n\n10 帧短剪辑。启动不烘焙。\"\"\".format(),\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步残影火花\",\n    \"鬼步移动时脚下/身后的 add 火花。走路循环在鬼步状态下反复 `doEffectById`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ghost_step`：`XG_ghost_step`，`snd_ghost_step`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n两条声：**VO 的 `snd_ghost_step`** 在 `EffectView.start` 播；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`]({ctrl}) 另外 `SoundCtrl.playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（主 SWF 嵌入，不在本库）。\n\n触发：`$effect_ctrler.ghostStep` 开演出（pause + 黑底 + justRender 物理仍走）；之后 [`FighterEffectCtrl.walk`]({fec}) 若 `_inGhostStep` 则反复本 id，而不是 `step1/2/3` 脚步。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0 的着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor`：`XG_hitfloor` + `snd_hitfloor`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(0)`]({ctrl}) ← [`FighterEffectCtrl.hitFloor`]({fec})。强度 1 走 [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)；强度 2 走 [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md) **外加** [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 烟。\n\n主动落地（跳下）是 [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md) `touch_floor`，不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中火花\",\n    \"冰属性打中时的命中火花，并挂持续冰冻 `ice_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **8 ICE**：`XG_ice`，`snd_hit_ice`，add，`specialEffectId=ice_ing`，freeze 400，冰色闪 `0xA3E5F5`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_ice_ing`](xg_ice_ing.md)。遗留变体 [`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md) 未登记。防御走 [`XG_ice_fy`](XG_ice_fy.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice2\",\n    \"遗留冰击火花（未登记）\",\n    \"22 帧冰剪辑，比现行 [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)（11 帧）长一倍。`initHitEffect(8)` 用的是 `XG_ice`，本类不进表。\",\n    \"\"\"无 `EffectVO`、不烘焙、无声绑定。像旧版冰命中或另一套冰爆。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice_fy\",\n    \"冰属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住冰属性时的防御火花。防住不挂冰冻。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_8`：`XG_ice_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，冰色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump\",\n    \"起跳尘\",\n    \"地面起跳时脚下的尘。坐标用 **display** x/y，不是逻辑坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump`：`XG_jump` + `snd_jump`。无 add。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.jump`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.jumpEffect`]({ctrl})。空中二段跳走 [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)，共用 `snd_jump`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump_air\",\n    \"空中跳火花\",\n    \"空中再跳（二段跳）的 add 火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump_air`：`XG_jump_air`，`snd_jump`，`blendMode=add`。地面跳 [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md) 无 add。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.jumpAirEffect`]({ctrl})。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan\",\n    \"遗留轻斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧轻斩剪辑（12 帧）。现行 hitType 1 用 [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)（10 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initHitEffect(1, \"XG_kan2\", …)`。钢体斩也用 `XG_kan2`。本类不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan2\",\n    \"轻斩命中 / 钢体斩火花\",\n    \"轻斩（hitType 1）命中火花；钢体受斩复用同一剪辑、另一份 VO。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 [`EffectVO`]({vo}) 都 `className=XG_kan2`，`cacheEffects` **各烘焙一次**：\n\n| id | 用途 | 声 | freeze | 其它 |\n|----|------|----|--------|------|\n| `hit_1` | 普通轻斩 | `snd_kan1` | 50ms | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_kan` | 钢体挨斩 | `snd_hit11` | 400ms | add，白闪 0.2，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit`，**无 shake** |\n\n普通路径 [`EffectView`]({view})；钢体 [`SteelHitEffect`]({steel})（`setTarget` 改色，freeze 结束 `resumeColor`）。\n\n遗留 [`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md) 不用。\"\"\".format(vo=E_VO, view=E_VIEW, steel=E_STEEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx\",\n    \"遗留重斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧重斩（21 帧）。现行 hitType 6 用 [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"钢体没有单独的重斩 id，重斩打钢体仍按 hitType 走 `steel_hit_kan` → `XG_kan2`。本类完全闲置。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx2\",\n    \"重斩命中火花\",\n    \"重斩（hitType 6）命中火花。重击套餐：400ms freeze + 白闪 + 震屏 + 随机旋转。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **6 KAN_HEAVY**：`XG_kanx2`，`snd_kan2`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake `pow:6, time:400`（[`EffectManager`]({mgr}) 把 pow 抄到 `shake.y`）。\n\n无 `isSteelHit`。无 `specialEffectId`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, mgr=E_MGR),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_leidian\",\n    \"电属性命中火花\",\n    \"电属性打中时的命中火花（**hardlight** 混合），并挂持续感电 `shock_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **9 ELECTRIC**：`XG_leidian`，`snd_hit_dian`，**`blendMode=hardlight`**（命中表里唯一 hardlight），`specialEffectId=shock_ing`，freeze 400，电色闪 `0x8288D2`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。遗留 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 未用。防御 [`XG_dian_fy`](XG_dian_fy.md) 用 add 不是 hardlight。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地尘\",\n    \"自己跳下/落下触地的尘，不是受击砸地。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `touch_floor`：`XG_luodi` + `snd_luodi`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.touchFloor`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.touchFloorEffect`]({ctrl})。受击落地是 `hit_floor*`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdj\",\n    \"轻法命中 / 钢体法火花\",\n    \"轻法/忍术/鬼道（hitType 4）命中火花；钢体受法复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO，同 `className=XG_mfdj`，各烘焙一次：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_4` MAGIC | `snd_hit2`（和轻拳同一声） | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_mfdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n轻拳火花是 [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)，剪辑不同、声相同。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法命中 / 破防火花\",\n    \"重法（hitType 5）命中火花；破防 `break_def` **复用同一剪辑**、另一份 VO（freeze 更长、震的是 x 不是 pow）。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | shake | 其它 |\n|----|----|--------|-------|------|\n| `hit_5` MAGIC_HEAVY | `snd_mfdjx` | 400 | `pow:6, time:400` → 抄到 y | add，`randRotate`，白闪 0.2 |\n| `break_def` | `snd_mfdjx` | **500** | **`x:6, time:400`**（不是 pow） | add，**无** randRotate / shine |\n\n`FighterMcCtrler` 破防 `doEffectById(\"break_def\")`。爆气判定 hitType 也是 5，命中火花走 `hit_5` 这份，不是 break_def。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffy\",\n    \"轻法防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻法（hitType 4）时的短火花。声与轻拳防相同（`snd_def`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_4`：`XG_mffy`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffyx\",\n    \"重法防御火花 / 未知防御回落\",\n    \"挡住重法（hitType 5）时的重防火花。`getDefenseEffect` 对未登记类型（含抓 11）回落到本条。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_5`：`XG_mffyx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 **alpha 0.15**（其它重防 0.1，属性防 0.2），shake pow 6。\n\n`getDefenseEffect`：没有 `defense_N` 则用 `defense_5`。无 `defense_11`，抓技防住也会看到本火花。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdj\",\n    \"轻拳命中 / 钢体拳火花\",\n    \"轻拳/打击（hitType 2）命中火花；钢体挨打复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_2` DA | `snd_hit2` | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_qdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n遗留轻击声 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 未绑到任何 VO。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx\",\n    \"重拳命中火花\",\n    \"重拳（hitType 3）命中火花。重击套餐。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **3 DA_HEAVY**：`XG_qdjx`，`snd_hit_heavy`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n遗留 [`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md) 未用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx2\",\n    \"遗留重拳火花（未登记）\",\n    \"13 帧重拳变体。现行 hitType 3 用 [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"无 VO。命名 `qdjx2` 与斩系 `kan2`/`kanx2`「第二版」同一套替换习惯，但这条没切过去。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush\",\n    \"地面冲刺残影\",\n    \"地面 dash 时的残影剪辑。声绑的是 **`snd_dash_air`**，不是 `snd_dash`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash`：`XG_rush`，`sound=snd_dash_air`（地面/空中冲刺共用空中声）。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.dash`]({fec})：不在空中 → 本 id；在空中 → [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。`snd_dash` 实际给死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush_air\",\n    \"空中冲刺残影\",\n    \"空中 dash 残影。与地面冲刺共用 `snd_dash_air`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash_air`：`XG_rush_air` + `snd_dash_air`。22 帧，比地面 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md)（20 帧）略长。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen\",\n    \"替身第一段\",\n    \"死神受身/替身演出的第一段火花。pause + 黑底时立刻播在**位移前**的坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp`：`XG_tishen` + `snd_fz`（和火影辅助出场同一声）。\n\n[`FighterMain.replaceSkill`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) 先 `move(250*direct)`、idle、无敌；[`EffectCtrl.replaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再 pause、黑底、藏地图、本剪辑（坐标是调用瞬间，位移已发生）、hold 1 秒逻辑帧。第一拍 [`renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再播 [`XG_tishen2`](XG_tishen2.md)。\n\n火影受身走爆气 `energyExplode`，不走替身。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"本剪辑 35 帧，是 SWF 里最长的普通火花之一（必杀脸 71 帧除外）。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen2\",\n    \"替身第二段（无声）\",\n    \"替身黑底期间第 1 逻辑帧补上的第二段。VO 无 sound。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp2`：只有 `className=XG_tishen2`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl})：`frame==1` 时在记下的 pos 播本 id。1 秒后 `endReplaceSkill` resume。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺火花（未登记）\",\n    \"25 帧、几乎每帧 Place 的冲刺剪辑。现行 dash 用 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md) / [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。配对 [`snd_xdash`](snd_xdash.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"`xdash` ≈ 横冲。启动不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\",\n    \"KO 背景闪光\",\n    \"有人在必杀中被 KO 时垫到 GameState 最底的短循环背景。5 帧，靠 `holdFrame` 撑满约 2 秒。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `kobg`：裸 VO，无声、无 add。\n\n[`FightUI.playKO`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) 若任一方 `actionState` 12/13（必杀/超必）→ [`EffectCtrl.BGEffect(\"kobg\", 2)`]({ctrl})：\n\n1. `addEffect` 在 (0,0)\n2. `holdFrame = 2 * 30 = 60` 动画拍（后置 `--` 实际 61 拍 ≈ 2s@30fps）\n3. 再挂 remove 回调恢复地图；立刻 `getMap().setVisible(false)`\n4. `addChildAt(display, 0)` 到 **GameState**（不是 `_playerLayer`）\n\n[`EffectView`]({view}) 播到缓存末帧会绕回 0 直到 hold 到期。烘焙跳过最后一帧：5 帧 MC → 缓存 4 张循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, view=E_VIEW),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 循环光\",\n    \"防御 buff 持续期间跟随角色脚底的循环光。`isBuff=true` → `BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initBuffEffect`]({model}) id `buff_defense`：`xg_buff_defense`，add，`isBuff`。无声、无 `targetColorOffset`。\n\n[`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterBuffCtrler.md) 先 `doEffectById(\"buff_effect_defense\")` 播一次性 [`xg_buff_effect_defense`](xg_buff_effect_defense.md)，再 `doBuffEffect(\"buff_defense\")` → [`BuffEffectView`]({buff})：`loopPlay=true`，逻辑帧跟 `FighterBuffVO.finished`。到期 `remove`，不改色（表无 offset）。\n\n8 帧短循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, buff=E_BUFF),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上防御 buff 时的一次性爆发。**没有** `isBuff`，普通 `EffectView`，播完即删。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_defense`：只有 add。`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp` 经 `doEffectById`。17 帧。\n\n不要和持续光 [`xg_buff_defense`](xg_buff_defense.md) 搞混。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上攻击 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_power`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.attackUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_power`](xg_buff_power.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上速度 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_speed`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.speedUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_speed`](xg_buff_speed.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 循环光\",\n    \"攻击 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_power`：add，`isBuff`。`attackUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 循环光\",\n    \"速度 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_speed`：add，`isBuff`。`speedUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_catch_hit\",\n    \"抓取命中火花\",\n    \"抓技（hitType 11 CATCH）打中时的火花。无 add、无随机旋转；freeze 400ms。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **11**：`xg_catch_hit`，`snd_hit_cache`，freeze 400。没有 shine/shake/randRotate/blendMode。\n\n无 `defense_11`：挡住抓回落 [`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)。无 `hit_10` STONE。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing\",\n    \"感电持续环绕\",\n    \"电属性命中后挂在受击者身上的持续特效。`isSpecial` → `SpecialEffectView`。带 `loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initSpeicalEffect`]({model})（原拼写）id `shock_ing`：`xg_dian_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[50,-75,255]` 偏蓝紫。\n\n由 hitType 9 的 `specialEffectId` 触发 → [`EffectCtrl.doSpecialEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})：跟随 fighter，上色；`actionState` 落到 0/23/24（站立/倒地/弹起）则 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")` + `resumeColor`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F6 | [`EffectView.renderFrameLabel`]({view}) 看到 `\"loop\"` → `gotoAndPlay(1)`（位图下标 1，不是开头 0）。? 与 1-based 帧号错一位 |\n| `finish` | F7 | 基类忽略；`SpecialEffectView` 显式 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")`。key 是 MC 帧号 7，赋给 0-based `_curFrame`，可能错一位/越界。? |\n\n21 帧。烘焙跳过最后一帧 → 缓存 20。无 `loopPlay`（对比 buff）：持续段靠 `\"loop\"` 标签或片子够长；没有可靠 loop 时可能播完 autoRemove，角色还带着染色。?\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, spec=E_SPEC, view=E_VIEW\n    ),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n    extra=\"遗留更长变体 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 同样有 loop/finish，但表用的是本类。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\",\n    \"遗留感电持续（未登记）\",\n    \"23 帧感电环绕，标签 `F8:loop` / `F9:finish`。现行 `shock_ing` 用 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)（21 帧，loop 在 F6）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initSpeicalEffect` 只写 `xg_dian_ing`。本类不烘焙。标签布局与正式三条 special 同一套（先 loop 再 finish 紧挨着），像旧版电环。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_fire_ing\",\n    \"燃烧持续环绕\",\n    \"火属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色被染成全黑。`loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fire_ing`：`xg_fire_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[-255,-255,-255]`。hitType 7 的 `specialEffectId`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F12 | `renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | F13 | `SpecialEffectView` 在 idle/倒地/弹起时跳到这里，停止跟随并 `resumeColor` |\n\n25 帧 → 缓存 24。被打 21 / 击飞 22 **不**结束，火跟到落地或回 idle。死亡 30 不在 case 里，可能跟尸体到播完。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地火花（原拼写 fllor）\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2 的重砸地火花。符号名少一个 o：`fllor`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_heavy`：`className=xg_hitfllor_heavy`（必须逐字匹配），`snd_hitfloor_heavy`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(2)`]({ctrl}) **同时**再播 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md)（lighten 烟、无声）。本剪辑本身 normal 混合。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"引擎注释已标明这是原拼写，不是反编译错误。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1 的轻着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_low`：`xg_hitfloor_low` + `snd_hitfloor_low`。`hitFloorEffect(1)`。无烟。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\",\n    \"重砸地烟（lighten）\",\n    \"重砸地额外一层烟。`blendMode=lighten`，无声。只在强度 2 时和 heavy 火花一起播。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_yan`：只有 lighten。`hitFloorEffect(2)` 在 heavy 之后再 `doEffectById`。两份 View 同坐标叠画。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitover\",\n    \"KO 收招火花\",\n    \"KO 演出收招时的火花。裸 VO：无声、无 add。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_end`：`xg_hitover`。\n\n[`FightUI`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) KO：关 `freezeEnabled`、`doEffectById(\"hit_end\")`、shine、可选 `BGEffect(\"kobg\")`、shake、`slowDown(2,0)`。24 帧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_ice_ing\",\n    \"冰冻持续环绕\",\n    \"冰属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色加蓝。`loop`/`finish` 在很靠前的帧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ice_ing`：`xg_ice_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[0,0,255]`。hitType 8。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | **F5** | 三条 special 里 loop 最早。`renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | **F6** | 倒地/idle 跳结束段 |\n\n26 帧（special 里最长）→ 缓存 25。loop 在 F5 意味着循环体很短，前面 4 帧是入场。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Sounds\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSNDS = {}\n\n\ndef add_snd(name, title, purpose, hook, unused=False):\n    SNDS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"unused\": unused,\n    }\n\n\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸声\",\n    \"爆气后半段 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md) 的爆炸声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp2` VO.`sound`。`EffectView.start` → [`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) → [`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) `new` 本类。每次 start 新实例，无法 stop。\"\n    % (E_SND, E_AM),\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi1\",\n    \"爆气起手声\",\n    \"爆气前半段 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md) 的起手声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp` VO.`sound`。后半段换 [`snd_baoqi`](snd_baoqi.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_bs\",\n    \"必杀火花声\",\n    \"普通必杀火花 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha` VO.`sound`。超必用 [`snd_cbs`](snd_cbs.md)。黑底/特写无独立声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花声\",\n    \"超必与万解火花 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha_super` VO.`sound`。本库 22 kHz 里较长的一条。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash\",\n    \"死神辅助出场声（名义冲刺）\",\n    \"导出名像冲刺，实际绑在死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md)。\",\n    \"`fz_bleach` VO.`sound`。地面/空中 dash **不用**本类，用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。样本数与 `snd_dash_air` 同为 17952，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash_air\",\n    \"冲刺声（地面+空中共用）\",\n    \"地面 `dash` 与空中 `dash_air` 共用这一声。\",\n    \"`XG_rush` / `XG_rush_air` 的 VO.`sound` 都是本 id。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_def\",\n    \"轻防格挡声\",\n    \"轻拳防、轻法防共用。\",\n    \"`defense_2` [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)、`defense_4` [`XG_mffy`](XG_mffy.md)。轻斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykan`](snd_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_defx\",\n    \"重防/属性防格挡声\",\n    \"重拳防、重法防、火/冰/电防都用这一声。\",\n    \"`defense_3/5/7/8/9`。重斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykanx`](snd_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住轻斩的专门格挡声。\",\n    \"`defense_1` [`XG_fykan`](XG_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住重斩的专门格挡声。本库较长的防御音。\",\n    \"`defense_6` [`XG_fykanx`](XG_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fz\",\n    \"火影辅助出场 / 替身声\",\n    \"火影助战进场与替身第一段共用。\",\n    \"`fz_naruto` [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)、`replaceSp` [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md)。死神助战用 [`snd_dash`](snd_dash.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_fzbs`](XG_fzbs.md)。没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写这个 id。\",\n    \"[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) 仍能 `getEffect` 到本类，但引擎从不调。\" % E_SND,\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步火花声\",\n    \"`ghost_step` VO 自带的一声。与主 SWF 的 `snd_ghost_jump` 不是同一个。\",\n    \"[`XG_ghost_step`](XG_ghost_step.md) `EffectView.start` 播本类；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`](%s) 另外 `playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（main 嵌入）。走路循环反复 start 就会反复本声。\"\n    % E_CTRL,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit1\",\n    \"遗留轻击声（未引用）\",\n    \"短命中音。现行轻拳/轻法用 [`snd_hit2`](snd_hit2.md)，轻斩用 [`snd_kan1`](snd_kan1.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO 绑定。样本数与 [`snd_hit_cache`](snd_hit_cache.md) 同为 5344，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit10\",\n    \"遗留命中声（未引用）\",\n    \"中等长度命中音。表里没有 `snd_hit10`。钢体用 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。命名像旧编号序列 `hit1`…`hit11` 的第十号。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit11\",\n    \"钢体受击声\",\n    \"三条钢体火花共用这一声。\",\n    \"`steel_hit_kan` / `steel_hit_qdj` / `steel_hit_mfdj` 都是 `snd_hit11`。普通命中不用。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit2\",\n    \"轻拳 / 轻法命中声\",\n    \"轻打击与轻法共用。\",\n    \"`hit_2` [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)、`hit_4` [`XG_mfdj`](XG_mfdj.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_cache\",\n    \"抓取命中声\",\n    \"抓技打中的一声。id 是 cache（抓住）不是 cache 缓存。\",\n    \"`hit_11` [`xg_catch_hit`](xg_catch_hit.md)。样本数与未用的 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 相同。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_dian\",\n    \"电属性命中声\",\n    \"电属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_9` [`XG_leidian`](XG_leidian.md)。防御电用 [`snd_defx`](snd_defx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中声\",\n    \"火属性打中的一声。本库最长的 MP3。\",\n    \"`hit_7` [`XG_fire`](XG_fire.md)。约 2.3 s@22 kHz，可能含燃烧尾。持续 [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) 无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\",\n    \"重拳命中声\",\n    \"重打击（hitType 3）的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_3` [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)。11 kHz。重斩用 [`snd_kan2`](snd_kan2.md)，重法用 [`snd_mfdjx`](snd_mfdjx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中声\",\n    \"冰属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_8` [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)。持续冰环无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0。\",\n    \"`hit_floor` [`XG_hitfloor`](XG_hitfloor.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2。烟层 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 无声，只有本声。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_heavy` [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_low` [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_jump\",\n    \"跳跃声\",\n    \"地面跳与空中跳共用。11 kHz 短音。\",\n    \"`jump` [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md)、`jump_air` [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan1\",\n    \"轻斩命中声\",\n    \"轻斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_1` [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)。钢体斩改 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan2\",\n    \"重斩命中声\",\n    \"重斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_6` [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地声\",\n    \"自己触地。本库最短的一条。\",\n    \"`touch_floor` [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md)。约 180 ms。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法 / 破防声\",\n    \"重法命中与破防火花共用。11 kHz。\",\n    \"`hit_5` 与 `break_def` 都是本 id（剪辑都是 [`XG_mfdjx`](XG_mfdjx.md)）。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。现行冲刺用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。SWF 里 char id 1，像最早导出的音。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\n\ndef labels_md(labels):\n    if not labels:\n        return \"无帧标签、无 `addFrameScript`。\"\n    rows = \"\\n\".join(f\"| {fr} | `{name}` |\" for fr, name in labels)\n    return \"有标签：\\n\\n| 帧 | 标签 |\\n|----|------|\\n\" + rows\n\n\ndef write_mc(name):\n    meta = MCS[name]\n    cid, frames, places, labels = SPRITES[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    cache_n = frames - 1\n    lab = labels_md(labels)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未登记**：`EffectModel` 从不 `getEffect` 本 `className`。启动不烘焙。仍导出，[`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) 能 `new`。\"\n        % E_AM\n        if unused\n        else f\"运行时 **不**再 `new` 本 MC：只在 `EffectModel.initlize` → `cacheBitmapData` 时实例化一次，画成 {cache_n} 张位图（**最后一帧不烘**，见 [`EffectVO`]({E_VO})）。之后 [`EffectView`]({E_VIEW}) 只播 Bitmap。\"\n    )\n    extra = meta[\"extra\"]\n    extra_sec = f\"\\n{extra}\\n\" if extra else \"\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n{status}\n\nSWF：`assets/effect.swf` DefineSprite **char {cid}**（FFDec `symbol{cid}`），**{frames} 帧** @30fps，约 {places} 次 Place。{lab} 运行时无帧脚本。\n\n{extra_sec}\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends MovieClip`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol{cid}\")]`：FFDec 把 sprite {cid} 链到本类。真正运行不走 Flex Embed，靠 ZIP 里整份 `effect.swf` 的 SymbolClass。\n- **L6** 类名必须与 `EffectVO.className` / `AssetManager.getClass` 逐字相同（大小写敏感）。\n- **L9–12 ` {name}()`**：`super()`。无字段、无 `stop`、无标签脚本。时间轴默认从 F1 播到尾；烘焙时 `gotoAndStop(1)` 再 `nextFrame` 扫。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_snd(name):\n    meta = SNDS[name]\n    cid, embed, samples, rate, datalen = SOUNDS[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    d = dur(samples, rate)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未引用**：没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写本 id。`playEffectSound` 仍能 `getEffect` 到。\"\n        if unused\n        else \"运行时每次 `EffectView.start` 都 `new` 一份再 `Sound.play(0,0,transform)`，不循环、不 stop、不进对象池。\"\n    )\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n声音和 MC 走同一条 [`AssetManager.getEffect(className)`]({E_AM})：从 `\"assets/effect.swf\"` `getClass` 再 `new`。[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`]({E_SND}) 把返回值当 `Sound`。`playAssetSound` 走另一套 `sounds/` 加载器，**不**进本库。\n\n{status}\n\nSWF DefineSound **char {cid}**：MP3（fmt=2），{hz} Hz，16-bit mono，{d}，payload {datalen} B。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends Sound`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/{embed}\")]`：FFDec 拆出的 MP3。运行时是 SWF 里的 DefineSound，不是单独文件。\n- **L6** 类名 = `EffectVO.sound` 字符串。\n- **L9–12 `{name}()`**：`super()`。无循环点、无音量。音量靠 `SoundCtrl._sndTransform`。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_bisha():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"bisha_face_mc.md\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).bisha_face_mc` — 必杀特写脸底 MC\n\n一句话目的：必杀/万解黑底上的特写容器。左右槽 `facemc1`/`facemc2` 给角色 SWF 导出的脸 Bitmap；时间轴 71 帧，F71 标签 `destory` 且 `stop()`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/bisha_face_mc.as`（25 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不走** `EffectModel` / `EffectView` 光栅化。唯一实例化：[`BishaFaceEffectView`]({E_FACE}) 构造 `AssetManager.I.getEffect(\"bisha_face_mc\")` → 每次 `new` 一份活 MC。\n\n链：\n\n```\n$effect_ctrler.bisha / startWanKai\n  → FighterEffectCtrl.getFace (new 角色 bsface BitmapData)\n  → EffectCtrl.bisha / wanKai → showFace\n       比双方 display.x：自己在右 → 槽 2，否则 1\n  → BlackBackView.showBishaFace\n       第一次 new BishaFaceEffectView（本 MC）\n       setFace(slot, bmp) 拉伸 254×180 塞进 facemcN\n       fadIn → gotoAndPlay(2)\n```\n\n见 [`BlackBackView`]({E_BLACK})、[`EffectCtrl.showFace`]({E_CTRL})。替身/爆气/鬼步只有黑底，**不**挂本 MC。\n\n`fadOut` 拆特写；`BlackBackView` 把 `_bishaFace` 置 null，下次必杀再 new。多次必杀可能在黑底上堆停住的旧 MC。?\n\n## 时间轴\n\nSWF DefineSprite **char 926**（`symbol926`），**71 帧** @30fps，约 168 次 Place。嵌套未导出 sprite 922（5 帧）、923（1 帧空，F1 两个 depth 先放着）。\n\n| 帧 / 标签 | 行为 |\n|-----------|------|\n| F1 | 默认停在这里（构造未 play）。多半空/准备。槽位实例已在。 |\n| F2 | [`BishaFaceEffectView.fadIn`]({E_FACE}) `gotoAndPlay(2)` 入场起点 |\n| F2–F70 | 入场动画。无其它脚本 |\n| **F71 标签 `destory`**（原拼写） | `addFrameScript(70, frame71)` → `stop()`。之后停在末帧直到下次 fadIn 或黑底被摘 |\n\n无 `loop`。退场不是时间轴倒放，是整块 `BlackBackView` 从 `GameState` 摘掉。\n\n公开实例：\n\n| 字段 | 用途 |\n|------|------|\n| `facemc1` | 左槽（自己 x ≤ 对手，或无对手） |\n| `facemc2` | 右槽（自己 x > 对手） |\n\n脸图来自各角色 SWF `defineBishaFace` 的 BitmapData 类，不是本库。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class bisha_face_mc extends MovieClip`。\n\n### 字段（L9–11）\n\n- **L9** `facemc1:MovieClip`\n- **L11** `facemc2:MovieClip`\n\nFLA 实例名。`BishaFaceEffectView.setFace` 用 `mc[\"facemc\" + slot]` 动态取。槽号不是 1/2 或时间轴还没建实例则脸丢掉。\n\n### `bisha_face_mc()`（L13–17）\n\n- **L15** `super();`\n- **L16** `addFrameScript(70, this.frame71);` — 0-based 70 = 时间轴 **F71**。\n\n### `frame71`（时间轴 F71，L19–23）\n\n- **L21** `stop();` — 停在特写停留帧。标签名 `destory` 引擎不读；真正销毁是 `BishaFaceEffectView.destory` / 黑底 fadOut。\n\n无 `gotoAndPlay`、无 COMPLETE 事件。引擎也不听 COMPLETE。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_main():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"effect_fla\" / \"MainTimeline.md\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    md = f\"\"\"# `effect_fla.MainTimeline` — effect.swf 文档类（F1 停）\n\n一句话目的：`assets/effect.swf` 的文档类。根时间轴 8 帧、30fps；F1 `stop`。引擎从不 `new` 本类，只把整份 SWF `addSwf` 进 `KyoClassLoader`，按 **链接名** `getClass`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/effect_fla/MainTimeline.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`AssetManager.loadBasic`]({E_AM}) 拉 ZIP 内 `assets/effect.swf`，完成后 [`KyoClassLoader.addSwf`](../../engine/kyo/loader/KyoClassLoader.md)`(\"assets/effect.swf\", loader)`。之后：\n\n- `getEffect(className)` → `getClass(name, \"assets/effect.swf\")` → `new`\n- [`MainGame.loadGameBack`](../../engine/game/bvn/MainGame.md) → [`EffectModel.I.initlize`]({E_MODEL}) 对表里每个 `className` `cacheBitmapData`\n\nLoader 的 `content` 才是本 `MainTimeline`。引擎只留 domain，不把 content 加到舞台。F1 `stop` 防止这份 content 在内存里空转 8 帧循环。\n\n根时间轴 8 帧、无场景标签、无导出实例。真正用的是 SymbolClass 里那 88 个链接（57 个 MC + 31 个 Sound；本类是 char 0）。\n\n对照：UI 的 `common_ui_fla.MainTimeline` 同样 F1 停、同样只灌域。\n\nABC 调试路径习惯与 UI 相同（FLA 在 `…/fla/`）。本文件无 `[Embed]`——它就是这份 SWF 自己。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\nFLA 文档包 `effect_fla`。`public dynamic class MainTimeline extends MovieClip`。无公开字段。\n\n### `MainTimeline()`（L9–13）\n\n- **L11** `super();`\n- **L12** `addFrameScript(0, this.frame1);` — 0-based 0 = 时间轴 **F1**。\n\n### `frame1`（时间轴 F1，L15–18）\n\n- **L17** `stop();` — 文档停在空白。F2–F8 空，到不了。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    (OUT / \"scripts\").mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    # order: XG_* then bisha, MainTimeline, kobg, snd_*, xg_*\n    # write all MCS except bisha (custom)\n    for name in sorted(MCS, key=lambda n: n.lower()):\n        write_mc(name)\n    write_bisha()\n    write_main()\n    for name in sorted(SNDS):\n        write_snd(name)\n\n    # verify count\n    mds = list((OUT / \"scripts\").rglob(\"*.md\"))\n    print(f\"TOTAL md under scripts: {len(mds)}\")\n    expected = 89\n    if len(mds) != expected:\n        print(\"WARNING expected\", expected, \"got\", len(mds))\n        listed = {p.stem for p in mds}\n        print(\"files\", sorted(listed))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\"\"\"\n# end\n)\n"}],"rawOutput":null,"locations":[{"path":"/tmp/gen_effect_md.py"}]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-633d42d2-265b-4617-89d8-9280db6831bb-60","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/tmp/gen_effect_md.py","oldText":"","newText":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"Generate line-by-line Chinese annotations for effect.swf scripts.\"\"\"\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nOUT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/effect\")\nSRC_ROOT = \"decompiled/other/effect/scripts\"\n\nE_CTRL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/EffectCtrl.md\"\nE_MGR = \"../../engine/game/bvn/utils/EffectManager.md\"\nE_VO = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectVO.md\"\nE_MODEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectModel.md\"\nE_VIEW = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/EffectView.md\"\nE_SPEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SpecialEffectView.md\"\nE_BUFF = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BuffEffectView.md\"\nE_STEEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SteelHitEffect.md\"\nE_FACE = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BishaFaceEffectView.md\"\nE_BLACK = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BlackBackView.md\"\nE_FEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterEffectCtrl.md\"\nE_SND = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/SoundCtrl.md\"\nE_AM = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/AssetManager.md\"\nE_HIT = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/HitType.md\"\n\n# SWF sprite metadata: name -> (char_id, frames, places, labels)\nSPRITES = {\n    \"xg_ice_ing\": (48, 26, 12, [(\"F5\", \"loop\"), (\"F6\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_fire_ing\": (73, 25, 12, [(\"F12\", \"loop\"), (\"F13\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\": (104, 23, 15, [(\"F8\", \"loop\"), (\"F9\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing\": (131, 21, 13, [(\"F6\", \"loop\"), (\"F7\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_buff_speed\": (140, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_power\": (141, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\": (158, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\": (159, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\": (160, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_defense\": (161, 8, 4, []),\n    \"XG_jump_air\": (172, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_jump\": (181, 10, 4, []),\n    \"XG_luodi\": (196, 10, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitover\": (217, 24, 10, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\": (246, 18, 14, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\": (261, 14, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\": (280, 18, 9, []),\n    \"XG_ghost_step\": (313, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\": (336, 11, 11, []),\n    \"XG_rush_air\": (365, 22, 14, []),\n    \"XG_rush\": (386, 20, 10, []),\n    \"xg_catch_hit\": (397, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_xdash\": (446, 25, 24, []),\n    \"XG_tishen2\": (467, 18, 10, []),\n    \"XG_tishen\": (470, 35, 25, []),\n    \"XG_kanx2\": (507, 17, 18, []),\n    \"XG_kanx\": (508, 21, 10, []),\n    \"XG_kan2\": (519, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_kan\": (532, 12, 6, []),\n    \"XG_hitfloor\": (543, 13, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyqx\": (554, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyq\": (571, 10, 9, []),\n    \"XG_fykanx\": (602, 19, 15, []),\n    \"XG_fykan\": (603, 15, 7, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx2\": (634, 13, 15, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx\": (651, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_qdj\": (662, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_mffyx\": (663, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_mffy\": (678, 11, 7, []),\n    \"XG_mfdjx\": (679, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_mfdj\": (690, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_leidian\": (701, 12, 5, []),\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\": (712, 5, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice2\": (743, 22, 15, []),\n    \"XG_ice_fy\": (754, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice\": (765, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\": (776, 12, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fzbs\": (787, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fire_fy\": (802, 15, 8, []),\n    \"XG_fire\": (825, 23, 11, []),\n    \"XG_dian_fy\": (828, 16, 8, []),\n    \"XG_cbs\": (841, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bs\": (842, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bsq\": (875, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_bdj\": (894, 9, 9, []),\n    \"XG_baoqi\": (911, 15, 8, []),\n    \"bisha_face_mc\": (926, 71, 168, [(\"F71\", \"destory\")]),\n}\n\n# sounds: name -> (char_id, embed_file, samples, rate_code, datalen)\n# rate 1=11025, 2=22050\nSOUNDS = {\n    \"snd_xdash\": (1, \"1_snd_xdash.mp3\", 25144, 2, 4994),\n    \"snd_fykan\": (2, \"2_snd_fykan.mp3\", 13750, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_hit2\": (3, \"3_snd_hit2.mp3\", 16128, 2, 3434),\n    \"snd_cbs\": (4, \"4_snd_cbs.mp3\", 29952, 2, 6769),\n    \"snd_fzbs\": (5, \"5_snd_fzbs.mp3\", 20160, 2, 4559),\n    \"snd_mfdjx\": (6, \"6_snd_mfdjx.mp3\", 9216, 1, 1673),\n    \"snd_jump\": (7, \"7_snd_jump.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_bs\": (8, \"8_snd_bs.mp3\", 13248, 1, 2401),\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\": (9, \"9_snd_hit_heavy.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_fz\": (10, \"10_snd_fz.mp3\", 8992, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit_dian\": (11, \"11_snd_hit_dian.mp3\", 17792, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_baoqi1\": (12, \"12_snd_baoqi1.mp3\", 21572, 2, 4370),\n    \"snd_hit_ice\": (13, \"13_snd_hit_ice.mp3\", 32128, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_def\": (14, \"14_snd_def.mp3\", 13824, 2, 3129),\n    \"snd_hit_fire\": (15, \"15_snd_hit_fire.mp3\", 51350, 2, 9778),\n    \"snd_hitfloor\": (16, \"16_snd_hitfloor.mp3\", 26262, 2, 5202),\n    \"snd_luodi\": (17, \"17_snd_luodi.mp3\", 3990, 2, 1250),\n    \"snd_dash_air\": (18, \"18_snd_dash_air.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\": (19, \"19_snd_hitfloor_heavy.mp3\", 33888, 2, 6450),\n    \"snd_dash\": (20, \"20_snd_dash.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_ghost_step\": (21, \"21_snd_ghost_step.mp3\", 15968, 2, 3330),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\": (22, \"22_snd_hitfloor_low.mp3\", 15296, 2, 3226),\n    \"snd_hit1\": (23, \"23_snd_hit1.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_baoqi\": (24, \"24_snd_baoqi.mp3\", 31505, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_hit_cache\": (25, \"25_snd_hit_cache.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_defx\": (26, \"26_snd_defx.mp3\", 14842, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_kan1\": (27, \"27_snd_kan1.mp3\", 7423, 2, 1874),\n    \"snd_fykanx\": (28, \"28_snd_fykanx.mp3\", 29951, 2, 5930),\n    \"snd_kan2\": (29, \"29_snd_kan2.mp3\", 9024, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit10\": (30, \"30_snd_hit10.mp3\", 10368, 2, 2394),\n    \"snd_hit11\": (31, \"31_snd_hit11.mp3\", 30848, 2, 6034),\n}\n\nRATE_HZ = {1: 11025, 2: 22050}\n\n\ndef dur(samples, rate):\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    ms = samples / hz * 1000\n    return f\"{ms:.0f} ms（{samples} samples / {hz} Hz）\"\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# MovieClip catalog\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# each: title, purpose, hook (markdown), extra (optional extra sections)\n\nMCS = {}\n\n\ndef add_mc(name, title, purpose, hook, extra=None, unused=False, vo_ids=None, view=\"EffectView\"):\n    MCS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"extra\": extra or \"\",\n        \"unused\": unused,\n        \"vo_ids\": vo_ids or [],\n        \"view\": view,\n    }\n\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸段火花\",\n    \"爆气演出后半段（`explodeSp2`）的爆炸剪辑。黑底结束时在角色原坐标播一次。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) 登记 id `explodeSp2`，`className=XG_baoqi`，`sound=snd_baoqi`。启动时 [`EffectVO.cacheBitmapData`]({vo}) 经 [`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) `new` 本类，逐帧光栅化后丢掉 MC。\n\n运行时 [`EffectCtrl.endEnergyExplode`]({ctrl})（`energyExplode` 倒数 0.7s 到期）`doEffectById(\"explodeSp2\")` → [`EffectManager.getEffectView`]({mgr}) 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。触发链：角色 SWF / [`FighterMain.energyExplode`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) → `$effect_ctrler.energyExplode` → [`FighterEffectCtrl`]({fec})。\n\n无 `isSpecial`/`isBuff`/`isSteelHit`。无 `blendMode`（默认 `normal`）。无 freeze/shine/shake。\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, vo=E_VO, am=E_AM, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, fec=E_FEC\n    ),\n    extra=\"前半段是 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md)（`explodeSp` + `snd_baoqi1`）。两段坐标都是调用瞬间的 fighter x/y。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bdj\",\n    \"遗留「绊打击」火花（未登记）\",\n    \"effect.swf 导出的短命中剪辑。`EffectModel` **没有**用这个 `className`。像早期普攻火花，被 `XG_qdj` / `XG_kan2` 取代。\",\n    \"\"\"[`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) 仍能按名 `new` 本类，但 [`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) / `initHitEffect` 从未写入 `_effect`。`doEffectById` / `getHitEffect` 都走不到。启动 `cacheEffects` 也不烘焙本剪辑。\n\n命名：`bdj` ≈ 绊打击。9 帧、每帧都有 Place，比现行轻拳 `XG_qdj`（12 帧）更短。\"\"\".format(am=E_AM, model=E_MODEL),\n    unused=True,\n    extra=\"同类遗留：[`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md)、[`XG_kanx`](XG_kanx.md)、[`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md)、[`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md)、[`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bs\",\n    \"必杀黑底火花\",\n    \"普通必杀（非超必）时在角色头顶偏上播的 add 混合火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha`：`className=XG_bs`，`sound=snd_bs`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.bisha(false, face?)`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.bisha`]({ctrl})：justRenderAnimate + pause + 黑底 + 可选 [`bisha_face_mc`](bisha_face_mc.md) 特写 + 本剪辑在 `(x, y-50)` + 藏地图。超必走 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md)（`bisha_super`），不走本类。\n\n万解 `wanKai` **不用**本类，强制 `bisha_super`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bsq\",\n    \"爆气起手火花\",\n    \"爆气/霸体爆发的前半段（`explodeSp`）。pause + 黑底期间先播这一段。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `explodeSp`：`XG_bsq` + `snd_baoqi1`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.energyExplode`]({ctrl})：pause、黑底（不 fadIn）、藏地图、在 fighter 坐标 `doEffectById(\"explodeSp\")`，然后 `_explodeSkillFrame = 0.7 * FPS_GAME`。到期 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md)。\n\n角色侧同时开超钢体、造 `HitVO`（power 50, hitType 5, 击飞）。本剪辑本身无 freeze/shine。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花\",\n    \"超必杀与万解共用的 add 火花。镜头 zoom 3.5 时播在 `(x, y-50)`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha_super`：`XG_cbs` + `snd_cbs` + `blendMode=add`。\n\n两条入口都到 [`EffectCtrl`]({ctrl})：\n\n- `$effect_ctrler.bisha(true, face?)` → `bisha(..., super=true)` → `cameraFocusOne` zoom 3.5 + 本剪辑\n- `$effect_ctrler.startWanKai(face?)` → `wanKai`：永远当超必，同样本剪辑\n\n普通必杀 `bisha(false)` 用 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md)，不用本类。时间轴长度与 `XG_bs` 同为 17 帧（FLA 里超必/必杀像同一套放大）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_dian_fy\",\n    \"电属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住电属性（hitType 9）时的防御火花。朝向跟攻击者。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initDefenseEffect`]({model}) `defense_9`：`XG_dian_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400ms，`blendMode=add`，`followDirect=true`，电色闪 `0x8288D2` alpha 0.2，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.doDefenseEffect`]({ctrl})：角色 `defenseType==0` 用原始 hitType；`==1` 只把斩系 1→2、6→3，**电仍是 9**。无 `specialEffectId`：防住不挂 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。\n\n未知防御类型回落 `defense_5`（[`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)），不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中火花\",\n    \"火属性攻击打中时的命中火花，并给受击者挂持续燃烧 `fire_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initHitEffect`]({model}) hitType **7 FIRE**：`XG_fire`，`snd_hit_fire`，add，freeze 400，火色闪 `0xFFFF67`，shake pow 6，**`specialEffectId=fire_ing`**。\n\n命中链：`FighterMcCtrler.doHitEffect` → [`EffectCtrl.doHitEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`EffectManager.getEffectVOByHitVO`]({mgr}) clone 本 VO（把 `pow` 抄到 `shake.y`）→ 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。`doEffectVO` 末尾对 `FighterMain` 再 `doSpecialEffect(\"fire_ing\")` → [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) + [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})。\n\n防御命中走 [`XG_fire_fy`](XG_fire_fy.md)，不挂燃烧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, spec=E_SPEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire_fy\",\n    \"火属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住火属性时的防御火花。防住不挂燃烧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_7`：`XG_fire_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，火色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n无 `specialEffectId`。朝向用攻击者 `direct`（`EffectCtrl` + VO.`followDirect`）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻斩（hitType 1）时的短火花。轻防套餐：freeze 50ms、无闪无震。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_1`：`XG_fykan`，`snd_fykan`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1`（拳防角色）会把斩 1 改成拳 2，改播 [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)，看不到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重斩（hitType 6）时的重防火花。带白闪（shine 自带 `blendMode=screen`）和震屏。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_6`：`XG_fykanx`，`snd_fykanx`，freeze 400，add，shine 白 alpha 0.1 **且 shine.blendMode=screen**（其它重防 shine 没写 blend），`followDirect`，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n拳防角色把 6→3，改播 [`XG_fyqx`](XG_fyqx.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyq\",\n    \"轻拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻拳（hitType 2）时的短火花。也是斩→拳防映射的落点。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_2`：`XG_fyq`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1` 时轻斩也会落到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyqx\",\n    \"重拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重拳（hitType 3）时的重防火花。拳防角色挡重斩也走这里。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_3`：`XG_fyqx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 alpha 0.1，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\",\n    \"死神辅助出场火花\",\n    \"死神阵营（`comicType!=1`）助战进场时的短火花。声用 `snd_dash`（不是 `snd_fz`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_bleach`：`XG_fz_bleach_mc` + `snd_dash`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.assisterEffect`]({ctrl})：`comicType==1` → [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)，否则本类。`FighterEventCtrl.addAssister` 与 `AssisiterCtrler.finish` 调。\n\n助战 SWF 自己还会 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 等，那是另一套必杀黑底，不是本剪辑。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\",\n    \"火影辅助出场火花\",\n    \"火影阵营（`comicType==1`）助战进场火花。声用 `snd_fz`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_naruto`：`XG_fz_naruto_mc` + `snd_fz`。\n\n与死神出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 成对。替身 [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md) 也复用 `snd_fz`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀火花（未登记）\",\n    \"导出名像「辅助必杀」。`EffectModel` 未登记。配对音 [`snd_fzbs`](snd_fzbs.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"助战进场只用 `fz_bleach` / `fz_naruto`。助战时间轴若 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 走的是全局 `XG_bs`/`XG_cbs`，不是本类。\n\n10 帧短剪辑。启动不烘焙。\"\"\".format(),\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步残影火花\",\n    \"鬼步移动时脚下/身后的 add 火花。走路循环在鬼步状态下反复 `doEffectById`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ghost_step`：`XG_ghost_step`，`snd_ghost_step`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n两条声：**VO 的 `snd_ghost_step`** 在 `EffectView.start` 播；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`]({ctrl}) 另外 `SoundCtrl.playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（主 SWF 嵌入，不在本库）。\n\n触发：`$effect_ctrler.ghostStep` 开演出（pause + 黑底 + justRender 物理仍走）；之后 [`FighterEffectCtrl.walk`]({fec}) 若 `_inGhostStep` 则反复本 id，而不是 `step1/2/3` 脚步。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0 的着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor`：`XG_hitfloor` + `snd_hitfloor`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(0)`]({ctrl}) ← [`FighterEffectCtrl.hitFloor`]({fec})。强度 1 走 [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)；强度 2 走 [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md) **外加** [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 烟。\n\n主动落地（跳下）是 [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md) `touch_floor`，不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中火花\",\n    \"冰属性打中时的命中火花，并挂持续冰冻 `ice_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **8 ICE**：`XG_ice`，`snd_hit_ice`，add，`specialEffectId=ice_ing`，freeze 400，冰色闪 `0xA3E5F5`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_ice_ing`](xg_ice_ing.md)。遗留变体 [`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md) 未登记。防御走 [`XG_ice_fy`](XG_ice_fy.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice2\",\n    \"遗留冰击火花（未登记）\",\n    \"22 帧冰剪辑，比现行 [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)（11 帧）长一倍。`initHitEffect(8)` 用的是 `XG_ice`，本类不进表。\",\n    \"\"\"无 `EffectVO`、不烘焙、无声绑定。像旧版冰命中或另一套冰爆。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice_fy\",\n    \"冰属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住冰属性时的防御火花。防住不挂冰冻。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_8`：`XG_ice_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，冰色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump\",\n    \"起跳尘\",\n    \"地面起跳时脚下的尘。坐标用 **display** x/y，不是逻辑坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump`：`XG_jump` + `snd_jump`。无 add。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.jump`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.jumpEffect`]({ctrl})。空中二段跳走 [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)，共用 `snd_jump`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump_air\",\n    \"空中跳火花\",\n    \"空中再跳（二段跳）的 add 火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump_air`：`XG_jump_air`，`snd_jump`，`blendMode=add`。地面跳 [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md) 无 add。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.jumpAirEffect`]({ctrl})。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan\",\n    \"遗留轻斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧轻斩剪辑（12 帧）。现行 hitType 1 用 [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)（10 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initHitEffect(1, \"XG_kan2\", …)`。钢体斩也用 `XG_kan2`。本类不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan2\",\n    \"轻斩命中 / 钢体斩火花\",\n    \"轻斩（hitType 1）命中火花；钢体受斩复用同一剪辑、另一份 VO。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 [`EffectVO`]({vo}) 都 `className=XG_kan2`，`cacheEffects` **各烘焙一次**：\n\n| id | 用途 | 声 | freeze | 其它 |\n|----|------|----|--------|------|\n| `hit_1` | 普通轻斩 | `snd_kan1` | 50ms | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_kan` | 钢体挨斩 | `snd_hit11` | 400ms | add，白闪 0.2，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit`，**无 shake** |\n\n普通路径 [`EffectView`]({view})；钢体 [`SteelHitEffect`]({steel})（`setTarget` 改色，freeze 结束 `resumeColor`）。\n\n遗留 [`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md) 不用。\"\"\".format(vo=E_VO, view=E_VIEW, steel=E_STEEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx\",\n    \"遗留重斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧重斩（21 帧）。现行 hitType 6 用 [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"钢体没有单独的重斩 id，重斩打钢体仍按 hitType 走 `steel_hit_kan` → `XG_kan2`。本类完全闲置。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx2\",\n    \"重斩命中火花\",\n    \"重斩（hitType 6）命中火花。重击套餐：400ms freeze + 白闪 + 震屏 + 随机旋转。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **6 KAN_HEAVY**：`XG_kanx2`，`snd_kan2`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake `pow:6, time:400`（[`EffectManager`]({mgr}) 把 pow 抄到 `shake.y`）。\n\n无 `isSteelHit`。无 `specialEffectId`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, mgr=E_MGR),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_leidian\",\n    \"电属性命中火花\",\n    \"电属性打中时的命中火花（**hardlight** 混合），并挂持续感电 `shock_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **9 ELECTRIC**：`XG_leidian`，`snd_hit_dian`，**`blendMode=hardlight`**（命中表里唯一 hardlight），`specialEffectId=shock_ing`，freeze 400，电色闪 `0x8288D2`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。遗留 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 未用。防御 [`XG_dian_fy`](XG_dian_fy.md) 用 add 不是 hardlight。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地尘\",\n    \"自己跳下/落下触地的尘，不是受击砸地。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `touch_floor`：`XG_luodi` + `snd_luodi`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.touchFloor`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.touchFloorEffect`]({ctrl})。受击落地是 `hit_floor*`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdj\",\n    \"轻法命中 / 钢体法火花\",\n    \"轻法/忍术/鬼道（hitType 4）命中火花；钢体受法复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO，同 `className=XG_mfdj`，各烘焙一次：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_4` MAGIC | `snd_hit2`（和轻拳同一声） | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_mfdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n轻拳火花是 [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)，剪辑不同、声相同。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法命中 / 破防火花\",\n    \"重法（hitType 5）命中火花；破防 `break_def` **复用同一剪辑**、另一份 VO（freeze 更长、震的是 x 不是 pow）。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | shake | 其它 |\n|----|----|--------|-------|------|\n| `hit_5` MAGIC_HEAVY | `snd_mfdjx` | 400 | `pow:6, time:400` → 抄到 y | add，`randRotate`，白闪 0.2 |\n| `break_def` | `snd_mfdjx` | **500** | **`x:6, time:400`**（不是 pow） | add，**无** randRotate / shine |\n\n`FighterMcCtrler` 破防 `doEffectById(\"break_def\")`。爆气判定 hitType 也是 5，命中火花走 `hit_5` 这份，不是 break_def。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffy\",\n    \"轻法防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻法（hitType 4）时的短火花。声与轻拳防相同（`snd_def`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_4`：`XG_mffy`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffyx\",\n    \"重法防御火花 / 未知防御回落\",\n    \"挡住重法（hitType 5）时的重防火花。`getDefenseEffect` 对未登记类型（含抓 11）回落到本条。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_5`：`XG_mffyx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 **alpha 0.15**（其它重防 0.1，属性防 0.2），shake pow 6。\n\n`getDefenseEffect`：没有 `defense_N` 则用 `defense_5`。无 `defense_11`，抓技防住也会看到本火花。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdj\",\n    \"轻拳命中 / 钢体拳火花\",\n    \"轻拳/打击（hitType 2）命中火花；钢体挨打复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_2` DA | `snd_hit2` | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_qdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n遗留轻击声 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 未绑到任何 VO。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx\",\n    \"重拳命中火花\",\n    \"重拳（hitType 3）命中火花。重击套餐。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **3 DA_HEAVY**：`XG_qdjx`，`snd_hit_heavy`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n遗留 [`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md) 未用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx2\",\n    \"遗留重拳火花（未登记）\",\n    \"13 帧重拳变体。现行 hitType 3 用 [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"无 VO。命名 `qdjx2` 与斩系 `kan2`/`kanx2`「第二版」同一套替换习惯，但这条没切过去。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush\",\n    \"地面冲刺残影\",\n    \"地面 dash 时的残影剪辑。声绑的是 **`snd_dash_air`**，不是 `snd_dash`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash`：`XG_rush`，`sound=snd_dash_air`（地面/空中冲刺共用空中声）。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.dash`]({fec})：不在空中 → 本 id；在空中 → [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。`snd_dash` 实际给死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush_air\",\n    \"空中冲刺残影\",\n    \"空中 dash 残影。与地面冲刺共用 `snd_dash_air`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash_air`：`XG_rush_air` + `snd_dash_air`。22 帧，比地面 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md)（20 帧）略长。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen\",\n    \"替身第一段\",\n    \"死神受身/替身演出的第一段火花。pause + 黑底时立刻播在**位移前**的坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp`：`XG_tishen` + `snd_fz`（和火影辅助出场同一声）。\n\n[`FighterMain.replaceSkill`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) 先 `move(250*direct)`、idle、无敌；[`EffectCtrl.replaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再 pause、黑底、藏地图、本剪辑（坐标是调用瞬间，位移已发生）、hold 1 秒逻辑帧。第一拍 [`renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再播 [`XG_tishen2`](XG_tishen2.md)。\n\n火影受身走爆气 `energyExplode`，不走替身。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"本剪辑 35 帧，是 SWF 里最长的普通火花之一（必杀脸 71 帧除外）。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen2\",\n    \"替身第二段（无声）\",\n    \"替身黑底期间第 1 逻辑帧补上的第二段。VO 无 sound。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp2`：只有 `className=XG_tishen2`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl})：`frame==1` 时在记下的 pos 播本 id。1 秒后 `endReplaceSkill` resume。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺火花（未登记）\",\n    \"25 帧、几乎每帧 Place 的冲刺剪辑。现行 dash 用 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md) / [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。配对 [`snd_xdash`](snd_xdash.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"`xdash` ≈ 横冲。启动不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\",\n    \"KO 背景闪光\",\n    \"有人在必杀中被 KO 时垫到 GameState 最底的短循环背景。5 帧，靠 `holdFrame` 撑满约 2 秒。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `kobg`：裸 VO，无声、无 add。\n\n[`FightUI.playKO`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) 若任一方 `actionState` 12/13（必杀/超必）→ [`EffectCtrl.BGEffect(\"kobg\", 2)`]({ctrl})：\n\n1. `addEffect` 在 (0,0)\n2. `holdFrame = 2 * 30 = 60` 动画拍（后置 `--` 实际 61 拍 ≈ 2s@30fps）\n3. 再挂 remove 回调恢复地图；立刻 `getMap().setVisible(false)`\n4. `addChildAt(display, 0)` 到 **GameState**（不是 `_playerLayer`）\n\n[`EffectView`]({view}) 播到缓存末帧会绕回 0 直到 hold 到期。烘焙跳过最后一帧：5 帧 MC → 缓存 4 张循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, view=E_VIEW),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 循环光\",\n    \"防御 buff 持续期间跟随角色脚底的循环光。`isBuff=true` → `BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initBuffEffect`]({model}) id `buff_defense`：`xg_buff_defense`，add，`isBuff`。无声、无 `targetColorOffset`。\n\n[`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterBuffCtrler.md) 先 `doEffectById(\"buff_effect_defense\")` 播一次性 [`xg_buff_effect_defense`](xg_buff_effect_defense.md)，再 `doBuffEffect(\"buff_defense\")` → [`BuffEffectView`]({buff})：`loopPlay=true`，逻辑帧跟 `FighterBuffVO.finished`。到期 `remove`，不改色（表无 offset）。\n\n8 帧短循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, buff=E_BUFF),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上防御 buff 时的一次性爆发。**没有** `isBuff`，普通 `EffectView`，播完即删。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_defense`：只有 add。`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp` 经 `doEffectById`。17 帧。\n\n不要和持续光 [`xg_buff_defense`](xg_buff_defense.md) 搞混。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上攻击 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_power`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.attackUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_power`](xg_buff_power.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上速度 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_speed`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.speedUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_speed`](xg_buff_speed.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 循环光\",\n    \"攻击 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_power`：add，`isBuff`。`attackUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 循环光\",\n    \"速度 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_speed`：add，`isBuff`。`speedUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_catch_hit\",\n    \"抓取命中火花\",\n    \"抓技（hitType 11 CATCH）打中时的火花。无 add、无随机旋转；freeze 400ms。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **11**：`xg_catch_hit`，`snd_hit_cache`，freeze 400。没有 shine/shake/randRotate/blendMode。\n\n无 `defense_11`：挡住抓回落 [`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)。无 `hit_10` STONE。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing\",\n    \"感电持续环绕\",\n    \"电属性命中后挂在受击者身上的持续特效。`isSpecial` → `SpecialEffectView`。带 `loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initSpeicalEffect`]({model})（原拼写）id `shock_ing`：`xg_dian_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[50,-75,255]` 偏蓝紫。\n\n由 hitType 9 的 `specialEffectId` 触发 → [`EffectCtrl.doSpecialEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})：跟随 fighter，上色；`actionState` 落到 0/23/24（站立/倒地/弹起）则 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")` + `resumeColor`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F6 | [`EffectView.renderFrameLabel`]({view}) 看到 `\"loop\"` → `gotoAndPlay(1)`（位图下标 1，不是开头 0）。? 与 1-based 帧号错一位 |\n| `finish` | F7 | 基类忽略；`SpecialEffectView` 显式 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")`。key 是 MC 帧号 7，赋给 0-based `_curFrame`，可能错一位/越界。? |\n\n21 帧。烘焙跳过最后一帧 → 缓存 20。无 `loopPlay`（对比 buff）：持续段靠 `\"loop\"` 标签或片子够长；没有可靠 loop 时可能播完 autoRemove，角色还带着染色。?\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, spec=E_SPEC, view=E_VIEW\n    ),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n    extra=\"遗留更长变体 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 同样有 loop/finish，但表用的是本类。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\",\n    \"遗留感电持续（未登记）\",\n    \"23 帧感电环绕，标签 `F8:loop` / `F9:finish`。现行 `shock_ing` 用 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)（21 帧，loop 在 F6）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initSpeicalEffect` 只写 `xg_dian_ing`。本类不烘焙。标签布局与正式三条 special 同一套（先 loop 再 finish 紧挨着），像旧版电环。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_fire_ing\",\n    \"燃烧持续环绕\",\n    \"火属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色被染成全黑。`loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fire_ing`：`xg_fire_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[-255,-255,-255]`。hitType 7 的 `specialEffectId`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F12 | `renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | F13 | `SpecialEffectView` 在 idle/倒地/弹起时跳到这里，停止跟随并 `resumeColor` |\n\n25 帧 → 缓存 24。被打 21 / 击飞 22 **不**结束，火跟到落地或回 idle。死亡 30 不在 case 里，可能跟尸体到播完。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地火花（原拼写 fllor）\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2 的重砸地火花。符号名少一个 o：`fllor`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_heavy`：`className=xg_hitfllor_heavy`（必须逐字匹配），`snd_hitfloor_heavy`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(2)`]({ctrl}) **同时**再播 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md)（lighten 烟、无声）。本剪辑本身 normal 混合。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"引擎注释已标明这是原拼写，不是反编译错误。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1 的轻着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_low`：`xg_hitfloor_low` + `snd_hitfloor_low`。`hitFloorEffect(1)`。无烟。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\",\n    \"重砸地烟（lighten）\",\n    \"重砸地额外一层烟。`blendMode=lighten`，无声。只在强度 2 时和 heavy 火花一起播。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_yan`：只有 lighten。`hitFloorEffect(2)` 在 heavy 之后再 `doEffectById`。两份 View 同坐标叠画。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitover\",\n    \"KO 收招火花\",\n    \"KO 演出收招时的火花。裸 VO：无声、无 add。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_end`：`xg_hitover`。\n\n[`FightUI`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) KO：关 `freezeEnabled`、`doEffectById(\"hit_end\")`、shine、可选 `BGEffect(\"kobg\")`、shake、`slowDown(2,0)`。24 帧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_ice_ing\",\n    \"冰冻持续环绕\",\n    \"冰属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色加蓝。`loop`/`finish` 在很靠前的帧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ice_ing`：`xg_ice_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[0,0,255]`。hitType 8。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | **F5** | 三条 special 里 loop 最早。`renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | **F6** | 倒地/idle 跳结束段 |\n\n26 帧（special 里最长）→ 缓存 25。loop 在 F5 意味着循环体很短，前面 4 帧是入场。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Sounds\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSNDS = {}\n\n\ndef add_snd(name, title, purpose, hook, unused=False):\n    SNDS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"unused\": unused,\n    }\n\n\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸声\",\n    \"爆气后半段 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md) 的爆炸声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp2` VO.`sound`。`EffectView.start` → [`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) → [`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) `new` 本类。每次 start 新实例，无法 stop。\"\n    % (E_SND, E_AM),\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi1\",\n    \"爆气起手声\",\n    \"爆气前半段 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md) 的起手声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp` VO.`sound`。后半段换 [`snd_baoqi`](snd_baoqi.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_bs\",\n    \"必杀火花声\",\n    \"普通必杀火花 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha` VO.`sound`。超必用 [`snd_cbs`](snd_cbs.md)。黑底/特写无独立声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花声\",\n    \"超必与万解火花 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha_super` VO.`sound`。本库 22 kHz 里较长的一条。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash\",\n    \"死神辅助出场声（名义冲刺）\",\n    \"导出名像冲刺，实际绑在死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md)。\",\n    \"`fz_bleach` VO.`sound`。地面/空中 dash **不用**本类，用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。样本数与 `snd_dash_air` 同为 17952，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash_air\",\n    \"冲刺声（地面+空中共用）\",\n    \"地面 `dash` 与空中 `dash_air` 共用这一声。\",\n    \"`XG_rush` / `XG_rush_air` 的 VO.`sound` 都是本 id。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_def\",\n    \"轻防格挡声\",\n    \"轻拳防、轻法防共用。\",\n    \"`defense_2` [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)、`defense_4` [`XG_mffy`](XG_mffy.md)。轻斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykan`](snd_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_defx\",\n    \"重防/属性防格挡声\",\n    \"重拳防、重法防、火/冰/电防都用这一声。\",\n    \"`defense_3/5/7/8/9`。重斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykanx`](snd_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住轻斩的专门格挡声。\",\n    \"`defense_1` [`XG_fykan`](XG_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住重斩的专门格挡声。本库较长的防御音。\",\n    \"`defense_6` [`XG_fykanx`](XG_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fz\",\n    \"火影辅助出场 / 替身声\",\n    \"火影助战进场与替身第一段共用。\",\n    \"`fz_naruto` [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)、`replaceSp` [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md)。死神助战用 [`snd_dash`](snd_dash.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_fzbs`](XG_fzbs.md)。没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写这个 id。\",\n    \"[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) 仍能 `getEffect` 到本类，但引擎从不调。\" % E_SND,\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步火花声\",\n    \"`ghost_step` VO 自带的一声。与主 SWF 的 `snd_ghost_jump` 不是同一个。\",\n    \"[`XG_ghost_step`](XG_ghost_step.md) `EffectView.start` 播本类；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`](%s) 另外 `playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（main 嵌入）。走路循环反复 start 就会反复本声。\"\n    % E_CTRL,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit1\",\n    \"遗留轻击声（未引用）\",\n    \"短命中音。现行轻拳/轻法用 [`snd_hit2`](snd_hit2.md)，轻斩用 [`snd_kan1`](snd_kan1.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO 绑定。样本数与 [`snd_hit_cache`](snd_hit_cache.md) 同为 5344，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit10\",\n    \"遗留命中声（未引用）\",\n    \"中等长度命中音。表里没有 `snd_hit10`。钢体用 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。命名像旧编号序列 `hit1`…`hit11` 的第十号。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit11\",\n    \"钢体受击声\",\n    \"三条钢体火花共用这一声。\",\n    \"`steel_hit_kan` / `steel_hit_qdj` / `steel_hit_mfdj` 都是 `snd_hit11`。普通命中不用。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit2\",\n    \"轻拳 / 轻法命中声\",\n    \"轻打击与轻法共用。\",\n    \"`hit_2` [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)、`hit_4` [`XG_mfdj`](XG_mfdj.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_cache\",\n    \"抓取命中声\",\n    \"抓技打中的一声。id 是 cache（抓住）不是 cache 缓存。\",\n    \"`hit_11` [`xg_catch_hit`](xg_catch_hit.md)。样本数与未用的 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 相同。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_dian\",\n    \"电属性命中声\",\n    \"电属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_9` [`XG_leidian`](XG_leidian.md)。防御电用 [`snd_defx`](snd_defx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中声\",\n    \"火属性打中的一声。本库最长的 MP3。\",\n    \"`hit_7` [`XG_fire`](XG_fire.md)。约 2.3 s@22 kHz，可能含燃烧尾。持续 [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) 无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\",\n    \"重拳命中声\",\n    \"重打击（hitType 3）的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_3` [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)。11 kHz。重斩用 [`snd_kan2`](snd_kan2.md)，重法用 [`snd_mfdjx`](snd_mfdjx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中声\",\n    \"冰属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_8` [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)。持续冰环无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0。\",\n    \"`hit_floor` [`XG_hitfloor`](XG_hitfloor.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2。烟层 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 无声，只有本声。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_heavy` [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_low` [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_jump\",\n    \"跳跃声\",\n    \"地面跳与空中跳共用。11 kHz 短音。\",\n    \"`jump` [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md)、`jump_air` [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan1\",\n    \"轻斩命中声\",\n    \"轻斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_1` [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)。钢体斩改 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan2\",\n    \"重斩命中声\",\n    \"重斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_6` [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地声\",\n    \"自己触地。本库最短的一条。\",\n    \"`touch_floor` [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md)。约 180 ms。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法 / 破防声\",\n    \"重法命中与破防火花共用。11 kHz。\",\n    \"`hit_5` 与 `break_def` 都是本 id（剪辑都是 [`XG_mfdjx`](XG_mfdjx.md)）。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。现行冲刺用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。SWF 里 char id 1，像最早导出的音。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\n\ndef labels_md(labels):\n    if not labels:\n        return \"无帧标签、无 `addFrameScript`。\"\n    rows = \"\\n\".join(f\"| {fr} | `{name}` |\" for fr, name in labels)\n    return \"有标签：\\n\\n| 帧 | 标签 |\\n|----|------|\\n\" + rows\n\n\ndef write_mc(name):\n    meta = MCS[name]\n    cid, frames, places, labels = SPRITES[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    cache_n = frames - 1\n    lab = labels_md(labels)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未登记**：`EffectModel` 从不 `getEffect` 本 `className`。启动不烘焙。仍导出，[`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) 能 `new`。\"\n        % E_AM\n        if unused\n        else f\"运行时 **不**再 `new` 本 MC：只在 `EffectModel.initlize` → `cacheBitmapData` 时实例化一次，画成 {cache_n} 张位图（**最后一帧不烘**，见 [`EffectVO`]({E_VO})）。之后 [`EffectView`]({E_VIEW}) 只播 Bitmap。\"\n    )\n    extra = meta[\"extra\"]\n    extra_sec = f\"\\n{extra}\\n\" if extra else \"\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n{status}\n\nSWF：`assets/effect.swf` DefineSprite **char {cid}**（FFDec `symbol{cid}`），**{frames} 帧** @30fps，约 {places} 次 Place。{lab} 运行时无帧脚本。\n\n{extra_sec}\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends MovieClip`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol{cid}\")]`：FFDec 把 sprite {cid} 链到本类。真正运行不走 Flex Embed，靠 ZIP 里整份 `effect.swf` 的 SymbolClass。\n- **L6** 类名必须与 `EffectVO.className` / `AssetManager.getClass` 逐字相同（大小写敏感）。\n- **L9–12 ` {name}()`**：`super()`。无字段、无 `stop`、无标签脚本。时间轴默认从 F1 播到尾；烘焙时 `gotoAndStop(1)` 再 `nextFrame` 扫。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_snd(name):\n    meta = SNDS[name]\n    cid, embed, samples, rate, datalen = SOUNDS[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    d = dur(samples, rate)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未引用**：没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写本 id。`playEffectSound` 仍能 `getEffect` 到。\"\n        if unused\n        else \"运行时每次 `EffectView.start` 都 `new` 一份再 `Sound.play(0,0,transform)`，不循环、不 stop、不进对象池。\"\n    )\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n声音和 MC 走同一条 [`AssetManager.getEffect(className)`]({E_AM})：从 `\"assets/effect.swf\"` `getClass` 再 `new`。[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`]({E_SND}) 把返回值当 `Sound`。`playAssetSound` 走另一套 `sounds/` 加载器，**不**进本库。\n\n{status}\n\nSWF DefineSound **char {cid}**：MP3（fmt=2），{hz} Hz，16-bit mono，{d}，payload {datalen} B。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends Sound`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/{embed}\")]`：FFDec 拆出的 MP3。运行时是 SWF 里的 DefineSound，不是单独文件。\n- **L6** 类名 = `EffectVO.sound` 字符串。\n- **L9–12 `{name}()`**：`super()`。无循环点、无音量。音量靠 `SoundCtrl._sndTransform`。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_bisha():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"bisha_face_mc.md\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).bisha_face_mc` — 必杀特写脸底 MC\n\n一句话目的：必杀/万解黑底上的特写容器。左右槽 `facemc1`/`facemc2` 给角色 SWF 导出的脸 Bitmap；时间轴 71 帧，F71 标签 `destory` 且 `stop()`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/bisha_face_mc.as`（25 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不走** `EffectModel` / `EffectView` 光栅化。唯一实例化：[`BishaFaceEffectView`]({E_FACE}) 构造 `AssetManager.I.getEffect(\"bisha_face_mc\")` → 每次 `new` 一份活 MC。\n\n链：\n\n```\n$effect_ctrler.bisha / startWanKai\n  → FighterEffectCtrl.getFace (new 角色 bsface BitmapData)\n  → EffectCtrl.bisha / wanKai → showFace\n       比双方 display.x：自己在右 → 槽 2，否则 1\n  → BlackBackView.showBishaFace\n       第一次 new BishaFaceEffectView（本 MC）\n       setFace(slot, bmp) 拉伸 254×180 塞进 facemcN\n       fadIn → gotoAndPlay(2)\n```\n\n见 [`BlackBackView`]({E_BLACK})、[`EffectCtrl.showFace`]({E_CTRL})。替身/爆气/鬼步只有黑底，**不**挂本 MC。\n\n`fadOut` 拆特写；`BlackBackView` 把 `_bishaFace` 置 null，下次必杀再 new。多次必杀可能在黑底上堆停住的旧 MC。?\n\n## 时间轴\n\nSWF DefineSprite **char 926**（`symbol926`），**71 帧** @30fps，约 168 次 Place。嵌套未导出 sprite 922（5 帧）、923（1 帧空，F1 两个 depth 先放着）。\n\n| 帧 / 标签 | 行为 |\n|-----------|------|\n| F1 | 默认停在这里（构造未 play）。多半空/准备。槽位实例已在。 |\n| F2 | [`BishaFaceEffectView.fadIn`]({E_FACE}) `gotoAndPlay(2)` 入场起点 |\n| F2–F70 | 入场动画。无其它脚本 |\n| **F71 标签 `destory`**（原拼写） | `addFrameScript(70, frame71)` → `stop()`。之后停在末帧直到下次 fadIn 或黑底被摘 |\n\n无 `loop`。退场不是时间轴倒放，是整块 `BlackBackView` 从 `GameState` 摘掉。\n\n公开实例：\n\n| 字段 | 用途 |\n|------|------|\n| `facemc1` | 左槽（自己 x ≤ 对手，或无对手） |\n| `facemc2` | 右槽（自己 x > 对手） |\n\n脸图来自各角色 SWF `defineBishaFace` 的 BitmapData 类，不是本库。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class bisha_face_mc extends MovieClip`。\n\n### 字段（L9–11）\n\n- **L9** `facemc1:MovieClip`\n- **L11** `facemc2:MovieClip`\n\nFLA 实例名。`BishaFaceEffectView.setFace` 用 `mc[\"facemc\" + slot]` 动态取。槽号不是 1/2 或时间轴还没建实例则脸丢掉。\n\n### `bisha_face_mc()`（L13–17）\n\n- **L15** `super();`\n- **L16** `addFrameScript(70, this.frame71);` — 0-based 70 = 时间轴 **F71**。\n\n### `frame71`（时间轴 F71，L19–23）\n\n- **L21** `stop();` — 停在特写停留帧。标签名 `destory` 引擎不读；真正销毁是 `BishaFaceEffectView.destory` / 黑底 fadOut。\n\n无 `gotoAndPlay`、无 COMPLETE 事件。引擎也不听 COMPLETE。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_main():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"effect_fla\" / \"MainTimeline.md\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    md = f\"\"\"# `effect_fla.MainTimeline` — effect.swf 文档类（F1 停）\n\n一句话目的：`assets/effect.swf` 的文档类。根时间轴 8 帧、30fps；F1 `stop`。引擎从不 `new` 本类，只把整份 SWF `addSwf` 进 `KyoClassLoader`，按 **链接名** `getClass`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/effect_fla/MainTimeline.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`AssetManager.loadBasic`]({E_AM}) 拉 ZIP 内 `assets/effect.swf`，完成后 [`KyoClassLoader.addSwf`](../../engine/kyo/loader/KyoClassLoader.md)`(\"assets/effect.swf\", loader)`。之后：\n\n- `getEffect(className)` → `getClass(name, \"assets/effect.swf\")` → `new`\n- [`MainGame.loadGameBack`](../../engine/game/bvn/MainGame.md) → [`EffectModel.I.initlize`]({E_MODEL}) 对表里每个 `className` `cacheBitmapData`\n\nLoader 的 `content` 才是本 `MainTimeline`。引擎只留 domain，不把 content 加到舞台。F1 `stop` 防止这份 content 在内存里空转 8 帧循环。\n\n根时间轴 8 帧、无场景标签、无导出实例。真正用的是 SymbolClass 里那 88 个链接（57 个 MC + 31 个 Sound；本类是 char 0）。\n\n对照：UI 的 `common_ui_fla.MainTimeline` 同样 F1 停、同样只灌域。\n\nABC 调试路径习惯与 UI 相同（FLA 在 `…/fla/`）。本文件无 `[Embed]`——它就是这份 SWF 自己。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\nFLA 文档包 `effect_fla`。`public dynamic class MainTimeline extends MovieClip`。无公开字段。\n\n### `MainTimeline()`（L9–13）\n\n- **L11** `super();`\n- **L12** `addFrameScript(0, this.frame1);` — 0-based 0 = 时间轴 **F1**。\n\n### `frame1`（时间轴 F1，L15–18）\n\n- **L17** `stop();` — 文档停在空白。F2–F8 空，到不了。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    (OUT / \"scripts\").mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    # order: XG_* then bisha, MainTimeline, kobg, snd_*, xg_*\n    # write all MCS except bisha (custom)\n    for name in sorted(MCS, key=lambda n: n.lower()):\n        write_mc(name)\n    write_bisha()\n    write_main()\n    for name in sorted(SNDS):\n        write_snd(name)\n\n    # verify count\n    mds = list((OUT / \"scripts\").rglob(\"*.md\"))\n    print(f\"TOTAL md under scripts: {len(mds)}\")\n    expected = 89\n    if len(mds) != expected:\n        print(\"WARNING expected\", expected, \"got\", len(mds))\n        listed = {p.stem for p in mds}\n        print(\"files\", sorted(listed))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\"\"\"\n# end\n)\n","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"Generate line-by-line Chinese annotations for effect.swf scripts.\"\"\"\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nOUT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/effect\")\nSRC_ROOT = \"decompiled/other/effect/scripts\"\n\nE_CTRL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/EffectCtrl.md\"\nE_MGR = \"../../engine/game/bvn/utils/EffectManager.md\"\nE_VO = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectVO.md\"\nE_MODEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectModel.md\"\nE_VIEW = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/EffectView.md\"\nE_SPEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SpecialEffectView.md\"\nE_BUFF = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BuffEffectView.md\"\nE_STEEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SteelHitEffect.md\"\nE_FACE = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BishaFaceEffectView.md\"\nE_BLACK = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BlackBackView.md\"\nE_FEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterEffectCtrl.md\"\nE_SND = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/SoundCtrl.md\"\nE_AM = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/AssetManager.md\"\nE_HIT = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/HitType.md\"\n\n# SWF sprite metadata: name -> (char_id, frames, places, labels)\nSPRITES = {\n    \"xg_ice_ing\": (48, 26, 12, [(\"F5\", \"loop\"), (\"F6\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_fire_ing\": (73, 25, 12, [(\"F12\", \"loop\"), (\"F13\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\": (104, 23, 15, [(\"F8\", \"loop\"), (\"F9\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing\": (131, 21, 13, [(\"F6\", \"loop\"), (\"F7\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_buff_speed\": (140, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_power\": (141, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\": (158, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\": (159, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\": (160, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_defense\": (161, 8, 4, []),\n    \"XG_jump_air\": (172, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_jump\": (181, 10, 4, []),\n    \"XG_luodi\": (196, 10, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitover\": (217, 24, 10, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\": (246, 18, 14, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\": (261, 14, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\": (280, 18, 9, []),\n    \"XG_ghost_step\": (313, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\": (336, 11, 11, []),\n    \"XG_rush_air\": (365, 22, 14, []),\n    \"XG_rush\": (386, 20, 10, []),\n    \"xg_catch_hit\": (397, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_xdash\": (446, 25, 24, []),\n    \"XG_tishen2\": (467, 18, 10, []),\n    \"XG_tishen\": (470, 35, 25, []),\n    \"XG_kanx2\": (507, 17, 18, []),\n    \"XG_kanx\": (508, 21, 10, []),\n    \"XG_kan2\": (519, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_kan\": (532, 12, 6, []),\n    \"XG_hitfloor\": (543, 13, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyqx\": (554, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyq\": (571, 10, 9, []),\n    \"XG_fykanx\": (602, 19, 15, []),\n    \"XG_fykan\": (603, 15, 7, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx2\": (634, 13, 15, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx\": (651, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_qdj\": (662, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_mffyx\": (663, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_mffy\": (678, 11, 7, []),\n    \"XG_mfdjx\": (679, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_mfdj\": (690, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_leidian\": (701, 12, 5, []),\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\": (712, 5, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice2\": (743, 22, 15, []),\n    \"XG_ice_fy\": (754, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice\": (765, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\": (776, 12, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fzbs\": (787, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fire_fy\": (802, 15, 8, []),\n    \"XG_fire\": (825, 23, 11, []),\n    \"XG_dian_fy\": (828, 16, 8, []),\n    \"XG_cbs\": (841, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bs\": (842, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bsq\": (875, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_bdj\": (894, 9, 9, []),\n    \"XG_baoqi\": (911, 15, 8, []),\n    \"bisha_face_mc\": (926, 71, 168, [(\"F71\", \"destory\")]),\n}\n\n# sounds: name -> (char_id, embed_file, samples, rate_code, datalen)\n# rate 1=11025, 2=22050\nSOUNDS = {\n    \"snd_xdash\": (1, \"1_snd_xdash.mp3\", 25144, 2, 4994),\n    \"snd_fykan\": (2, \"2_snd_fykan.mp3\", 13750, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_hit2\": (3, \"3_snd_hit2.mp3\", 16128, 2, 3434),\n    \"snd_cbs\": (4, \"4_snd_cbs.mp3\", 29952, 2, 6769),\n    \"snd_fzbs\": (5, \"5_snd_fzbs.mp3\", 20160, 2, 4559),\n    \"snd_mfdjx\": (6, \"6_snd_mfdjx.mp3\", 9216, 1, 1673),\n    \"snd_jump\": (7, \"7_snd_jump.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_bs\": (8, \"8_snd_bs.mp3\", 13248, 1, 2401),\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\": (9, \"9_snd_hit_heavy.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_fz\": (10, \"10_snd_fz.mp3\", 8992, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit_dian\": (11, \"11_snd_hit_dian.mp3\", 17792, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_baoqi1\": (12, \"12_snd_baoqi1.mp3\", 21572, 2, 4370),\n    \"snd_hit_ice\": (13, \"13_snd_hit_ice.mp3\", 32128, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_def\": (14, \"14_snd_def.mp3\", 13824, 2, 3129),\n    \"snd_hit_fire\": (15, \"15_snd_hit_fire.mp3\", 51350, 2, 9778),\n    \"snd_hitfloor\": (16, \"16_snd_hitfloor.mp3\", 26262, 2, 5202),\n    \"snd_luodi\": (17, \"17_snd_luodi.mp3\", 3990, 2, 1250),\n    \"snd_dash_air\": (18, \"18_snd_dash_air.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\": (19, \"19_snd_hitfloor_heavy.mp3\", 33888, 2, 6450),\n    \"snd_dash\": (20, \"20_snd_dash.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_ghost_step\": (21, \"21_snd_ghost_step.mp3\", 15968, 2, 3330),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\": (22, \"22_snd_hitfloor_low.mp3\", 15296, 2, 3226),\n    \"snd_hit1\": (23, \"23_snd_hit1.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_baoqi\": (24, \"24_snd_baoqi.mp3\", 31505, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_hit_cache\": (25, \"25_snd_hit_cache.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_defx\": (26, \"26_snd_defx.mp3\", 14842, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_kan1\": (27, \"27_snd_kan1.mp3\", 7423, 2, 1874),\n    \"snd_fykanx\": (28, \"28_snd_fykanx.mp3\", 29951, 2, 5930),\n    \"snd_kan2\": (29, \"29_snd_kan2.mp3\", 9024, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit10\": (30, \"30_snd_hit10.mp3\", 10368, 2, 2394),\n    \"snd_hit11\": (31, \"31_snd_hit11.mp3\", 30848, 2, 6034),\n}\n\nRATE_HZ = {1: 11025, 2: 22050}\n\n\ndef dur(samples, rate):\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    ms = samples / hz * 1000\n    return f\"{ms:.0f} ms（{samples} samples / {hz} Hz）\"\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# MovieClip catalog\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# each: title, purpose, hook (markdown), extra (optional extra sections)\n\nMCS = {}\n\n\ndef add_mc(name, title, purpose, hook, extra=None, unused=False, vo_ids=None, view=\"EffectView\"):\n    MCS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"extra\": extra or \"\",\n        \"unused\": unused,\n        \"vo_ids\": vo_ids or [],\n        \"view\": view,\n    }\n\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸段火花\",\n    \"爆气演出后半段（`explodeSp2`）的爆炸剪辑。黑底结束时在角色原坐标播一次。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) 登记 id `explodeSp2`，`className=XG_baoqi`，`sound=snd_baoqi`。启动时 [`EffectVO.cacheBitmapData`]({vo}) 经 [`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) `new` 本类，逐帧光栅化后丢掉 MC。\n\n运行时 [`EffectCtrl.endEnergyExplode`]({ctrl})（`energyExplode` 倒数 0.7s 到期）`doEffectById(\"explodeSp2\")` → [`EffectManager.getEffectView`]({mgr}) 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。触发链：角色 SWF / [`FighterMain.energyExplode`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) → `$effect_ctrler.energyExplode` → [`FighterEffectCtrl`]({fec})。\n\n无 `isSpecial`/`isBuff`/`isSteelHit`。无 `blendMode`（默认 `normal`）。无 freeze/shine/shake。\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, vo=E_VO, am=E_AM, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, fec=E_FEC\n    ),\n    extra=\"前半段是 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md)（`explodeSp` + `snd_baoqi1`）。两段坐标都是调用瞬间的 fighter x/y。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bdj\",\n    \"遗留「绊打击」火花（未登记）\",\n    \"effect.swf 导出的短命中剪辑。`EffectModel` **没有**用这个 `className`。像早期普攻火花，被 `XG_qdj` / `XG_kan2` 取代。\",\n    \"\"\"[`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) 仍能按名 `new` 本类，但 [`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) / `initHitEffect` 从未写入 `_effect`。`doEffectById` / `getHitEffect` 都走不到。启动 `cacheEffects` 也不烘焙本剪辑。\n\n命名：`bdj` ≈ 绊打击。9 帧、每帧都有 Place，比现行轻拳 `XG_qdj`（12 帧）更短。\"\"\".format(am=E_AM, model=E_MODEL),\n    unused=True,\n    extra=\"同类遗留：[`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md)、[`XG_kanx`](XG_kanx.md)、[`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md)、[`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md)、[`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bs\",\n    \"必杀黑底火花\",\n    \"普通必杀（非超必）时在角色头顶偏上播的 add 混合火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha`：`className=XG_bs`，`sound=snd_bs`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.bisha(false, face?)`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.bisha`]({ctrl})：justRenderAnimate + pause + 黑底 + 可选 [`bisha_face_mc`](bisha_face_mc.md) 特写 + 本剪辑在 `(x, y-50)` + 藏地图。超必走 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md)（`bisha_super`），不走本类。\n\n万解 `wanKai` **不用**本类，强制 `bisha_super`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bsq\",\n    \"爆气起手火花\",\n    \"爆气/霸体爆发的前半段（`explodeSp`）。pause + 黑底期间先播这一段。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `explodeSp`：`XG_bsq` + `snd_baoqi1`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.energyExplode`]({ctrl})：pause、黑底（不 fadIn）、藏地图、在 fighter 坐标 `doEffectById(\"explodeSp\")`，然后 `_explodeSkillFrame = 0.7 * FPS_GAME`。到期 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md)。\n\n角色侧同时开超钢体、造 `HitVO`（power 50, hitType 5, 击飞）。本剪辑本身无 freeze/shine。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花\",\n    \"超必杀与万解共用的 add 火花。镜头 zoom 3.5 时播在 `(x, y-50)`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha_super`：`XG_cbs` + `snd_cbs` + `blendMode=add`。\n\n两条入口都到 [`EffectCtrl`]({ctrl})：\n\n- `$effect_ctrler.bisha(true, face?)` → `bisha(..., super=true)` → `cameraFocusOne` zoom 3.5 + 本剪辑\n- `$effect_ctrler.startWanKai(face?)` → `wanKai`：永远当超必，同样本剪辑\n\n普通必杀 `bisha(false)` 用 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md)，不用本类。时间轴长度与 `XG_bs` 同为 17 帧（FLA 里超必/必杀像同一套放大）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_dian_fy\",\n    \"电属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住电属性（hitType 9）时的防御火花。朝向跟攻击者。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initDefenseEffect`]({model}) `defense_9`：`XG_dian_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400ms，`blendMode=add`，`followDirect=true`，电色闪 `0x8288D2` alpha 0.2，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.doDefenseEffect`]({ctrl})：角色 `defenseType==0` 用原始 hitType；`==1` 只把斩系 1→2、6→3，**电仍是 9**。无 `specialEffectId`：防住不挂 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。\n\n未知防御类型回落 `defense_5`（[`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)），不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中火花\",\n    \"火属性攻击打中时的命中火花，并给受击者挂持续燃烧 `fire_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initHitEffect`]({model}) hitType **7 FIRE**：`XG_fire`，`snd_hit_fire`，add，freeze 400，火色闪 `0xFFFF67`，shake pow 6，**`specialEffectId=fire_ing`**。\n\n命中链：`FighterMcCtrler.doHitEffect` → [`EffectCtrl.doHitEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`EffectManager.getEffectVOByHitVO`]({mgr}) clone 本 VO（把 `pow` 抄到 `shake.y`）→ 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。`doEffectVO` 末尾对 `FighterMain` 再 `doSpecialEffect(\"fire_ing\")` → [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) + [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})。\n\n防御命中走 [`XG_fire_fy`](XG_fire_fy.md)，不挂燃烧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, spec=E_SPEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire_fy\",\n    \"火属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住火属性时的防御火花。防住不挂燃烧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_7`：`XG_fire_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，火色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n无 `specialEffectId`。朝向用攻击者 `direct`（`EffectCtrl` + VO.`followDirect`）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻斩（hitType 1）时的短火花。轻防套餐：freeze 50ms、无闪无震。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_1`：`XG_fykan`，`snd_fykan`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1`（拳防角色）会把斩 1 改成拳 2，改播 [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)，看不到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重斩（hitType 6）时的重防火花。带白闪（shine 自带 `blendMode=screen`）和震屏。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_6`：`XG_fykanx`，`snd_fykanx`，freeze 400，add，shine 白 alpha 0.1 **且 shine.blendMode=screen**（其它重防 shine 没写 blend），`followDirect`，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n拳防角色把 6→3，改播 [`XG_fyqx`](XG_fyqx.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyq\",\n    \"轻拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻拳（hitType 2）时的短火花。也是斩→拳防映射的落点。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_2`：`XG_fyq`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1` 时轻斩也会落到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyqx\",\n    \"重拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重拳（hitType 3）时的重防火花。拳防角色挡重斩也走这里。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_3`：`XG_fyqx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 alpha 0.1，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\",\n    \"死神辅助出场火花\",\n    \"死神阵营（`comicType!=1`）助战进场时的短火花。声用 `snd_dash`（不是 `snd_fz`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_bleach`：`XG_fz_bleach_mc` + `snd_dash`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.assisterEffect`]({ctrl})：`comicType==1` → [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)，否则本类。`FighterEventCtrl.addAssister` 与 `AssisiterCtrler.finish` 调。\n\n助战 SWF 自己还会 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 等，那是另一套必杀黑底，不是本剪辑。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\",\n    \"火影辅助出场火花\",\n    \"火影阵营（`comicType==1`）助战进场火花。声用 `snd_fz`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_naruto`：`XG_fz_naruto_mc` + `snd_fz`。\n\n与死神出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 成对。替身 [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md) 也复用 `snd_fz`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀火花（未登记）\",\n    \"导出名像「辅助必杀」。`EffectModel` 未登记。配对音 [`snd_fzbs`](snd_fzbs.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"助战进场只用 `fz_bleach` / `fz_naruto`。助战时间轴若 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 走的是全局 `XG_bs`/`XG_cbs`，不是本类。\n\n10 帧短剪辑。启动不烘焙。\"\"\".format(),\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步残影火花\",\n    \"鬼步移动时脚下/身后的 add 火花。走路循环在鬼步状态下反复 `doEffectById`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ghost_step`：`XG_ghost_step`，`snd_ghost_step`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n两条声：**VO 的 `snd_ghost_step`** 在 `EffectView.start` 播；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`]({ctrl}) 另外 `SoundCtrl.playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（主 SWF 嵌入，不在本库）。\n\n触发：`$effect_ctrler.ghostStep` 开演出（pause + 黑底 + justRender 物理仍走）；之后 [`FighterEffectCtrl.walk`]({fec}) 若 `_inGhostStep` 则反复本 id，而不是 `step1/2/3` 脚步。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0 的着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor`：`XG_hitfloor` + `snd_hitfloor`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(0)`]({ctrl}) ← [`FighterEffectCtrl.hitFloor`]({fec})。强度 1 走 [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)；强度 2 走 [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md) **外加** [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 烟。\n\n主动落地（跳下）是 [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md) `touch_floor`，不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中火花\",\n    \"冰属性打中时的命中火花，并挂持续冰冻 `ice_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **8 ICE**：`XG_ice`，`snd_hit_ice`，add，`specialEffectId=ice_ing`，freeze 400，冰色闪 `0xA3E5F5`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_ice_ing`](xg_ice_ing.md)。遗留变体 [`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md) 未登记。防御走 [`XG_ice_fy`](XG_ice_fy.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice2\",\n    \"遗留冰击火花（未登记）\",\n    \"22 帧冰剪辑，比现行 [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)（11 帧）长一倍。`initHitEffect(8)` 用的是 `XG_ice`，本类不进表。\",\n    \"\"\"无 `EffectVO`、不烘焙、无声绑定。像旧版冰命中或另一套冰爆。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice_fy\",\n    \"冰属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住冰属性时的防御火花。防住不挂冰冻。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_8`：`XG_ice_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，冰色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump\",\n    \"起跳尘\",\n    \"地面起跳时脚下的尘。坐标用 **display** x/y，不是逻辑坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump`：`XG_jump` + `snd_jump`。无 add。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.jump`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.jumpEffect`]({ctrl})。空中二段跳走 [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)，共用 `snd_jump`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump_air\",\n    \"空中跳火花\",\n    \"空中再跳（二段跳）的 add 火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump_air`：`XG_jump_air`，`snd_jump`，`blendMode=add`。地面跳 [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md) 无 add。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.jumpAirEffect`]({ctrl})。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan\",\n    \"遗留轻斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧轻斩剪辑（12 帧）。现行 hitType 1 用 [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)（10 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initHitEffect(1, \"XG_kan2\", …)`。钢体斩也用 `XG_kan2`。本类不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan2\",\n    \"轻斩命中 / 钢体斩火花\",\n    \"轻斩（hitType 1）命中火花；钢体受斩复用同一剪辑、另一份 VO。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 [`EffectVO`]({vo}) 都 `className=XG_kan2`，`cacheEffects` **各烘焙一次**：\n\n| id | 用途 | 声 | freeze | 其它 |\n|----|------|----|--------|------|\n| `hit_1` | 普通轻斩 | `snd_kan1` | 50ms | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_kan` | 钢体挨斩 | `snd_hit11` | 400ms | add，白闪 0.2，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit`，**无 shake** |\n\n普通路径 [`EffectView`]({view})；钢体 [`SteelHitEffect`]({steel})（`setTarget` 改色，freeze 结束 `resumeColor`）。\n\n遗留 [`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md) 不用。\"\"\".format(vo=E_VO, view=E_VIEW, steel=E_STEEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx\",\n    \"遗留重斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧重斩（21 帧）。现行 hitType 6 用 [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"钢体没有单独的重斩 id，重斩打钢体仍按 hitType 走 `steel_hit_kan` → `XG_kan2`。本类完全闲置。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx2\",\n    \"重斩命中火花\",\n    \"重斩（hitType 6）命中火花。重击套餐：400ms freeze + 白闪 + 震屏 + 随机旋转。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **6 KAN_HEAVY**：`XG_kanx2`，`snd_kan2`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake `pow:6, time:400`（[`EffectManager`]({mgr}) 把 pow 抄到 `shake.y`）。\n\n无 `isSteelHit`。无 `specialEffectId`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, mgr=E_MGR),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_leidian\",\n    \"电属性命中火花\",\n    \"电属性打中时的命中火花（**hardlight** 混合），并挂持续感电 `shock_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **9 ELECTRIC**：`XG_leidian`，`snd_hit_dian`，**`blendMode=hardlight`**（命中表里唯一 hardlight），`specialEffectId=shock_ing`，freeze 400，电色闪 `0x8288D2`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。遗留 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 未用。防御 [`XG_dian_fy`](XG_dian_fy.md) 用 add 不是 hardlight。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地尘\",\n    \"自己跳下/落下触地的尘，不是受击砸地。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `touch_floor`：`XG_luodi` + `snd_luodi`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.touchFloor`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.touchFloorEffect`]({ctrl})。受击落地是 `hit_floor*`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdj\",\n    \"轻法命中 / 钢体法火花\",\n    \"轻法/忍术/鬼道（hitType 4）命中火花；钢体受法复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO，同 `className=XG_mfdj`，各烘焙一次：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_4` MAGIC | `snd_hit2`（和轻拳同一声） | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_mfdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n轻拳火花是 [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)，剪辑不同、声相同。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法命中 / 破防火花\",\n    \"重法（hitType 5）命中火花；破防 `break_def` **复用同一剪辑**、另一份 VO（freeze 更长、震的是 x 不是 pow）。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | shake | 其它 |\n|----|----|--------|-------|------|\n| `hit_5` MAGIC_HEAVY | `snd_mfdjx` | 400 | `pow:6, time:400` → 抄到 y | add，`randRotate`，白闪 0.2 |\n| `break_def` | `snd_mfdjx` | **500** | **`x:6, time:400`**（不是 pow） | add，**无** randRotate / shine |\n\n`FighterMcCtrler` 破防 `doEffectById(\"break_def\")`。爆气判定 hitType 也是 5，命中火花走 `hit_5` 这份，不是 break_def。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffy\",\n    \"轻法防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻法（hitType 4）时的短火花。声与轻拳防相同（`snd_def`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_4`：`XG_mffy`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffyx\",\n    \"重法防御火花 / 未知防御回落\",\n    \"挡住重法（hitType 5）时的重防火花。`getDefenseEffect` 对未登记类型（含抓 11）回落到本条。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_5`：`XG_mffyx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 **alpha 0.15**（其它重防 0.1，属性防 0.2），shake pow 6。\n\n`getDefenseEffect`：没有 `defense_N` 则用 `defense_5`。无 `defense_11`，抓技防住也会看到本火花。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdj\",\n    \"轻拳命中 / 钢体拳火花\",\n    \"轻拳/打击（hitType 2）命中火花；钢体挨打复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_2` DA | `snd_hit2` | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_qdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n遗留轻击声 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 未绑到任何 VO。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx\",\n    \"重拳命中火花\",\n    \"重拳（hitType 3）命中火花。重击套餐。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **3 DA_HEAVY**：`XG_qdjx`，`snd_hit_heavy`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n遗留 [`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md) 未用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx2\",\n    \"遗留重拳火花（未登记）\",\n    \"13 帧重拳变体。现行 hitType 3 用 [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"无 VO。命名 `qdjx2` 与斩系 `kan2`/`kanx2`「第二版」同一套替换习惯，但这条没切过去。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush\",\n    \"地面冲刺残影\",\n    \"地面 dash 时的残影剪辑。声绑的是 **`snd_dash_air`**，不是 `snd_dash`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash`：`XG_rush`，`sound=snd_dash_air`（地面/空中冲刺共用空中声）。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.dash`]({fec})：不在空中 → 本 id；在空中 → [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。`snd_dash` 实际给死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush_air\",\n    \"空中冲刺残影\",\n    \"空中 dash 残影。与地面冲刺共用 `snd_dash_air`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash_air`：`XG_rush_air` + `snd_dash_air`。22 帧，比地面 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md)（20 帧）略长。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen\",\n    \"替身第一段\",\n    \"死神受身/替身演出的第一段火花。pause + 黑底时立刻播在**位移前**的坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp`：`XG_tishen` + `snd_fz`（和火影辅助出场同一声）。\n\n[`FighterMain.replaceSkill`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) 先 `move(250*direct)`、idle、无敌；[`EffectCtrl.replaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再 pause、黑底、藏地图、本剪辑（坐标是调用瞬间，位移已发生）、hold 1 秒逻辑帧。第一拍 [`renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再播 [`XG_tishen2`](XG_tishen2.md)。\n\n火影受身走爆气 `energyExplode`，不走替身。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"本剪辑 35 帧，是 SWF 里最长的普通火花之一（必杀脸 71 帧除外）。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen2\",\n    \"替身第二段（无声）\",\n    \"替身黑底期间第 1 逻辑帧补上的第二段。VO 无 sound。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp2`：只有 `className=XG_tishen2`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl})：`frame==1` 时在记下的 pos 播本 id。1 秒后 `endReplaceSkill` resume。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺火花（未登记）\",\n    \"25 帧、几乎每帧 Place 的冲刺剪辑。现行 dash 用 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md) / [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。配对 [`snd_xdash`](snd_xdash.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"`xdash` ≈ 横冲。启动不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\",\n    \"KO 背景闪光\",\n    \"有人在必杀中被 KO 时垫到 GameState 最底的短循环背景。5 帧，靠 `holdFrame` 撑满约 2 秒。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `kobg`：裸 VO，无声、无 add。\n\n[`FightUI.playKO`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) 若任一方 `actionState` 12/13（必杀/超必）→ [`EffectCtrl.BGEffect(\"kobg\", 2)`]({ctrl})：\n\n1. `addEffect` 在 (0,0)\n2. `holdFrame = 2 * 30 = 60` 动画拍（后置 `--` 实际 61 拍 ≈ 2s@30fps）\n3. 再挂 remove 回调恢复地图；立刻 `getMap().setVisible(false)`\n4. `addChildAt(display, 0)` 到 **GameState**（不是 `_playerLayer`）\n\n[`EffectView`]({view}) 播到缓存末帧会绕回 0 直到 hold 到期。烘焙跳过最后一帧：5 帧 MC → 缓存 4 张循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, view=E_VIEW),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 循环光\",\n    \"防御 buff 持续期间跟随角色脚底的循环光。`isBuff=true` → `BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initBuffEffect`]({model}) id `buff_defense`：`xg_buff_defense`，add，`isBuff`。无声、无 `targetColorOffset`。\n\n[`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterBuffCtrler.md) 先 `doEffectById(\"buff_effect_defense\")` 播一次性 [`xg_buff_effect_defense`](xg_buff_effect_defense.md)，再 `doBuffEffect(\"buff_defense\")` → [`BuffEffectView`]({buff})：`loopPlay=true`，逻辑帧跟 `FighterBuffVO.finished`。到期 `remove`，不改色（表无 offset）。\n\n8 帧短循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, buff=E_BUFF),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上防御 buff 时的一次性爆发。**没有** `isBuff`，普通 `EffectView`，播完即删。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_defense`：只有 add。`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp` 经 `doEffectById`。17 帧。\n\n不要和持续光 [`xg_buff_defense`](xg_buff_defense.md) 搞混。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上攻击 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_power`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.attackUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_power`](xg_buff_power.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上速度 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_speed`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.speedUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_speed`](xg_buff_speed.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 循环光\",\n    \"攻击 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_power`：add，`isBuff`。`attackUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 循环光\",\n    \"速度 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_speed`：add，`isBuff`。`speedUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_catch_hit\",\n    \"抓取命中火花\",\n    \"抓技（hitType 11 CATCH）打中时的火花。无 add、无随机旋转；freeze 400ms。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **11**：`xg_catch_hit`，`snd_hit_cache`，freeze 400。没有 shine/shake/randRotate/blendMode。\n\n无 `defense_11`：挡住抓回落 [`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)。无 `hit_10` STONE。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing\",\n    \"感电持续环绕\",\n    \"电属性命中后挂在受击者身上的持续特效。`isSpecial` → `SpecialEffectView`。带 `loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initSpeicalEffect`]({model})（原拼写）id `shock_ing`：`xg_dian_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[50,-75,255]` 偏蓝紫。\n\n由 hitType 9 的 `specialEffectId` 触发 → [`EffectCtrl.doSpecialEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})：跟随 fighter，上色；`actionState` 落到 0/23/24（站立/倒地/弹起）则 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")` + `resumeColor`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F6 | [`EffectView.renderFrameLabel`]({view}) 看到 `\"loop\"` → `gotoAndPlay(1)`（位图下标 1，不是开头 0）。? 与 1-based 帧号错一位 |\n| `finish` | F7 | 基类忽略；`SpecialEffectView` 显式 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")`。key 是 MC 帧号 7，赋给 0-based `_curFrame`，可能错一位/越界。? |\n\n21 帧。烘焙跳过最后一帧 → 缓存 20。无 `loopPlay`（对比 buff）：持续段靠 `\"loop\"` 标签或片子够长；没有可靠 loop 时可能播完 autoRemove，角色还带着染色。?\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, spec=E_SPEC, view=E_VIEW\n    ),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n    extra=\"遗留更长变体 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 同样有 loop/finish，但表用的是本类。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\",\n    \"遗留感电持续（未登记）\",\n    \"23 帧感电环绕，标签 `F8:loop` / `F9:finish`。现行 `shock_ing` 用 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)（21 帧，loop 在 F6）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initSpeicalEffect` 只写 `xg_dian_ing`。本类不烘焙。标签布局与正式三条 special 同一套（先 loop 再 finish 紧挨着），像旧版电环。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_fire_ing\",\n    \"燃烧持续环绕\",\n    \"火属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色被染成全黑。`loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fire_ing`：`xg_fire_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[-255,-255,-255]`。hitType 7 的 `specialEffectId`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F12 | `renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | F13 | `SpecialEffectView` 在 idle/倒地/弹起时跳到这里，停止跟随并 `resumeColor` |\n\n25 帧 → 缓存 24。被打 21 / 击飞 22 **不**结束，火跟到落地或回 idle。死亡 30 不在 case 里，可能跟尸体到播完。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地火花（原拼写 fllor）\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2 的重砸地火花。符号名少一个 o：`fllor`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_heavy`：`className=xg_hitfllor_heavy`（必须逐字匹配），`snd_hitfloor_heavy`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(2)`]({ctrl}) **同时**再播 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md)（lighten 烟、无声）。本剪辑本身 normal 混合。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"引擎注释已标明这是原拼写，不是反编译错误。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1 的轻着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_low`：`xg_hitfloor_low` + `snd_hitfloor_low`。`hitFloorEffect(1)`。无烟。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\",\n    \"重砸地烟（lighten）\",\n    \"重砸地额外一层烟。`blendMode=lighten`，无声。只在强度 2 时和 heavy 火花一起播。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_yan`：只有 lighten。`hitFloorEffect(2)` 在 heavy 之后再 `doEffectById`。两份 View 同坐标叠画。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitover\",\n    \"KO 收招火花\",\n    \"KO 演出收招时的火花。裸 VO：无声、无 add。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_end`：`xg_hitover`。\n\n[`FightUI`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) KO：关 `freezeEnabled`、`doEffectById(\"hit_end\")`、shine、可选 `BGEffect(\"kobg\")`、shake、`slowDown(2,0)`。24 帧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_ice_ing\",\n    \"冰冻持续环绕\",\n    \"冰属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色加蓝。`loop`/`finish` 在很靠前的帧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ice_ing`：`xg_ice_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[0,0,255]`。hitType 8。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | **F5** | 三条 special 里 loop 最早。`renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | **F6** | 倒地/idle 跳结束段 |\n\n26 帧（special 里最长）→ 缓存 25。loop 在 F5 意味着循环体很短，前面 4 帧是入场。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Sounds\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSNDS = {}\n\n\ndef add_snd(name, title, purpose, hook, unused=False):\n    SNDS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"unused\": unused,\n    }\n\n\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸声\",\n    \"爆气后半段 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md) 的爆炸声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp2` VO.`sound`。`EffectView.start` → [`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) → [`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) `new` 本类。每次 start 新实例，无法 stop。\"\n    % (E_SND, E_AM),\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi1\",\n    \"爆气起手声\",\n    \"爆气前半段 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md) 的起手声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp` VO.`sound`。后半段换 [`snd_baoqi`](snd_baoqi.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_bs\",\n    \"必杀火花声\",\n    \"普通必杀火花 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha` VO.`sound`。超必用 [`snd_cbs`](snd_cbs.md)。黑底/特写无独立声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花声\",\n    \"超必与万解火花 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha_super` VO.`sound`。本库 22 kHz 里较长的一条。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash\",\n    \"死神辅助出场声（名义冲刺）\",\n    \"导出名像冲刺，实际绑在死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md)。\",\n    \"`fz_bleach` VO.`sound`。地面/空中 dash **不用**本类，用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。样本数与 `snd_dash_air` 同为 17952，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash_air\",\n    \"冲刺声（地面+空中共用）\",\n    \"地面 `dash` 与空中 `dash_air` 共用这一声。\",\n    \"`XG_rush` / `XG_rush_air` 的 VO.`sound` 都是本 id。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_def\",\n    \"轻防格挡声\",\n    \"轻拳防、轻法防共用。\",\n    \"`defense_2` [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)、`defense_4` [`XG_mffy`](XG_mffy.md)。轻斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykan`](snd_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_defx\",\n    \"重防/属性防格挡声\",\n    \"重拳防、重法防、火/冰/电防都用这一声。\",\n    \"`defense_3/5/7/8/9`。重斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykanx`](snd_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住轻斩的专门格挡声。\",\n    \"`defense_1` [`XG_fykan`](XG_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住重斩的专门格挡声。本库较长的防御音。\",\n    \"`defense_6` [`XG_fykanx`](XG_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fz\",\n    \"火影辅助出场 / 替身声\",\n    \"火影助战进场与替身第一段共用。\",\n    \"`fz_naruto` [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)、`replaceSp` [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md)。死神助战用 [`snd_dash`](snd_dash.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_fzbs`](XG_fzbs.md)。没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写这个 id。\",\n    \"[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) 仍能 `getEffect` 到本类，但引擎从不调。\" % E_SND,\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步火花声\",\n    \"`ghost_step` VO 自带的一声。与主 SWF 的 `snd_ghost_jump` 不是同一个。\",\n    \"[`XG_ghost_step`](XG_ghost_step.md) `EffectView.start` 播本类；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`](%s) 另外 `playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（main 嵌入）。走路循环反复 start 就会反复本声。\"\n    % E_CTRL,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit1\",\n    \"遗留轻击声（未引用）\",\n    \"短命中音。现行轻拳/轻法用 [`snd_hit2`](snd_hit2.md)，轻斩用 [`snd_kan1`](snd_kan1.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO 绑定。样本数与 [`snd_hit_cache`](snd_hit_cache.md) 同为 5344，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit10\",\n    \"遗留命中声（未引用）\",\n    \"中等长度命中音。表里没有 `snd_hit10`。钢体用 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。命名像旧编号序列 `hit1`…`hit11` 的第十号。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit11\",\n    \"钢体受击声\",\n    \"三条钢体火花共用这一声。\",\n    \"`steel_hit_kan` / `steel_hit_qdj` / `steel_hit_mfdj` 都是 `snd_hit11`。普通命中不用。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit2\",\n    \"轻拳 / 轻法命中声\",\n    \"轻打击与轻法共用。\",\n    \"`hit_2` [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)、`hit_4` [`XG_mfdj`](XG_mfdj.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_cache\",\n    \"抓取命中声\",\n    \"抓技打中的一声。id 是 cache（抓住）不是 cache 缓存。\",\n    \"`hit_11` [`xg_catch_hit`](xg_catch_hit.md)。样本数与未用的 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 相同。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_dian\",\n    \"电属性命中声\",\n    \"电属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_9` [`XG_leidian`](XG_leidian.md)。防御电用 [`snd_defx`](snd_defx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中声\",\n    \"火属性打中的一声。本库最长的 MP3。\",\n    \"`hit_7` [`XG_fire`](XG_fire.md)。约 2.3 s@22 kHz，可能含燃烧尾。持续 [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) 无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\",\n    \"重拳命中声\",\n    \"重打击（hitType 3）的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_3` [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)。11 kHz。重斩用 [`snd_kan2`](snd_kan2.md)，重法用 [`snd_mfdjx`](snd_mfdjx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中声\",\n    \"冰属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_8` [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)。持续冰环无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0。\",\n    \"`hit_floor` [`XG_hitfloor`](XG_hitfloor.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2。烟层 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 无声，只有本声。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_heavy` [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_low` [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_jump\",\n    \"跳跃声\",\n    \"地面跳与空中跳共用。11 kHz 短音。\",\n    \"`jump` [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md)、`jump_air` [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan1\",\n    \"轻斩命中声\",\n    \"轻斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_1` [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)。钢体斩改 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan2\",\n    \"重斩命中声\",\n    \"重斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_6` [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地声\",\n    \"自己触地。本库最短的一条。\",\n    \"`touch_floor` [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md)。约 180 ms。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法 / 破防声\",\n    \"重法命中与破防火花共用。11 kHz。\",\n    \"`hit_5` 与 `break_def` 都是本 id（剪辑都是 [`XG_mfdjx`](XG_mfdjx.md)）。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。现行冲刺用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。SWF 里 char id 1，像最早导出的音。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\n\ndef labels_md(labels):\n    if not labels:\n        return \"无帧标签、无 `addFrameScript`。\"\n    rows = \"\\n\".join(f\"| {fr} | `{name}` |\" for fr, name in labels)\n    return \"有标签：\\n\\n| 帧 | 标签 |\\n|----|------|\\n\" + rows\n\n\ndef write_mc(name):\n    meta = MCS[name]\n    cid, frames, places, labels = SPRITES[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    cache_n = frames - 1\n    lab = labels_md(labels)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未登记**：`EffectModel` 从不 `getEffect` 本 `className`。启动不烘焙。仍导出，[`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) 能 `new`。\"\n        % E_AM\n        if unused\n        else f\"运行时 **不**再 `new` 本 MC：只在 `EffectModel.initlize` → `cacheBitmapData` 时实例化一次，画成 {cache_n} 张位图（**最后一帧不烘**，见 [`EffectVO`]({E_VO})）。之后 [`EffectView`]({E_VIEW}) 只播 Bitmap。\"\n    )\n    extra = meta[\"extra\"]\n    extra_sec = f\"\\n{extra}\\n\" if extra else \"\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n{status}\n\nSWF：`assets/effect.swf` DefineSprite **char {cid}**（FFDec `symbol{cid}`），**{frames} 帧** @30fps，约 {places} 次 Place。{lab} 运行时无帧脚本。\n\n{extra_sec}\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends MovieClip`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol{cid}\")]`：FFDec 把 sprite {cid} 链到本类。真正运行不走 Flex Embed，靠 ZIP 里整份 `effect.swf` 的 SymbolClass。\n- **L6** 类名必须与 `EffectVO.className` / `AssetManager.getClass` 逐字相同（大小写敏感）。\n- **L9–12 ` {name}()`**：`super()`。无字段、无 `stop`、无标签脚本。时间轴默认从 F1 播到尾；烘焙时 `gotoAndStop(1)` 再 `nextFrame` 扫。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_snd(name):\n    meta = SNDS[name]\n    cid, embed, samples, rate, datalen = SOUNDS[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    d = dur(samples, rate)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未引用**：没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写本 id。`playEffectSound` 仍能 `getEffect` 到。\"\n        if unused\n        else \"运行时每次 `EffectView.start` 都 `new` 一份再 `Sound.play(0,0,transform)`，不循环、不 stop、不进对象池。\"\n    )\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n声音和 MC 走同一条 [`AssetManager.getEffect(className)`]({E_AM})：从 `\"assets/effect.swf\"` `getClass` 再 `new`。[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`]({E_SND}) 把返回值当 `Sound`。`playAssetSound` 走另一套 `sounds/` 加载器，**不**进本库。\n\n{status}\n\nSWF DefineSound **char {cid}**：MP3（fmt=2），{hz} Hz，16-bit mono，{d}，payload {datalen} B。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends Sound`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/{embed}\")]`：FFDec 拆出的 MP3。运行时是 SWF 里的 DefineSound，不是单独文件。\n- **L6** 类名 = `EffectVO.sound` 字符串。\n- **L9–12 `{name}()`**：`super()`。无循环点、无音量。音量靠 `SoundCtrl._sndTransform`。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_bisha():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"bisha_face_mc.md\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).bisha_face_mc` — 必杀特写脸底 MC\n\n一句话目的：必杀/万解黑底上的特写容器。左右槽 `facemc1`/`facemc2` 给角色 SWF 导出的脸 Bitmap；时间轴 71 帧，F71 标签 `destory` 且 `stop()`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/bisha_face_mc.as`（25 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不走** `EffectModel` / `EffectView` 光栅化。唯一实例化：[`BishaFaceEffectView`]({E_FACE}) 构造 `AssetManager.I.getEffect(\"bisha_face_mc\")` → 每次 `new` 一份活 MC。\n\n链：\n\n```\n$effect_ctrler.bisha / startWanKai\n  → FighterEffectCtrl.getFace (new 角色 bsface BitmapData)\n  → EffectCtrl.bisha / wanKai → showFace\n       比双方 display.x：自己在右 → 槽 2，否则 1\n  → BlackBackView.showBishaFace\n       第一次 new BishaFaceEffectView（本 MC）\n       setFace(slot, bmp) 拉伸 254×180 塞进 facemcN\n       fadIn → gotoAndPlay(2)\n```\n\n见 [`BlackBackView`]({E_BLACK})、[`EffectCtrl.showFace`]({E_CTRL})。替身/爆气/鬼步只有黑底，**不**挂本 MC。\n\n`fadOut` 拆特写；`BlackBackView` 把 `_bishaFace` 置 null，下次必杀再 new。多次必杀可能在黑底上堆停住的旧 MC。?\n\n## 时间轴\n\nSWF DefineSprite **char 926**（`symbol926`），**71 帧** @30fps，约 168 次 Place。嵌套未导出 sprite 922（5 帧）、923（1 帧空，F1 两个 depth 先放着）。\n\n| 帧 / 标签 | 行为 |\n|-----------|------|\n| F1 | 默认停在这里（构造未 play）。多半空/准备。槽位实例已在。 |\n| F2 | [`BishaFaceEffectView.fadIn`]({E_FACE}) `gotoAndPlay(2)` 入场起点 |\n| F2–F70 | 入场动画。无其它脚本 |\n| **F71 标签 `destory`**（原拼写） | `addFrameScript(70, frame71)` → `stop()`。之后停在末帧直到下次 fadIn 或黑底被摘 |\n\n无 `loop`。退场不是时间轴倒放，是整块 `BlackBackView` 从 `GameState` 摘掉。\n\n公开实例：\n\n| 字段 | 用途 |\n|------|------|\n| `facemc1` | 左槽（自己 x ≤ 对手，或无对手） |\n| `facemc2` | 右槽（自己 x > 对手） |\n\n脸图来自各角色 SWF `defineBishaFace` 的 BitmapData 类，不是本库。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class bisha_face_mc extends MovieClip`。\n\n### 字段（L9–11）\n\n- **L9** `facemc1:MovieClip`\n- **L11** `facemc2:MovieClip`\n\nFLA 实例名。`BishaFaceEffectView.setFace` 用 `mc[\"facemc\" + slot]` 动态取。槽号不是 1/2 或时间轴还没建实例则脸丢掉。\n\n### `bisha_face_mc()`（L13–17）\n\n- **L15** `super();`\n- **L16** `addFrameScript(70, this.frame71);` — 0-based 70 = 时间轴 **F71**。\n\n### `frame71`（时间轴 F71，L19–23）\n\n- **L21** `stop();` — 停在特写停留帧。标签名 `destory` 引擎不读；真正销毁是 `BishaFaceEffectView.destory` / 黑底 fadOut。\n\n无 `gotoAndPlay`、无 COMPLETE 事件。引擎也不听 COMPLETE。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_main():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"effect_fla\" / \"MainTimeline.md\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    md = f\"\"\"# `effect_fla.MainTimeline` — effect.swf 文档类（F1 停）\n\n一句话目的：`assets/effect.swf` 的文档类。根时间轴 8 帧、30fps；F1 `stop`。引擎从不 `new` 本类，只把整份 SWF `addSwf` 进 `KyoClassLoader`，按 **链接名** `getClass`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/effect_fla/MainTimeline.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`AssetManager.loadBasic`]({E_AM}) 拉 ZIP 内 `assets/effect.swf`，完成后 [`KyoClassLoader.addSwf`](../../engine/kyo/loader/KyoClassLoader.md)`(\"assets/effect.swf\", loader)`。之后：\n\n- `getEffect(className)` → `getClass(name, \"assets/effect.swf\")` → `new`\n- [`MainGame.loadGameBack`](../../engine/game/bvn/MainGame.md) → [`EffectModel.I.initlize`]({E_MODEL}) 对表里每个 `className` `cacheBitmapData`\n\nLoader 的 `content` 才是本 `MainTimeline`。引擎只留 domain，不把 content 加到舞台。F1 `stop` 防止这份 content 在内存里空转 8 帧循环。\n\n根时间轴 8 帧、无场景标签、无导出实例。真正用的是 SymbolClass 里那 88 个链接（57 个 MC + 31 个 Sound；本类是 char 0）。\n\n对照：UI 的 `common_ui_fla.MainTimeline` 同样 F1 停、同样只灌域。\n\nABC 调试路径习惯与 UI 相同（FLA 在 `…/fla/`）。本文件无 `[Embed]`——它就是这份 SWF 自己。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\nFLA 文档包 `effect_fla`。`public dynamic class MainTimeline extends MovieClip`。无公开字段。\n\n### `MainTimeline()`（L9–13）\n\n- **L11** `super();`\n- **L12** `addFrameScript(0, this.frame1);` — 0-based 0 = 时间轴 **F1**。\n\n### `frame1`（时间轴 F1，L15–18）\n\n- **L17** `stop();` — 文档停在空白。F2–F8 空，到不了。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    (OUT / \"scripts\").mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    # order: XG_* then bisha, MainTimeline, kobg, snd_*, xg_*\n    # write all MCS except bisha (custom)\n    for name in sorted(MCS, key=lambda n: n.lower()):\n        write_mc(name)\n    write_bisha()\n    write_main()\n    for name in sorted(SNDS):\n        write_snd(name)\n\n    # verify count\n    mds = list((OUT / \"scripts\").rglob(\"*.md\"))\n    print(f\"TOTAL md under scripts: {len(mds)}\")\n    expected = 89\n    if len(mds) != expected:\n        print(\"WARNING expected\", expected, \"got\", len(mds))\n        listed = {p.stem for p in mds}\n        print(\"files\", sorted(listed))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\"\"\"\n# end\n)\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"SearchReplace","EditsApplied":{"old_string":"","new_string":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"Generate line-by-line Chinese annotations for effect.swf scripts.\"\"\"\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nOUT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/effect\")\nSRC_ROOT = \"decompiled/other/effect/scripts\"\n\nE_CTRL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/EffectCtrl.md\"\nE_MGR = \"../../engine/game/bvn/utils/EffectManager.md\"\nE_VO = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectVO.md\"\nE_MODEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectModel.md\"\nE_VIEW = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/EffectView.md\"\nE_SPEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SpecialEffectView.md\"\nE_BUFF = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BuffEffectView.md\"\nE_STEEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SteelHitEffect.md\"\nE_FACE = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BishaFaceEffectView.md\"\nE_BLACK = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BlackBackView.md\"\nE_FEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterEffectCtrl.md\"\nE_SND = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/SoundCtrl.md\"\nE_AM = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/AssetManager.md\"\nE_HIT = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/HitType.md\"\n\n# SWF sprite metadata: name -> (char_id, frames, places, labels)\nSPRITES = {\n    \"xg_ice_ing\": (48, 26, 12, [(\"F5\", \"loop\"), (\"F6\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_fire_ing\": (73, 25, 12, [(\"F12\", \"loop\"), (\"F13\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\": (104, 23, 15, [(\"F8\", \"loop\"), (\"F9\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing\": (131, 21, 13, [(\"F6\", \"loop\"), (\"F7\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_buff_speed\": (140, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_power\": (141, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\": (158, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\": (159, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\": (160, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_defense\": (161, 8, 4, []),\n    \"XG_jump_air\": (172, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_jump\": (181, 10, 4, []),\n    \"XG_luodi\": (196, 10, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitover\": (217, 24, 10, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\": (246, 18, 14, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\": (261, 14, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\": (280, 18, 9, []),\n    \"XG_ghost_step\": (313, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\": (336, 11, 11, []),\n    \"XG_rush_air\": (365, 22, 14, []),\n    \"XG_rush\": (386, 20, 10, []),\n    \"xg_catch_hit\": (397, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_xdash\": (446, 25, 24, []),\n    \"XG_tishen2\": (467, 18, 10, []),\n    \"XG_tishen\": (470, 35, 25, []),\n    \"XG_kanx2\": (507, 17, 18, []),\n    \"XG_kanx\": (508, 21, 10, []),\n    \"XG_kan2\": (519, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_kan\": (532, 12, 6, []),\n    \"XG_hitfloor\": (543, 13, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyqx\": (554, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyq\": (571, 10, 9, []),\n    \"XG_fykanx\": (602, 19, 15, []),\n    \"XG_fykan\": (603, 15, 7, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx2\": (634, 13, 15, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx\": (651, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_qdj\": (662, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_mffyx\": (663, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_mffy\": (678, 11, 7, []),\n    \"XG_mfdjx\": (679, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_mfdj\": (690, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_leidian\": (701, 12, 5, []),\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\": (712, 5, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice2\": (743, 22, 15, []),\n    \"XG_ice_fy\": (754, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice\": (765, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\": (776, 12, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fzbs\": (787, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fire_fy\": (802, 15, 8, []),\n    \"XG_fire\": (825, 23, 11, []),\n    \"XG_dian_fy\": (828, 16, 8, []),\n    \"XG_cbs\": (841, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bs\": (842, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bsq\": (875, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_bdj\": (894, 9, 9, []),\n    \"XG_baoqi\": (911, 15, 8, []),\n    \"bisha_face_mc\": (926, 71, 168, [(\"F71\", \"destory\")]),\n}\n\n# sounds: name -> (char_id, embed_file, samples, rate_code, datalen)\n# rate 1=11025, 2=22050\nSOUNDS = {\n    \"snd_xdash\": (1, \"1_snd_xdash.mp3\", 25144, 2, 4994),\n    \"snd_fykan\": (2, \"2_snd_fykan.mp3\", 13750, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_hit2\": (3, \"3_snd_hit2.mp3\", 16128, 2, 3434),\n    \"snd_cbs\": (4, \"4_snd_cbs.mp3\", 29952, 2, 6769),\n    \"snd_fzbs\": (5, \"5_snd_fzbs.mp3\", 20160, 2, 4559),\n    \"snd_mfdjx\": (6, \"6_snd_mfdjx.mp3\", 9216, 1, 1673),\n    \"snd_jump\": (7, \"7_snd_jump.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_bs\": (8, \"8_snd_bs.mp3\", 13248, 1, 2401),\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\": (9, \"9_snd_hit_heavy.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_fz\": (10, \"10_snd_fz.mp3\", 8992, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit_dian\": (11, \"11_snd_hit_dian.mp3\", 17792, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_baoqi1\": (12, \"12_snd_baoqi1.mp3\", 21572, 2, 4370),\n    \"snd_hit_ice\": (13, \"13_snd_hit_ice.mp3\", 32128, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_def\": (14, \"14_snd_def.mp3\", 13824, 2, 3129),\n    \"snd_hit_fire\": (15, \"15_snd_hit_fire.mp3\", 51350, 2, 9778),\n    \"snd_hitfloor\": (16, \"16_snd_hitfloor.mp3\", 26262, 2, 5202),\n    \"snd_luodi\": (17, \"17_snd_luodi.mp3\", 3990, 2, 1250),\n    \"snd_dash_air\": (18, \"18_snd_dash_air.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\": (19, \"19_snd_hitfloor_heavy.mp3\", 33888, 2, 6450),\n    \"snd_dash\": (20, \"20_snd_dash.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_ghost_step\": (21, \"21_snd_ghost_step.mp3\", 15968, 2, 3330),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\": (22, \"22_snd_hitfloor_low.mp3\", 15296, 2, 3226),\n    \"snd_hit1\": (23, \"23_snd_hit1.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_baoqi\": (24, \"24_snd_baoqi.mp3\", 31505, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_hit_cache\": (25, \"25_snd_hit_cache.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_defx\": (26, \"26_snd_defx.mp3\", 14842, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_kan1\": (27, \"27_snd_kan1.mp3\", 7423, 2, 1874),\n    \"snd_fykanx\": (28, \"28_snd_fykanx.mp3\", 29951, 2, 5930),\n    \"snd_kan2\": (29, \"29_snd_kan2.mp3\", 9024, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit10\": (30, \"30_snd_hit10.mp3\", 10368, 2, 2394),\n    \"snd_hit11\": (31, \"31_snd_hit11.mp3\", 30848, 2, 6034),\n}\n\nRATE_HZ = {1: 11025, 2: 22050}\n\n\ndef dur(samples, rate):\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    ms = samples / hz * 1000\n    return f\"{ms:.0f} ms（{samples} samples / {hz} Hz）\"\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# MovieClip catalog\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# each: title, purpose, hook (markdown), extra (optional extra sections)\n\nMCS = {}\n\n\ndef add_mc(name, title, purpose, hook, extra=None, unused=False, vo_ids=None, view=\"EffectView\"):\n    MCS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"extra\": extra or \"\",\n        \"unused\": unused,\n        \"vo_ids\": vo_ids or [],\n        \"view\": view,\n    }\n\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸段火花\",\n    \"爆气演出后半段（`explodeSp2`）的爆炸剪辑。黑底结束时在角色原坐标播一次。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) 登记 id `explodeSp2`，`className=XG_baoqi`，`sound=snd_baoqi`。启动时 [`EffectVO.cacheBitmapData`]({vo}) 经 [`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) `new` 本类，逐帧光栅化后丢掉 MC。\n\n运行时 [`EffectCtrl.endEnergyExplode`]({ctrl})（`energyExplode` 倒数 0.7s 到期）`doEffectById(\"explodeSp2\")` → [`EffectManager.getEffectView`]({mgr}) 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。触发链：角色 SWF / [`FighterMain.energyExplode`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) → `$effect_ctrler.energyExplode` → [`FighterEffectCtrl`]({fec})。\n\n无 `isSpecial`/`isBuff`/`isSteelHit`。无 `blendMode`（默认 `normal`）。无 freeze/shine/shake。\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, vo=E_VO, am=E_AM, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, fec=E_FEC\n    ),\n    extra=\"前半段是 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md)（`explodeSp` + `snd_baoqi1`）。两段坐标都是调用瞬间的 fighter x/y。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bdj\",\n    \"遗留「绊打击」火花（未登记）\",\n    \"effect.swf 导出的短命中剪辑。`EffectModel` **没有**用这个 `className`。像早期普攻火花，被 `XG_qdj` / `XG_kan2` 取代。\",\n    \"\"\"[`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) 仍能按名 `new` 本类，但 [`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) / `initHitEffect` 从未写入 `_effect`。`doEffectById` / `getHitEffect` 都走不到。启动 `cacheEffects` 也不烘焙本剪辑。\n\n命名：`bdj` ≈ 绊打击。9 帧、每帧都有 Place，比现行轻拳 `XG_qdj`（12 帧）更短。\"\"\".format(am=E_AM, model=E_MODEL),\n    unused=True,\n    extra=\"同类遗留：[`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md)、[`XG_kanx`](XG_kanx.md)、[`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md)、[`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md)、[`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bs\",\n    \"必杀黑底火花\",\n    \"普通必杀（非超必）时在角色头顶偏上播的 add 混合火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha`：`className=XG_bs`，`sound=snd_bs`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.bisha(false, face?)`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.bisha`]({ctrl})：justRenderAnimate + pause + 黑底 + 可选 [`bisha_face_mc`](bisha_face_mc.md) 特写 + 本剪辑在 `(x, y-50)` + 藏地图。超必走 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md)（`bisha_super`），不走本类。\n\n万解 `wanKai` **不用**本类，强制 `bisha_super`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bsq\",\n    \"爆气起手火花\",\n    \"爆气/霸体爆发的前半段（`explodeSp`）。pause + 黑底期间先播这一段。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `explodeSp`：`XG_bsq` + `snd_baoqi1`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.energyExplode`]({ctrl})：pause、黑底（不 fadIn）、藏地图、在 fighter 坐标 `doEffectById(\"explodeSp\")`，然后 `_explodeSkillFrame = 0.7 * FPS_GAME`。到期 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md)。\n\n角色侧同时开超钢体、造 `HitVO`（power 50, hitType 5, 击飞）。本剪辑本身无 freeze/shine。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花\",\n    \"超必杀与万解共用的 add 火花。镜头 zoom 3.5 时播在 `(x, y-50)`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha_super`：`XG_cbs` + `snd_cbs` + `blendMode=add`。\n\n两条入口都到 [`EffectCtrl`]({ctrl})：\n\n- `$effect_ctrler.bisha(true, face?)` → `bisha(..., super=true)` → `cameraFocusOne` zoom 3.5 + 本剪辑\n- `$effect_ctrler.startWanKai(face?)` → `wanKai`：永远当超必，同样本剪辑\n\n普通必杀 `bisha(false)` 用 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md)，不用本类。时间轴长度与 `XG_bs` 同为 17 帧（FLA 里超必/必杀像同一套放大）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_dian_fy\",\n    \"电属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住电属性（hitType 9）时的防御火花。朝向跟攻击者。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initDefenseEffect`]({model}) `defense_9`：`XG_dian_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400ms，`blendMode=add`，`followDirect=true`，电色闪 `0x8288D2` alpha 0.2，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.doDefenseEffect`]({ctrl})：角色 `defenseType==0` 用原始 hitType；`==1` 只把斩系 1→2、6→3，**电仍是 9**。无 `specialEffectId`：防住不挂 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。\n\n未知防御类型回落 `defense_5`（[`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)），不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中火花\",\n    \"火属性攻击打中时的命中火花，并给受击者挂持续燃烧 `fire_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initHitEffect`]({model}) hitType **7 FIRE**：`XG_fire`，`snd_hit_fire`，add，freeze 400，火色闪 `0xFFFF67`，shake pow 6，**`specialEffectId=fire_ing`**。\n\n命中链：`FighterMcCtrler.doHitEffect` → [`EffectCtrl.doHitEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`EffectManager.getEffectVOByHitVO`]({mgr}) clone 本 VO（把 `pow` 抄到 `shake.y`）→ 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。`doEffectVO` 末尾对 `FighterMain` 再 `doSpecialEffect(\"fire_ing\")` → [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) + [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})。\n\n防御命中走 [`XG_fire_fy`](XG_fire_fy.md)，不挂燃烧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, spec=E_SPEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire_fy\",\n    \"火属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住火属性时的防御火花。防住不挂燃烧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_7`：`XG_fire_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，火色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n无 `specialEffectId`。朝向用攻击者 `direct`（`EffectCtrl` + VO.`followDirect`）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻斩（hitType 1）时的短火花。轻防套餐：freeze 50ms、无闪无震。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_1`：`XG_fykan`，`snd_fykan`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1`（拳防角色）会把斩 1 改成拳 2，改播 [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)，看不到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重斩（hitType 6）时的重防火花。带白闪（shine 自带 `blendMode=screen`）和震屏。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_6`：`XG_fykanx`，`snd_fykanx`，freeze 400，add，shine 白 alpha 0.1 **且 shine.blendMode=screen**（其它重防 shine 没写 blend），`followDirect`，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n拳防角色把 6→3，改播 [`XG_fyqx`](XG_fyqx.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyq\",\n    \"轻拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻拳（hitType 2）时的短火花。也是斩→拳防映射的落点。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_2`：`XG_fyq`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1` 时轻斩也会落到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyqx\",\n    \"重拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重拳（hitType 3）时的重防火花。拳防角色挡重斩也走这里。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_3`：`XG_fyqx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 alpha 0.1，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\",\n    \"死神辅助出场火花\",\n    \"死神阵营（`comicType!=1`）助战进场时的短火花。声用 `snd_dash`（不是 `snd_fz`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_bleach`：`XG_fz_bleach_mc` + `snd_dash`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.assisterEffect`]({ctrl})：`comicType==1` → [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)，否则本类。`FighterEventCtrl.addAssister` 与 `AssisiterCtrler.finish` 调。\n\n助战 SWF 自己还会 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 等，那是另一套必杀黑底，不是本剪辑。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\",\n    \"火影辅助出场火花\",\n    \"火影阵营（`comicType==1`）助战进场火花。声用 `snd_fz`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_naruto`：`XG_fz_naruto_mc` + `snd_fz`。\n\n与死神出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 成对。替身 [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md) 也复用 `snd_fz`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀火花（未登记）\",\n    \"导出名像「辅助必杀」。`EffectModel` 未登记。配对音 [`snd_fzbs`](snd_fzbs.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"助战进场只用 `fz_bleach` / `fz_naruto`。助战时间轴若 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 走的是全局 `XG_bs`/`XG_cbs`，不是本类。\n\n10 帧短剪辑。启动不烘焙。\"\"\".format(),\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步残影火花\",\n    \"鬼步移动时脚下/身后的 add 火花。走路循环在鬼步状态下反复 `doEffectById`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ghost_step`：`XG_ghost_step`，`snd_ghost_step`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n两条声：**VO 的 `snd_ghost_step`** 在 `EffectView.start` 播；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`]({ctrl}) 另外 `SoundCtrl.playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（主 SWF 嵌入，不在本库）。\n\n触发：`$effect_ctrler.ghostStep` 开演出（pause + 黑底 + justRender 物理仍走）；之后 [`FighterEffectCtrl.walk`]({fec}) 若 `_inGhostStep` 则反复本 id，而不是 `step1/2/3` 脚步。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0 的着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor`：`XG_hitfloor` + `snd_hitfloor`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(0)`]({ctrl}) ← [`FighterEffectCtrl.hitFloor`]({fec})。强度 1 走 [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)；强度 2 走 [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md) **外加** [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 烟。\n\n主动落地（跳下）是 [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md) `touch_floor`，不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中火花\",\n    \"冰属性打中时的命中火花，并挂持续冰冻 `ice_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **8 ICE**：`XG_ice`，`snd_hit_ice`，add，`specialEffectId=ice_ing`，freeze 400，冰色闪 `0xA3E5F5`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_ice_ing`](xg_ice_ing.md)。遗留变体 [`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md) 未登记。防御走 [`XG_ice_fy`](XG_ice_fy.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice2\",\n    \"遗留冰击火花（未登记）\",\n    \"22 帧冰剪辑，比现行 [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)（11 帧）长一倍。`initHitEffect(8)` 用的是 `XG_ice`，本类不进表。\",\n    \"\"\"无 `EffectVO`、不烘焙、无声绑定。像旧版冰命中或另一套冰爆。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice_fy\",\n    \"冰属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住冰属性时的防御火花。防住不挂冰冻。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_8`：`XG_ice_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，冰色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump\",\n    \"起跳尘\",\n    \"地面起跳时脚下的尘。坐标用 **display** x/y，不是逻辑坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump`：`XG_jump` + `snd_jump`。无 add。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.jump`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.jumpEffect`]({ctrl})。空中二段跳走 [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)，共用 `snd_jump`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump_air\",\n    \"空中跳火花\",\n    \"空中再跳（二段跳）的 add 火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump_air`：`XG_jump_air`，`snd_jump`，`blendMode=add`。地面跳 [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md) 无 add。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.jumpAirEffect`]({ctrl})。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan\",\n    \"遗留轻斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧轻斩剪辑（12 帧）。现行 hitType 1 用 [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)（10 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initHitEffect(1, \"XG_kan2\", …)`。钢体斩也用 `XG_kan2`。本类不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan2\",\n    \"轻斩命中 / 钢体斩火花\",\n    \"轻斩（hitType 1）命中火花；钢体受斩复用同一剪辑、另一份 VO。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 [`EffectVO`]({vo}) 都 `className=XG_kan2`，`cacheEffects` **各烘焙一次**：\n\n| id | 用途 | 声 | freeze | 其它 |\n|----|------|----|--------|------|\n| `hit_1` | 普通轻斩 | `snd_kan1` | 50ms | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_kan` | 钢体挨斩 | `snd_hit11` | 400ms | add，白闪 0.2，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit`，**无 shake** |\n\n普通路径 [`EffectView`]({view})；钢体 [`SteelHitEffect`]({steel})（`setTarget` 改色，freeze 结束 `resumeColor`）。\n\n遗留 [`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md) 不用。\"\"\".format(vo=E_VO, view=E_VIEW, steel=E_STEEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx\",\n    \"遗留重斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧重斩（21 帧）。现行 hitType 6 用 [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"钢体没有单独的重斩 id，重斩打钢体仍按 hitType 走 `steel_hit_kan` → `XG_kan2`。本类完全闲置。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx2\",\n    \"重斩命中火花\",\n    \"重斩（hitType 6）命中火花。重击套餐：400ms freeze + 白闪 + 震屏 + 随机旋转。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **6 KAN_HEAVY**：`XG_kanx2`，`snd_kan2`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake `pow:6, time:400`（[`EffectManager`]({mgr}) 把 pow 抄到 `shake.y`）。\n\n无 `isSteelHit`。无 `specialEffectId`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, mgr=E_MGR),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_leidian\",\n    \"电属性命中火花\",\n    \"电属性打中时的命中火花（**hardlight** 混合），并挂持续感电 `shock_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **9 ELECTRIC**：`XG_leidian`，`snd_hit_dian`，**`blendMode=hardlight`**（命中表里唯一 hardlight），`specialEffectId=shock_ing`，freeze 400，电色闪 `0x8288D2`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。遗留 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 未用。防御 [`XG_dian_fy`](XG_dian_fy.md) 用 add 不是 hardlight。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地尘\",\n    \"自己跳下/落下触地的尘，不是受击砸地。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `touch_floor`：`XG_luodi` + `snd_luodi`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.touchFloor`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.touchFloorEffect`]({ctrl})。受击落地是 `hit_floor*`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdj\",\n    \"轻法命中 / 钢体法火花\",\n    \"轻法/忍术/鬼道（hitType 4）命中火花；钢体受法复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO，同 `className=XG_mfdj`，各烘焙一次：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_4` MAGIC | `snd_hit2`（和轻拳同一声） | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_mfdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n轻拳火花是 [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)，剪辑不同、声相同。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法命中 / 破防火花\",\n    \"重法（hitType 5）命中火花；破防 `break_def` **复用同一剪辑**、另一份 VO（freeze 更长、震的是 x 不是 pow）。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | shake | 其它 |\n|----|----|--------|-------|------|\n| `hit_5` MAGIC_HEAVY | `snd_mfdjx` | 400 | `pow:6, time:400` → 抄到 y | add，`randRotate`，白闪 0.2 |\n| `break_def` | `snd_mfdjx` | **500** | **`x:6, time:400`**（不是 pow） | add，**无** randRotate / shine |\n\n`FighterMcCtrler` 破防 `doEffectById(\"break_def\")`。爆气判定 hitType 也是 5，命中火花走 `hit_5` 这份，不是 break_def。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffy\",\n    \"轻法防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻法（hitType 4）时的短火花。声与轻拳防相同（`snd_def`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_4`：`XG_mffy`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffyx\",\n    \"重法防御火花 / 未知防御回落\",\n    \"挡住重法（hitType 5）时的重防火花。`getDefenseEffect` 对未登记类型（含抓 11）回落到本条。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_5`：`XG_mffyx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 **alpha 0.15**（其它重防 0.1，属性防 0.2），shake pow 6。\n\n`getDefenseEffect`：没有 `defense_N` 则用 `defense_5`。无 `defense_11`，抓技防住也会看到本火花。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdj\",\n    \"轻拳命中 / 钢体拳火花\",\n    \"轻拳/打击（hitType 2）命中火花；钢体挨打复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_2` DA | `snd_hit2` | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_qdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n遗留轻击声 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 未绑到任何 VO。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx\",\n    \"重拳命中火花\",\n    \"重拳（hitType 3）命中火花。重击套餐。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **3 DA_HEAVY**：`XG_qdjx`，`snd_hit_heavy`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n遗留 [`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md) 未用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx2\",\n    \"遗留重拳火花（未登记）\",\n    \"13 帧重拳变体。现行 hitType 3 用 [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"无 VO。命名 `qdjx2` 与斩系 `kan2`/`kanx2`「第二版」同一套替换习惯，但这条没切过去。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush\",\n    \"地面冲刺残影\",\n    \"地面 dash 时的残影剪辑。声绑的是 **`snd_dash_air`**，不是 `snd_dash`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash`：`XG_rush`，`sound=snd_dash_air`（地面/空中冲刺共用空中声）。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.dash`]({fec})：不在空中 → 本 id；在空中 → [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。`snd_dash` 实际给死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush_air\",\n    \"空中冲刺残影\",\n    \"空中 dash 残影。与地面冲刺共用 `snd_dash_air`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash_air`：`XG_rush_air` + `snd_dash_air`。22 帧，比地面 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md)（20 帧）略长。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen\",\n    \"替身第一段\",\n    \"死神受身/替身演出的第一段火花。pause + 黑底时立刻播在**位移前**的坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp`：`XG_tishen` + `snd_fz`（和火影辅助出场同一声）。\n\n[`FighterMain.replaceSkill`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) 先 `move(250*direct)`、idle、无敌；[`EffectCtrl.replaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再 pause、黑底、藏地图、本剪辑（坐标是调用瞬间，位移已发生）、hold 1 秒逻辑帧。第一拍 [`renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再播 [`XG_tishen2`](XG_tishen2.md)。\n\n火影受身走爆气 `energyExplode`，不走替身。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"本剪辑 35 帧，是 SWF 里最长的普通火花之一（必杀脸 71 帧除外）。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen2\",\n    \"替身第二段（无声）\",\n    \"替身黑底期间第 1 逻辑帧补上的第二段。VO 无 sound。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp2`：只有 `className=XG_tishen2`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl})：`frame==1` 时在记下的 pos 播本 id。1 秒后 `endReplaceSkill` resume。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺火花（未登记）\",\n    \"25 帧、几乎每帧 Place 的冲刺剪辑。现行 dash 用 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md) / [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。配对 [`snd_xdash`](snd_xdash.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"`xdash` ≈ 横冲。启动不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\",\n    \"KO 背景闪光\",\n    \"有人在必杀中被 KO 时垫到 GameState 最底的短循环背景。5 帧，靠 `holdFrame` 撑满约 2 秒。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `kobg`：裸 VO，无声、无 add。\n\n[`FightUI.playKO`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) 若任一方 `actionState` 12/13（必杀/超必）→ [`EffectCtrl.BGEffect(\"kobg\", 2)`]({ctrl})：\n\n1. `addEffect` 在 (0,0)\n2. `holdFrame = 2 * 30 = 60` 动画拍（后置 `--` 实际 61 拍 ≈ 2s@30fps）\n3. 再挂 remove 回调恢复地图；立刻 `getMap().setVisible(false)`\n4. `addChildAt(display, 0)` 到 **GameState**（不是 `_playerLayer`）\n\n[`EffectView`]({view}) 播到缓存末帧会绕回 0 直到 hold 到期。烘焙跳过最后一帧：5 帧 MC → 缓存 4 张循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, view=E_VIEW),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 循环光\",\n    \"防御 buff 持续期间跟随角色脚底的循环光。`isBuff=true` → `BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initBuffEffect`]({model}) id `buff_defense`：`xg_buff_defense`，add，`isBuff`。无声、无 `targetColorOffset`。\n\n[`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterBuffCtrler.md) 先 `doEffectById(\"buff_effect_defense\")` 播一次性 [`xg_buff_effect_defense`](xg_buff_effect_defense.md)，再 `doBuffEffect(\"buff_defense\")` → [`BuffEffectView`]({buff})：`loopPlay=true`，逻辑帧跟 `FighterBuffVO.finished`。到期 `remove`，不改色（表无 offset）。\n\n8 帧短循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, buff=E_BUFF),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上防御 buff 时的一次性爆发。**没有** `isBuff`，普通 `EffectView`，播完即删。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_defense`：只有 add。`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp` 经 `doEffectById`。17 帧。\n\n不要和持续光 [`xg_buff_defense`](xg_buff_defense.md) 搞混。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上攻击 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_power`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.attackUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_power`](xg_buff_power.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上速度 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_speed`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.speedUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_speed`](xg_buff_speed.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 循环光\",\n    \"攻击 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_power`：add，`isBuff`。`attackUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 循环光\",\n    \"速度 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_speed`：add，`isBuff`。`speedUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_catch_hit\",\n    \"抓取命中火花\",\n    \"抓技（hitType 11 CATCH）打中时的火花。无 add、无随机旋转；freeze 400ms。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **11**：`xg_catch_hit`，`snd_hit_cache`，freeze 400。没有 shine/shake/randRotate/blendMode。\n\n无 `defense_11`：挡住抓回落 [`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)。无 `hit_10` STONE。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing\",\n    \"感电持续环绕\",\n    \"电属性命中后挂在受击者身上的持续特效。`isSpecial` → `SpecialEffectView`。带 `loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initSpeicalEffect`]({model})（原拼写）id `shock_ing`：`xg_dian_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[50,-75,255]` 偏蓝紫。\n\n由 hitType 9 的 `specialEffectId` 触发 → [`EffectCtrl.doSpecialEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})：跟随 fighter，上色；`actionState` 落到 0/23/24（站立/倒地/弹起）则 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")` + `resumeColor`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F6 | [`EffectView.renderFrameLabel`]({view}) 看到 `\"loop\"` → `gotoAndPlay(1)`（位图下标 1，不是开头 0）。? 与 1-based 帧号错一位 |\n| `finish` | F7 | 基类忽略；`SpecialEffectView` 显式 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")`。key 是 MC 帧号 7，赋给 0-based `_curFrame`，可能错一位/越界。? |\n\n21 帧。烘焙跳过最后一帧 → 缓存 20。无 `loopPlay`（对比 buff）：持续段靠 `\"loop\"` 标签或片子够长；没有可靠 loop 时可能播完 autoRemove，角色还带着染色。?\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, spec=E_SPEC, view=E_VIEW\n    ),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n    extra=\"遗留更长变体 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 同样有 loop/finish，但表用的是本类。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\",\n    \"遗留感电持续（未登记）\",\n    \"23 帧感电环绕，标签 `F8:loop` / `F9:finish`。现行 `shock_ing` 用 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)（21 帧，loop 在 F6）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initSpeicalEffect` 只写 `xg_dian_ing`。本类不烘焙。标签布局与正式三条 special 同一套（先 loop 再 finish 紧挨着），像旧版电环。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_fire_ing\",\n    \"燃烧持续环绕\",\n    \"火属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色被染成全黑。`loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fire_ing`：`xg_fire_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[-255,-255,-255]`。hitType 7 的 `specialEffectId`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F12 | `renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | F13 | `SpecialEffectView` 在 idle/倒地/弹起时跳到这里，停止跟随并 `resumeColor` |\n\n25 帧 → 缓存 24。被打 21 / 击飞 22 **不**结束，火跟到落地或回 idle。死亡 30 不在 case 里，可能跟尸体到播完。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地火花（原拼写 fllor）\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2 的重砸地火花。符号名少一个 o：`fllor`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_heavy`：`className=xg_hitfllor_heavy`（必须逐字匹配），`snd_hitfloor_heavy`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(2)`]({ctrl}) **同时**再播 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md)（lighten 烟、无声）。本剪辑本身 normal 混合。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"引擎注释已标明这是原拼写，不是反编译错误。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1 的轻着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_low`：`xg_hitfloor_low` + `snd_hitfloor_low`。`hitFloorEffect(1)`。无烟。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\",\n    \"重砸地烟（lighten）\",\n    \"重砸地额外一层烟。`blendMode=lighten`，无声。只在强度 2 时和 heavy 火花一起播。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_yan`：只有 lighten。`hitFloorEffect(2)` 在 heavy 之后再 `doEffectById`。两份 View 同坐标叠画。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitover\",\n    \"KO 收招火花\",\n    \"KO 演出收招时的火花。裸 VO：无声、无 add。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_end`：`xg_hitover`。\n\n[`FightUI`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) KO：关 `freezeEnabled`、`doEffectById(\"hit_end\")`、shine、可选 `BGEffect(\"kobg\")`、shake、`slowDown(2,0)`。24 帧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_ice_ing\",\n    \"冰冻持续环绕\",\n    \"冰属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色加蓝。`loop`/`finish` 在很靠前的帧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ice_ing`：`xg_ice_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[0,0,255]`。hitType 8。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | **F5** | 三条 special 里 loop 最早。`renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | **F6** | 倒地/idle 跳结束段 |\n\n26 帧（special 里最长）→ 缓存 25。loop 在 F5 意味着循环体很短，前面 4 帧是入场。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Sounds\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSNDS = {}\n\n\ndef add_snd(name, title, purpose, hook, unused=False):\n    SNDS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"unused\": unused,\n    }\n\n\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸声\",\n    \"爆气后半段 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md) 的爆炸声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp2` VO.`sound`。`EffectView.start` → [`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) → [`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) `new` 本类。每次 start 新实例，无法 stop。\"\n    % (E_SND, E_AM),\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi1\",\n    \"爆气起手声\",\n    \"爆气前半段 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md) 的起手声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp` VO.`sound`。后半段换 [`snd_baoqi`](snd_baoqi.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_bs\",\n    \"必杀火花声\",\n    \"普通必杀火花 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha` VO.`sound`。超必用 [`snd_cbs`](snd_cbs.md)。黑底/特写无独立声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花声\",\n    \"超必与万解火花 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha_super` VO.`sound`。本库 22 kHz 里较长的一条。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash\",\n    \"死神辅助出场声（名义冲刺）\",\n    \"导出名像冲刺，实际绑在死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md)。\",\n    \"`fz_bleach` VO.`sound`。地面/空中 dash **不用**本类，用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。样本数与 `snd_dash_air` 同为 17952，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash_air\",\n    \"冲刺声（地面+空中共用）\",\n    \"地面 `dash` 与空中 `dash_air` 共用这一声。\",\n    \"`XG_rush` / `XG_rush_air` 的 VO.`sound` 都是本 id。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_def\",\n    \"轻防格挡声\",\n    \"轻拳防、轻法防共用。\",\n    \"`defense_2` [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)、`defense_4` [`XG_mffy`](XG_mffy.md)。轻斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykan`](snd_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_defx\",\n    \"重防/属性防格挡声\",\n    \"重拳防、重法防、火/冰/电防都用这一声。\",\n    \"`defense_3/5/7/8/9`。重斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykanx`](snd_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住轻斩的专门格挡声。\",\n    \"`defense_1` [`XG_fykan`](XG_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住重斩的专门格挡声。本库较长的防御音。\",\n    \"`defense_6` [`XG_fykanx`](XG_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fz\",\n    \"火影辅助出场 / 替身声\",\n    \"火影助战进场与替身第一段共用。\",\n    \"`fz_naruto` [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)、`replaceSp` [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md)。死神助战用 [`snd_dash`](snd_dash.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_fzbs`](XG_fzbs.md)。没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写这个 id。\",\n    \"[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) 仍能 `getEffect` 到本类，但引擎从不调。\" % E_SND,\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步火花声\",\n    \"`ghost_step` VO 自带的一声。与主 SWF 的 `snd_ghost_jump` 不是同一个。\",\n    \"[`XG_ghost_step`](XG_ghost_step.md) `EffectView.start` 播本类；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`](%s) 另外 `playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（main 嵌入）。走路循环反复 start 就会反复本声。\"\n    % E_CTRL,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit1\",\n    \"遗留轻击声（未引用）\",\n    \"短命中音。现行轻拳/轻法用 [`snd_hit2`](snd_hit2.md)，轻斩用 [`snd_kan1`](snd_kan1.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO 绑定。样本数与 [`snd_hit_cache`](snd_hit_cache.md) 同为 5344，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit10\",\n    \"遗留命中声（未引用）\",\n    \"中等长度命中音。表里没有 `snd_hit10`。钢体用 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。命名像旧编号序列 `hit1`…`hit11` 的第十号。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit11\",\n    \"钢体受击声\",\n    \"三条钢体火花共用这一声。\",\n    \"`steel_hit_kan` / `steel_hit_qdj` / `steel_hit_mfdj` 都是 `snd_hit11`。普通命中不用。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit2\",\n    \"轻拳 / 轻法命中声\",\n    \"轻打击与轻法共用。\",\n    \"`hit_2` [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)、`hit_4` [`XG_mfdj`](XG_mfdj.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_cache\",\n    \"抓取命中声\",\n    \"抓技打中的一声。id 是 cache（抓住）不是 cache 缓存。\",\n    \"`hit_11` [`xg_catch_hit`](xg_catch_hit.md)。样本数与未用的 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 相同。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_dian\",\n    \"电属性命中声\",\n    \"电属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_9` [`XG_leidian`](XG_leidian.md)。防御电用 [`snd_defx`](snd_defx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中声\",\n    \"火属性打中的一声。本库最长的 MP3。\",\n    \"`hit_7` [`XG_fire`](XG_fire.md)。约 2.3 s@22 kHz，可能含燃烧尾。持续 [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) 无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\",\n    \"重拳命中声\",\n    \"重打击（hitType 3）的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_3` [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)。11 kHz。重斩用 [`snd_kan2`](snd_kan2.md)，重法用 [`snd_mfdjx`](snd_mfdjx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中声\",\n    \"冰属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_8` [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)。持续冰环无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0。\",\n    \"`hit_floor` [`XG_hitfloor`](XG_hitfloor.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2。烟层 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 无声，只有本声。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_heavy` [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_low` [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_jump\",\n    \"跳跃声\",\n    \"地面跳与空中跳共用。11 kHz 短音。\",\n    \"`jump` [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md)、`jump_air` [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan1\",\n    \"轻斩命中声\",\n    \"轻斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_1` [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)。钢体斩改 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan2\",\n    \"重斩命中声\",\n    \"重斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_6` [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地声\",\n    \"自己触地。本库最短的一条。\",\n    \"`touch_floor` [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md)。约 180 ms。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法 / 破防声\",\n    \"重法命中与破防火花共用。11 kHz。\",\n    \"`hit_5` 与 `break_def` 都是本 id（剪辑都是 [`XG_mfdjx`](XG_mfdjx.md)）。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。现行冲刺用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。SWF 里 char id 1，像最早导出的音。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\n\ndef labels_md(labels):\n    if not labels:\n        return \"无帧标签、无 `addFrameScript`。\"\n    rows = \"\\n\".join(f\"| {fr} | `{name}` |\" for fr, name in labels)\n    return \"有标签：\\n\\n| 帧 | 标签 |\\n|----|------|\\n\" + rows\n\n\ndef write_mc(name):\n    meta = MCS[name]\n    cid, frames, places, labels = SPRITES[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    cache_n = frames - 1\n    lab = labels_md(labels)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未登记**：`EffectModel` 从不 `getEffect` 本 `className`。启动不烘焙。仍导出，[`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) 能 `new`。\"\n        % E_AM\n        if unused\n        else f\"运行时 **不**再 `new` 本 MC：只在 `EffectModel.initlize` → `cacheBitmapData` 时实例化一次，画成 {cache_n} 张位图（**最后一帧不烘**，见 [`EffectVO`]({E_VO})）。之后 [`EffectView`]({E_VIEW}) 只播 Bitmap。\"\n    )\n    extra = meta[\"extra\"]\n    extra_sec = f\"\\n{extra}\\n\" if extra else \"\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n{status}\n\nSWF：`assets/effect.swf` DefineSprite **char {cid}**（FFDec `symbol{cid}`），**{frames} 帧** @30fps，约 {places} 次 Place。{lab} 运行时无帧脚本。\n\n{extra_sec}\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends MovieClip`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol{cid}\")]`：FFDec 把 sprite {cid} 链到本类。真正运行不走 Flex Embed，靠 ZIP 里整份 `effect.swf` 的 SymbolClass。\n- **L6** 类名必须与 `EffectVO.className` / `AssetManager.getClass` 逐字相同（大小写敏感）。\n- **L9–12 ` {name}()`**：`super()`。无字段、无 `stop`、无标签脚本。时间轴默认从 F1 播到尾；烘焙时 `gotoAndStop(1)` 再 `nextFrame` 扫。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_snd(name):\n    meta = SNDS[name]\n    cid, embed, samples, rate, datalen = SOUNDS[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    d = dur(samples, rate)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未引用**：没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写本 id。`playEffectSound` 仍能 `getEffect` 到。\"\n        if unused\n        else \"运行时每次 `EffectView.start` 都 `new` 一份再 `Sound.play(0,0,transform)`，不循环、不 stop、不进对象池。\"\n    )\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n声音和 MC 走同一条 [`AssetManager.getEffect(className)`]({E_AM})：从 `\"assets/effect.swf\"` `getClass` 再 `new`。[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`]({E_SND}) 把返回值当 `Sound`。`playAssetSound` 走另一套 `sounds/` 加载器，**不**进本库。\n\n{status}\n\nSWF DefineSound **char {cid}**：MP3（fmt=2），{hz} Hz，16-bit mono，{d}，payload {datalen} B。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends Sound`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/{embed}\")]`：FFDec 拆出的 MP3。运行时是 SWF 里的 DefineSound，不是单独文件。\n- **L6** 类名 = `EffectVO.sound` 字符串。\n- **L9–12 `{name}()`**：`super()`。无循环点、无音量。音量靠 `SoundCtrl._sndTransform`。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_bisha():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"bisha_face_mc.md\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).bisha_face_mc` — 必杀特写脸底 MC\n\n一句话目的：必杀/万解黑底上的特写容器。左右槽 `facemc1`/`facemc2` 给角色 SWF 导出的脸 Bitmap；时间轴 71 帧，F71 标签 `destory` 且 `stop()`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/bisha_face_mc.as`（25 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不走** `EffectModel` / `EffectView` 光栅化。唯一实例化：[`BishaFaceEffectView`]({E_FACE}) 构造 `AssetManager.I.getEffect(\"bisha_face_mc\")` → 每次 `new` 一份活 MC。\n\n链：\n\n```\n$effect_ctrler.bisha / startWanKai\n  → FighterEffectCtrl.getFace (new 角色 bsface BitmapData)\n  → EffectCtrl.bisha / wanKai → showFace\n       比双方 display.x：自己在右 → 槽 2，否则 1\n  → BlackBackView.showBishaFace\n       第一次 new BishaFaceEffectView（本 MC）\n       setFace(slot, bmp) 拉伸 254×180 塞进 facemcN\n       fadIn → gotoAndPlay(2)\n```\n\n见 [`BlackBackView`]({E_BLACK})、[`EffectCtrl.showFace`]({E_CTRL})。替身/爆气/鬼步只有黑底，**不**挂本 MC。\n\n`fadOut` 拆特写；`BlackBackView` 把 `_bishaFace` 置 null，下次必杀再 new。多次必杀可能在黑底上堆停住的旧 MC。?\n\n## 时间轴\n\nSWF DefineSprite **char 926**（`symbol926`），**71 帧** @30fps，约 168 次 Place。嵌套未导出 sprite 922（5 帧）、923（1 帧空，F1 两个 depth 先放着）。\n\n| 帧 / 标签 | 行为 |\n|-----------|------|\n| F1 | 默认停在这里（构造未 play）。多半空/准备。槽位实例已在。 |\n| F2 | [`BishaFaceEffectView.fadIn`]({E_FACE}) `gotoAndPlay(2)` 入场起点 |\n| F2–F70 | 入场动画。无其它脚本 |\n| **F71 标签 `destory`**（原拼写） | `addFrameScript(70, frame71)` → `stop()`。之后停在末帧直到下次 fadIn 或黑底被摘 |\n\n无 `loop`。退场不是时间轴倒放，是整块 `BlackBackView` 从 `GameState` 摘掉。\n\n公开实例：\n\n| 字段 | 用途 |\n|------|------|\n| `facemc1` | 左槽（自己 x ≤ 对手，或无对手） |\n| `facemc2` | 右槽（自己 x > 对手） |\n\n脸图来自各角色 SWF `defineBishaFace` 的 BitmapData 类，不是本库。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class bisha_face_mc extends MovieClip`。\n\n### 字段（L9–11）\n\n- **L9** `facemc1:MovieClip`\n- **L11** `facemc2:MovieClip`\n\nFLA 实例名。`BishaFaceEffectView.setFace` 用 `mc[\"facemc\" + slot]` 动态取。槽号不是 1/2 或时间轴还没建实例则脸丢掉。\n\n### `bisha_face_mc()`（L13–17）\n\n- **L15** `super();`\n- **L16** `addFrameScript(70, this.frame71);` — 0-based 70 = 时间轴 **F71**。\n\n### `frame71`（时间轴 F71，L19–23）\n\n- **L21** `stop();` — 停在特写停留帧。标签名 `destory` 引擎不读；真正销毁是 `BishaFaceEffectView.destory` / 黑底 fadOut。\n\n无 `gotoAndPlay`、无 COMPLETE 事件。引擎也不听 COMPLETE。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_main():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"effect_fla\" / \"MainTimeline.md\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    md = f\"\"\"# `effect_fla.MainTimeline` — effect.swf 文档类（F1 停）\n\n一句话目的：`assets/effect.swf` 的文档类。根时间轴 8 帧、30fps；F1 `stop`。引擎从不 `new` 本类，只把整份 SWF `addSwf` 进 `KyoClassLoader`，按 **链接名** `getClass`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/effect_fla/MainTimeline.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`AssetManager.loadBasic`]({E_AM}) 拉 ZIP 内 `assets/effect.swf`，完成后 [`KyoClassLoader.addSwf`](../../engine/kyo/loader/KyoClassLoader.md)`(\"assets/effect.swf\", loader)`。之后：\n\n- `getEffect(className)` → `getClass(name, \"assets/effect.swf\")` → `new`\n- [`MainGame.loadGameBack`](../../engine/game/bvn/MainGame.md) → [`EffectModel.I.initlize`]({E_MODEL}) 对表里每个 `className` `cacheBitmapData`\n\nLoader 的 `content` 才是本 `MainTimeline`。引擎只留 domain，不把 content 加到舞台。F1 `stop` 防止这份 content 在内存里空转 8 帧循环。\n\n根时间轴 8 帧、无场景标签、无导出实例。真正用的是 SymbolClass 里那 88 个链接（57 个 MC + 31 个 Sound；本类是 char 0）。\n\n对照：UI 的 `common_ui_fla.MainTimeline` 同样 F1 停、同样只灌域。\n\nABC 调试路径习惯与 UI 相同（FLA 在 `…/fla/`）。本文件无 `[Embed]`——它就是这份 SWF 自己。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\nFLA 文档包 `effect_fla`。`public dynamic class MainTimeline extends MovieClip`。无公开字段。\n\n### `MainTimeline()`（L9–13）\n\n- **L11** `super();`\n- **L12** `addFrameScript(0, this.frame1);` — 0-based 0 = 时间轴 **F1**。\n\n### `frame1`（时间轴 F1，L15–18）\n\n- **L17** `stop();` — 文档停在空白。F2–F8 空，到不了。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    (OUT / \"scripts\").mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    # order: XG_* then bisha, MainTimeline, kobg, snd_*, xg_*\n    # write all MCS except bisha (custom)\n    for name in sorted(MCS, key=lambda n: n.lower()):\n        write_mc(name)\n    write_bisha()\n    write_main()\n    for name in sorted(SNDS):\n        write_snd(name)\n\n    # verify count\n    mds = list((OUT / \"scripts\").rglob(\"*.md\"))\n    print(f\"TOTAL md under scripts: {len(mds)}\")\n    expected = 89\n    if len(mds) != expected:\n        print(\"WARNING expected\", expected, \"got\", len(mds))\n        listed = {p.stem for p in mds}\n        print(\"files\", sorted(listed))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\"\"\"\n# end\n)\n","tool_output_for_prompt":"The file /tmp/gen_effect_md.py has been created.","tool_output_for_prompt_concise":"The file /tmp/gen_effect_md.py has been created.","absolute_path":"/tmp/gen_effect_md.py","edits":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"Generate line-by-line Chinese annotations for effect.swf scripts.\"\"\"\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nOUT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/effect\")\nSRC_ROOT = \"decompiled/other/effect/scripts\"\n\nE_CTRL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/EffectCtrl.md\"\nE_MGR = \"../../engine/game/bvn/utils/EffectManager.md\"\nE_VO = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectVO.md\"\nE_MODEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectModel.md\"\nE_VIEW = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/EffectView.md\"\nE_SPEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SpecialEffectView.md\"\nE_BUFF = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BuffEffectView.md\"\nE_STEEL = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/SteelHitEffect.md\"\nE_FACE = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BishaFaceEffectView.md\"\nE_BLACK = \"../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/BlackBackView.md\"\nE_FEC = \"../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterEffectCtrl.md\"\nE_SND = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/SoundCtrl.md\"\nE_AM = \"../../engine/game/bvn/ctrl/AssetManager.md\"\nE_HIT = \"../../engine/game/bvn/data/HitType.md\"\n\n# SWF sprite metadata: name -> (char_id, frames, places, labels)\nSPRITES = {\n    \"xg_ice_ing\": (48, 26, 12, [(\"F5\", \"loop\"), (\"F6\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_fire_ing\": (73, 25, 12, [(\"F12\", \"loop\"), (\"F13\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\": (104, 23, 15, [(\"F8\", \"loop\"), (\"F9\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_dian_ing\": (131, 21, 13, [(\"F6\", \"loop\"), (\"F7\", \"finish\")]),\n    \"xg_buff_speed\": (140, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_power\": (141, 8, 4, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\": (158, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\": (159, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\": (160, 17, 8, []),\n    \"xg_buff_defense\": (161, 8, 4, []),\n    \"XG_jump_air\": (172, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_jump\": (181, 10, 4, []),\n    \"XG_luodi\": (196, 10, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitover\": (217, 24, 10, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\": (246, 18, 14, []),\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\": (261, 14, 7, []),\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\": (280, 18, 9, []),\n    \"XG_ghost_step\": (313, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\": (336, 11, 11, []),\n    \"XG_rush_air\": (365, 22, 14, []),\n    \"XG_rush\": (386, 20, 10, []),\n    \"xg_catch_hit\": (397, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_xdash\": (446, 25, 24, []),\n    \"XG_tishen2\": (467, 18, 10, []),\n    \"XG_tishen\": (470, 35, 25, []),\n    \"XG_kanx2\": (507, 17, 18, []),\n    \"XG_kanx\": (508, 21, 10, []),\n    \"XG_kan2\": (519, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_kan\": (532, 12, 6, []),\n    \"XG_hitfloor\": (543, 13, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyqx\": (554, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fyq\": (571, 10, 9, []),\n    \"XG_fykanx\": (602, 19, 15, []),\n    \"XG_fykan\": (603, 15, 7, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx2\": (634, 13, 15, []),\n    \"XG_qdjx\": (651, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_qdj\": (662, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_mffyx\": (663, 20, 5, []),\n    \"XG_mffy\": (678, 11, 7, []),\n    \"XG_mfdjx\": (679, 17, 9, []),\n    \"XG_mfdj\": (690, 12, 8, []),\n    \"XG_leidian\": (701, 12, 5, []),\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\": (712, 5, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice2\": (743, 22, 15, []),\n    \"XG_ice_fy\": (754, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_ice\": (765, 11, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\": (776, 12, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fzbs\": (787, 10, 5, []),\n    \"XG_fire_fy\": (802, 15, 8, []),\n    \"XG_fire\": (825, 23, 11, []),\n    \"XG_dian_fy\": (828, 16, 8, []),\n    \"XG_cbs\": (841, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bs\": (842, 17, 6, []),\n    \"XG_bsq\": (875, 16, 16, []),\n    \"XG_bdj\": (894, 9, 9, []),\n    \"XG_baoqi\": (911, 15, 8, []),\n    \"bisha_face_mc\": (926, 71, 168, [(\"F71\", \"destory\")]),\n}\n\n# sounds: name -> (char_id, embed_file, samples, rate_code, datalen)\n# rate 1=11025, 2=22050\nSOUNDS = {\n    \"snd_xdash\": (1, \"1_snd_xdash.mp3\", 25144, 2, 4994),\n    \"snd_fykan\": (2, \"2_snd_fykan.mp3\", 13750, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_hit2\": (3, \"3_snd_hit2.mp3\", 16128, 2, 3434),\n    \"snd_cbs\": (4, \"4_snd_cbs.mp3\", 29952, 2, 6769),\n    \"snd_fzbs\": (5, \"5_snd_fzbs.mp3\", 20160, 2, 4559),\n    \"snd_mfdjx\": (6, \"6_snd_mfdjx.mp3\", 9216, 1, 1673),\n    \"snd_jump\": (7, \"7_snd_jump.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_bs\": (8, \"8_snd_bs.mp3\", 13248, 1, 2401),\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\": (9, \"9_snd_hit_heavy.mp3\", 8064, 1, 1465),\n    \"snd_fz\": (10, \"10_snd_fz.mp3\", 8992, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit_dian\": (11, \"11_snd_hit_dian.mp3\", 17792, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_baoqi1\": (12, \"12_snd_baoqi1.mp3\", 21572, 2, 4370),\n    \"snd_hit_ice\": (13, \"13_snd_hit_ice.mp3\", 32128, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_def\": (14, \"14_snd_def.mp3\", 13824, 2, 3129),\n    \"snd_hit_fire\": (15, \"15_snd_hit_fire.mp3\", 51350, 2, 9778),\n    \"snd_hitfloor\": (16, \"16_snd_hitfloor.mp3\", 26262, 2, 5202),\n    \"snd_luodi\": (17, \"17_snd_luodi.mp3\", 3990, 2, 1250),\n    \"snd_dash_air\": (18, \"18_snd_dash_air.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\": (19, \"19_snd_hitfloor_heavy.mp3\", 33888, 2, 6450),\n    \"snd_dash\": (20, \"20_snd_dash.mp3\", 17952, 2, 3746),\n    \"snd_ghost_step\": (21, \"21_snd_ghost_step.mp3\", 15968, 2, 3330),\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\": (22, \"22_snd_hitfloor_low.mp3\", 15296, 2, 3226),\n    \"snd_hit1\": (23, \"23_snd_hit1.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_baoqi\": (24, \"24_snd_baoqi.mp3\", 31505, 2, 6138),\n    \"snd_hit_cache\": (25, \"25_snd_hit_cache.mp3\", 5344, 2, 1458),\n    \"snd_defx\": (26, \"26_snd_defx.mp3\", 14842, 2, 3018),\n    \"snd_kan1\": (27, \"27_snd_kan1.mp3\", 7423, 2, 1874),\n    \"snd_fykanx\": (28, \"28_snd_fykanx.mp3\", 29951, 2, 5930),\n    \"snd_kan2\": (29, \"29_snd_kan2.mp3\", 9024, 2, 2082),\n    \"snd_hit10\": (30, \"30_snd_hit10.mp3\", 10368, 2, 2394),\n    \"snd_hit11\": (31, \"31_snd_hit11.mp3\", 30848, 2, 6034),\n}\n\nRATE_HZ = {1: 11025, 2: 22050}\n\n\ndef dur(samples, rate):\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    ms = samples / hz * 1000\n    return f\"{ms:.0f} ms（{samples} samples / {hz} Hz）\"\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# MovieClip catalog\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# each: title, purpose, hook (markdown), extra (optional extra sections)\n\nMCS = {}\n\n\ndef add_mc(name, title, purpose, hook, extra=None, unused=False, vo_ids=None, view=\"EffectView\"):\n    MCS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"extra\": extra or \"\",\n        \"unused\": unused,\n        \"vo_ids\": vo_ids or [],\n        \"view\": view,\n    }\n\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸段火花\",\n    \"爆气演出后半段（`explodeSp2`）的爆炸剪辑。黑底结束时在角色原坐标播一次。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) 登记 id `explodeSp2`，`className=XG_baoqi`，`sound=snd_baoqi`。启动时 [`EffectVO.cacheBitmapData`]({vo}) 经 [`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) `new` 本类，逐帧光栅化后丢掉 MC。\n\n运行时 [`EffectCtrl.endEnergyExplode`]({ctrl})（`energyExplode` 倒数 0.7s 到期）`doEffectById(\"explodeSp2\")` → [`EffectManager.getEffectView`]({mgr}) 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。触发链：角色 SWF / [`FighterMain.energyExplode`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) → `$effect_ctrler.energyExplode` → [`FighterEffectCtrl`]({fec})。\n\n无 `isSpecial`/`isBuff`/`isSteelHit`。无 `blendMode`（默认 `normal`）。无 freeze/shine/shake。\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, vo=E_VO, am=E_AM, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, fec=E_FEC\n    ),\n    extra=\"前半段是 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md)（`explodeSp` + `snd_baoqi1`）。两段坐标都是调用瞬间的 fighter x/y。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bdj\",\n    \"遗留「绊打击」火花（未登记）\",\n    \"effect.swf 导出的短命中剪辑。`EffectModel` **没有**用这个 `className`。像早期普攻火花，被 `XG_qdj` / `XG_kan2` 取代。\",\n    \"\"\"[`AssetManager.getEffect`]({am}) 仍能按名 `new` 本类，但 [`EffectModel.initEffects`]({model}) / `initHitEffect` 从未写入 `_effect`。`doEffectById` / `getHitEffect` 都走不到。启动 `cacheEffects` 也不烘焙本剪辑。\n\n命名：`bdj` ≈ 绊打击。9 帧、每帧都有 Place，比现行轻拳 `XG_qdj`（12 帧）更短。\"\"\".format(am=E_AM, model=E_MODEL),\n    unused=True,\n    extra=\"同类遗留：[`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md)、[`XG_kanx`](XG_kanx.md)、[`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md)、[`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md)、[`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bs\",\n    \"必杀黑底火花\",\n    \"普通必杀（非超必）时在角色头顶偏上播的 add 混合火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha`：`className=XG_bs`，`sound=snd_bs`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.bisha(false, face?)`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.bisha`]({ctrl})：justRenderAnimate + pause + 黑底 + 可选 [`bisha_face_mc`](bisha_face_mc.md) 特写 + 本剪辑在 `(x, y-50)` + 藏地图。超必走 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md)（`bisha_super`），不走本类。\n\n万解 `wanKai` **不用**本类，强制 `bisha_super`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_bsq\",\n    \"爆气起手火花\",\n    \"爆气/霸体爆发的前半段（`explodeSp`）。pause + 黑底期间先播这一段。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `explodeSp`：`XG_bsq` + `snd_baoqi1`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.energyExplode`]({ctrl})：pause、黑底（不 fadIn）、藏地图、在 fighter 坐标 `doEffectById(\"explodeSp\")`，然后 `_explodeSkillFrame = 0.7 * FPS_GAME`。到期 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md)。\n\n角色侧同时开超钢体、造 `HitVO`（power 50, hitType 5, 击飞）。本剪辑本身无 freeze/shine。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花\",\n    \"超必杀与万解共用的 add 火花。镜头 zoom 3.5 时播在 `(x, y-50)`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `bisha_super`：`XG_cbs` + `snd_cbs` + `blendMode=add`。\n\n两条入口都到 [`EffectCtrl`]({ctrl})：\n\n- `$effect_ctrler.bisha(true, face?)` → `bisha(..., super=true)` → `cameraFocusOne` zoom 3.5 + 本剪辑\n- `$effect_ctrler.startWanKai(face?)` → `wanKai`：永远当超必，同样本剪辑\n\n普通必杀 `bisha(false)` 用 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md)，不用本类。时间轴长度与 `XG_bs` 同为 17 帧（FLA 里超必/必杀像同一套放大）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_dian_fy\",\n    \"电属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住电属性（hitType 9）时的防御火花。朝向跟攻击者。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initDefenseEffect`]({model}) `defense_9`：`XG_dian_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400ms，`blendMode=add`，`followDirect=true`，电色闪 `0x8288D2` alpha 0.2，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.doDefenseEffect`]({ctrl})：角色 `defenseType==0` 用原始 hitType；`==1` 只把斩系 1→2、6→3，**电仍是 9**。无 `specialEffectId`：防住不挂 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。\n\n未知防御类型回落 `defense_5`（[`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)），不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中火花\",\n    \"火属性攻击打中时的命中火花，并给受击者挂持续燃烧 `fire_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initHitEffect`]({model}) hitType **7 FIRE**：`XG_fire`，`snd_hit_fire`，add，freeze 400，火色闪 `0xFFFF67`，shake pow 6，**`specialEffectId=fire_ing`**。\n\n命中链：`FighterMcCtrler.doHitEffect` → [`EffectCtrl.doHitEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`EffectManager.getEffectVOByHitVO`]({mgr}) clone 本 VO（把 `pow` 抄到 `shake.y`）→ 普通 [`EffectView`]({view})。`doEffectVO` 末尾对 `FighterMain` 再 `doSpecialEffect(\"fire_ing\")` → [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) + [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})。\n\n防御命中走 [`XG_fire_fy`](XG_fire_fy.md)，不挂燃烧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, mgr=E_MGR, view=E_VIEW, spec=E_SPEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fire_fy\",\n    \"火属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住火属性时的防御火花。防住不挂燃烧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_7`：`XG_fire_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，火色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n无 `specialEffectId`。朝向用攻击者 `direct`（`EffectCtrl` + VO.`followDirect`）。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻斩（hitType 1）时的短火花。轻防套餐：freeze 50ms、无闪无震。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_1`：`XG_fykan`，`snd_fykan`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1`（拳防角色）会把斩 1 改成拳 2，改播 [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)，看不到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重斩（hitType 6）时的重防火花。带白闪（shine 自带 `blendMode=screen`）和震屏。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_6`：`XG_fykanx`，`snd_fykanx`，freeze 400，add，shine 白 alpha 0.1 **且 shine.blendMode=screen**（其它重防 shine 没写 blend），`followDirect`，shake pow 6 / 400ms。\n\n拳防角色把 6→3，改播 [`XG_fyqx`](XG_fyqx.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyq\",\n    \"轻拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻拳（hitType 2）时的短火花。也是斩→拳防映射的落点。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_2`：`XG_fyq`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\n\n`defenseType==1` 时轻斩也会落到本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fyqx\",\n    \"重拳防御火花\",\n    \"挡住重拳（hitType 3）时的重防火花。拳防角色挡重斩也走这里。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_3`：`XG_fyqx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 alpha 0.1，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_bleach_mc\",\n    \"死神辅助出场火花\",\n    \"死神阵营（`comicType!=1`）助战进场时的短火花。声用 `snd_dash`（不是 `snd_fz`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_bleach`：`XG_fz_bleach_mc` + `snd_dash`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.assisterEffect`]({ctrl})：`comicType==1` → [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)，否则本类。`FighterEventCtrl.addAssister` 与 `AssisiterCtrler.finish` 调。\n\n助战 SWF 自己还会 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 等，那是另一套必杀黑底，不是本剪辑。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fz_naruto_mc\",\n    \"火影辅助出场火花\",\n    \"火影阵营（`comicType==1`）助战进场火花。声用 `snd_fz`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fz_naruto`：`XG_fz_naruto_mc` + `snd_fz`。\n\n与死神出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 成对。替身 [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md) 也复用 `snd_fz`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀火花（未登记）\",\n    \"导出名像「辅助必杀」。`EffectModel` 未登记。配对音 [`snd_fzbs`](snd_fzbs.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"助战进场只用 `fz_bleach` / `fz_naruto`。助战时间轴若 `$assisterCtrler.effect.bisha` 走的是全局 `XG_bs`/`XG_cbs`，不是本类。\n\n10 帧短剪辑。启动不烘焙。\"\"\".format(),\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步残影火花\",\n    \"鬼步移动时脚下/身后的 add 火花。走路循环在鬼步状态下反复 `doEffectById`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ghost_step`：`XG_ghost_step`，`snd_ghost_step`，`blendMode=add`。\n\n两条声：**VO 的 `snd_ghost_step`** 在 `EffectView.start` 播；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`]({ctrl}) 另外 `SoundCtrl.playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（主 SWF 嵌入，不在本库）。\n\n触发：`$effect_ctrler.ghostStep` 开演出（pause + 黑底 + justRender 物理仍走）；之后 [`FighterEffectCtrl.walk`]({fec}) 若 `_inGhostStep` 则反复本 id，而不是 `step1/2/3` 脚步。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0 的着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor`：`XG_hitfloor` + `snd_hitfloor`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(0)`]({ctrl}) ← [`FighterEffectCtrl.hitFloor`]({fec})。强度 1 走 [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)；强度 2 走 [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md) **外加** [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 烟。\n\n主动落地（跳下）是 [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md) `touch_floor`，不是本类。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中火花\",\n    \"冰属性打中时的命中火花，并挂持续冰冻 `ice_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **8 ICE**：`XG_ice`，`snd_hit_ice`，add，`specialEffectId=ice_ing`，freeze 400，冰色闪 `0xA3E5F5`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_ice_ing`](xg_ice_ing.md)。遗留变体 [`XG_ice2`](XG_ice2.md) 未登记。防御走 [`XG_ice_fy`](XG_ice_fy.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice2\",\n    \"遗留冰击火花（未登记）\",\n    \"22 帧冰剪辑，比现行 [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)（11 帧）长一倍。`initHitEffect(8)` 用的是 `XG_ice`，本类不进表。\",\n    \"\"\"无 `EffectVO`、不烘焙、无声绑定。像旧版冰命中或另一套冰爆。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_ice_fy\",\n    \"冰属性防御火花\",\n    \"挡住冰属性时的防御火花。防住不挂冰冻。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_8`：`XG_ice_fy`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，冰色闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump\",\n    \"起跳尘\",\n    \"地面起跳时脚下的尘。坐标用 **display** x/y，不是逻辑坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump`：`XG_jump` + `snd_jump`。无 add。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.jump`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.jumpEffect`]({ctrl})。空中二段跳走 [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)，共用 `snd_jump`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_jump_air\",\n    \"空中跳火花\",\n    \"空中再跳（二段跳）的 add 火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `jump_air`：`XG_jump_air`，`snd_jump`，`blendMode=add`。地面跳 [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md) 无 add。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.jumpAirEffect`]({ctrl})。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan\",\n    \"遗留轻斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧轻斩剪辑（12 帧）。现行 hitType 1 用 [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)（10 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initHitEffect(1, \"XG_kan2\", …)`。钢体斩也用 `XG_kan2`。本类不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kan2\",\n    \"轻斩命中 / 钢体斩火花\",\n    \"轻斩（hitType 1）命中火花；钢体受斩复用同一剪辑、另一份 VO。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 [`EffectVO`]({vo}) 都 `className=XG_kan2`，`cacheEffects` **各烘焙一次**：\n\n| id | 用途 | 声 | freeze | 其它 |\n|----|------|----|--------|------|\n| `hit_1` | 普通轻斩 | `snd_kan1` | 50ms | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_kan` | 钢体挨斩 | `snd_hit11` | 400ms | add，白闪 0.2，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit`，**无 shake** |\n\n普通路径 [`EffectView`]({view})；钢体 [`SteelHitEffect`]({steel})（`setTarget` 改色，freeze 结束 `resumeColor`）。\n\n遗留 [`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md) 不用。\"\"\".format(vo=E_VO, view=E_VIEW, steel=E_STEEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx\",\n    \"遗留重斩火花（未登记）\",\n    \"旧重斩（21 帧）。现行 hitType 6 用 [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"钢体没有单独的重斩 id，重斩打钢体仍按 hitType 走 `steel_hit_kan` → `XG_kan2`。本类完全闲置。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_kanx2\",\n    \"重斩命中火花\",\n    \"重斩（hitType 6）命中火花。重击套餐：400ms freeze + 白闪 + 震屏 + 随机旋转。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **6 KAN_HEAVY**：`XG_kanx2`，`snd_kan2`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake `pow:6, time:400`（[`EffectManager`]({mgr}) 把 pow 抄到 `shake.y`）。\n\n无 `isSteelHit`。无 `specialEffectId`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, mgr=E_MGR),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_leidian\",\n    \"电属性命中火花\",\n    \"电属性打中时的命中火花（**hardlight** 混合），并挂持续感电 `shock_ing`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **9 ELECTRIC**：`XG_leidian`，`snd_hit_dian`，**`blendMode=hardlight`**（命中表里唯一 hardlight），`specialEffectId=shock_ing`，freeze 400，电色闪 `0x8288D2`，shake pow 6。\n\n持续段 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)。遗留 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 未用。防御 [`XG_dian_fy`](XG_dian_fy.md) 用 add 不是 hardlight。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地尘\",\n    \"自己跳下/落下触地的尘，不是受击砸地。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `touch_floor`：`XG_luodi` + `snd_luodi`。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.touchFloor`]({fec}) → [`EffectCtrl.touchFloorEffect`]({ctrl})。受击落地是 `hit_floor*`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdj\",\n    \"轻法命中 / 钢体法火花\",\n    \"轻法/忍术/鬼道（hitType 4）命中火花；钢体受法复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO，同 `className=XG_mfdj`，各烘焙一次：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_4` MAGIC | `snd_hit2`（和轻拳同一声） | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_mfdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n轻拳火花是 [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)，剪辑不同、声相同。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法命中 / 破防火花\",\n    \"重法（hitType 5）命中火花；破防 `break_def` **复用同一剪辑**、另一份 VO（freeze 更长、震的是 x 不是 pow）。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | shake | 其它 |\n|----|----|--------|-------|------|\n| `hit_5` MAGIC_HEAVY | `snd_mfdjx` | 400 | `pow:6, time:400` → 抄到 y | add，`randRotate`，白闪 0.2 |\n| `break_def` | `snd_mfdjx` | **500** | **`x:6, time:400`**（不是 pow） | add，**无** randRotate / shine |\n\n`FighterMcCtrler` 破防 `doEffectById(\"break_def\")`。爆气判定 hitType 也是 5，命中火花走 `hit_5` 这份，不是 break_def。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffy\",\n    \"轻法防御火花\",\n    \"挡住轻法（hitType 4）时的短火花。声与轻拳防相同（`snd_def`）。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_4`：`XG_mffy`，`snd_def`，freeze 50，add，`followDirect`。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_mffyx\",\n    \"重法防御火花 / 未知防御回落\",\n    \"挡住重法（hitType 5）时的重防火花。`getDefenseEffect` 对未登记类型（含抓 11）回落到本条。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) `defense_5`：`XG_mffyx`，`snd_defx`，freeze 400，add，`followDirect`，白闪 **alpha 0.15**（其它重防 0.1，属性防 0.2），shake pow 6。\n\n`getDefenseEffect`：没有 `defense_N` 则用 `defense_5`。无 `defense_11`，抓技防住也会看到本火花。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdj\",\n    \"轻拳命中 / 钢体拳火花\",\n    \"轻拳/打击（hitType 2）命中火花；钢体挨打复用。\",\n    \"\"\"两份 VO：\n\n| id | 声 | freeze | 旗 |\n|----|----|--------|----|\n| `hit_2` DA | `snd_hit2` | 50 | add，`randRotate` |\n| `steel_hit_qdj` | `snd_hit11` | 400 | add，白闪，`randRotate`，`isSteelHit` |\n\n遗留轻击声 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 未绑到任何 VO。\"\"\".format(),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx\",\n    \"重拳命中火花\",\n    \"重拳（hitType 3）命中火花。重击套餐。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **3 DA_HEAVY**：`XG_qdjx`，`snd_hit_heavy`，add，`randRotate`，freeze 400，白闪 0.2，shake pow 6。\n\n遗留 [`XG_qdjx2`](XG_qdjx2.md) 未用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_qdjx2\",\n    \"遗留重拳火花（未登记）\",\n    \"13 帧重拳变体。现行 hitType 3 用 [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)（17 帧）。\",\n    \"\"\"无 VO。命名 `qdjx2` 与斩系 `kan2`/`kanx2`「第二版」同一套替换习惯，但这条没切过去。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush\",\n    \"地面冲刺残影\",\n    \"地面 dash 时的残影剪辑。声绑的是 **`snd_dash_air`**，不是 `snd_dash`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash`：`XG_rush`，`sound=snd_dash_air`（地面/空中冲刺共用空中声）。\n\n[`FighterEffectCtrl.dash`]({fec})：不在空中 → 本 id；在空中 → [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。`snd_dash` 实际给死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md) 用。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, fec=E_FEC),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_rush_air\",\n    \"空中冲刺残影\",\n    \"空中 dash 残影。与地面冲刺共用 `snd_dash_air`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `dash_air`：`XG_rush_air` + `snd_dash_air`。22 帧，比地面 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md)（20 帧）略长。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen\",\n    \"替身第一段\",\n    \"死神受身/替身演出的第一段火花。pause + 黑底时立刻播在**位移前**的坐标。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp`：`XG_tishen` + `snd_fz`（和火影辅助出场同一声）。\n\n[`FighterMain.replaceSkill`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMain.md) 先 `move(250*direct)`、idle、无敌；[`EffectCtrl.replaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再 pause、黑底、藏地图、本剪辑（坐标是调用瞬间，位移已发生）、hold 1 秒逻辑帧。第一拍 [`renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl}) 再播 [`XG_tishen2`](XG_tishen2.md)。\n\n火影受身走爆气 `energyExplode`，不走替身。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"本剪辑 35 帧，是 SWF 里最长的普通火花之一（必杀脸 71 帧除外）。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_tishen2\",\n    \"替身第二段（无声）\",\n    \"替身黑底期间第 1 逻辑帧补上的第二段。VO 无 sound。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `replaceSp2`：只有 `className=XG_tishen2`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.renderReplaceSkill`]({ctrl})：`frame==1` 时在记下的 pos 播本 id。1 秒后 `endReplaceSkill` resume。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"XG_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺火花（未登记）\",\n    \"25 帧、几乎每帧 Place 的冲刺剪辑。现行 dash 用 [`XG_rush`](XG_rush.md) / [`XG_rush_air`](XG_rush_air.md)。配对 [`snd_xdash`](snd_xdash.md) 同样未引用。\",\n    \"\"\"`xdash` ≈ 横冲。启动不烘焙。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"kobg_effect_mc\",\n    \"KO 背景闪光\",\n    \"有人在必杀中被 KO 时垫到 GameState 最底的短循环背景。5 帧，靠 `holdFrame` 撑满约 2 秒。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `kobg`：裸 VO，无声、无 add。\n\n[`FightUI.playKO`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) 若任一方 `actionState` 12/13（必杀/超必）→ [`EffectCtrl.BGEffect(\"kobg\", 2)`]({ctrl})：\n\n1. `addEffect` 在 (0,0)\n2. `holdFrame = 2 * 30 = 60` 动画拍（后置 `--` 实际 61 拍 ≈ 2s@30fps）\n3. 再挂 remove 回调恢复地图；立刻 `getMap().setVisible(false)`\n4. `addChildAt(display, 0)` 到 **GameState**（不是 `_playerLayer`）\n\n[`EffectView`]({view}) 播到缓存末帧会绕回 0 直到 hold 到期。烘焙跳过最后一帧：5 帧 MC → 缓存 4 张循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, view=E_VIEW),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 循环光\",\n    \"防御 buff 持续期间跟随角色脚底的循环光。`isBuff=true` → `BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initBuffEffect`]({model}) id `buff_defense`：`xg_buff_defense`，add，`isBuff`。无声、无 `targetColorOffset`。\n\n[`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp`](../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterBuffCtrler.md) 先 `doEffectById(\"buff_effect_defense\")` 播一次性 [`xg_buff_effect_defense`](xg_buff_effect_defense.md)，再 `doBuffEffect(\"buff_defense\")` → [`BuffEffectView`]({buff})：`loopPlay=true`，逻辑帧跟 `FighterBuffVO.finished`。到期 `remove`，不改色（表无 offset）。\n\n8 帧短循环。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, buff=E_BUFF),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_defense\",\n    \"防御 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上防御 buff 时的一次性爆发。**没有** `isBuff`，普通 `EffectView`，播完即删。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_defense`：只有 add。`FighterBuffCtrler.defenseUp` 经 `doEffectById`。17 帧。\n\n不要和持续光 [`xg_buff_defense`](xg_buff_defense.md) 搞混。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上攻击 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_power`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.attackUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_power`](xg_buff_power.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_effect_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 爆发火花\",\n    \"上速度 buff 时的一次性爆发。普通 `EffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_effect_speed`：add。`FighterBuffCtrler.speedUp` → `doEffectById`。持续光是 [`xg_buff_speed`](xg_buff_speed.md)。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_power\",\n    \"攻击 buff 循环光\",\n    \"攻击 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_power`：add，`isBuff`。`attackUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_buff_speed\",\n    \"速度 buff 循环光\",\n    \"速度 buff 持续期间跟随角色的循环光。`BuffEffectView`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `buff_speed`：add，`isBuff`。`speedUp` → `doBuffEffect`。8 帧循环，无 offset。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"BuffEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_catch_hit\",\n    \"抓取命中火花\",\n    \"抓技（hitType 11 CATCH）打中时的火花。无 add、无随机旋转；freeze 400ms。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) hitType **11**：`xg_catch_hit`，`snd_hit_cache`，freeze 400。没有 shine/shake/randRotate/blendMode。\n\n无 `defense_11`：挡住抓回落 [`XG_mffyx`](XG_mffyx.md)。无 `hit_10` STONE。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing\",\n    \"感电持续环绕\",\n    \"电属性命中后挂在受击者身上的持续特效。`isSpecial` → `SpecialEffectView`。带 `loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel.initSpeicalEffect`]({model})（原拼写）id `shock_ing`：`xg_dian_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[50,-75,255]` 偏蓝紫。\n\n由 hitType 9 的 `specialEffectId` 触发 → [`EffectCtrl.doSpecialEffect`]({ctrl}) → [`SpecialEffectView`]({spec})：跟随 fighter，上色；`actionState` 落到 0/23/24（站立/倒地/弹起）则 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")` + `resumeColor`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F6 | [`EffectView.renderFrameLabel`]({view}) 看到 `\"loop\"` → `gotoAndPlay(1)`（位图下标 1，不是开头 0）。? 与 1-based 帧号错一位 |\n| `finish` | F7 | 基类忽略；`SpecialEffectView` 显式 `gotoAndPlay(\"finish\")`。key 是 MC 帧号 7，赋给 0-based `_curFrame`，可能错一位/越界。? |\n\n21 帧。烘焙跳过最后一帧 → 缓存 20。无 `loopPlay`（对比 buff）：持续段靠 `\"loop\"` 标签或片子够长；没有可靠 loop 时可能播完 autoRemove，角色还带着染色。?\"\"\".format(\n        model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL, spec=E_SPEC, view=E_VIEW\n    ),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n    extra=\"遗留更长变体 [`xg_dian_ing2`](xg_dian_ing2.md) 同样有 loop/finish，但表用的是本类。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_dian_ing2\",\n    \"遗留感电持续（未登记）\",\n    \"23 帧感电环绕，标签 `F8:loop` / `F9:finish`。现行 `shock_ing` 用 [`xg_dian_ing`](xg_dian_ing.md)（21 帧，loop 在 F6）。\",\n    \"\"\"`initSpeicalEffect` 只写 `xg_dian_ing`。本类不烘焙。标签布局与正式三条 special 同一套（先 loop 再 finish 紧挨着），像旧版电环。\"\"\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_fire_ing\",\n    \"燃烧持续环绕\",\n    \"火属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色被染成全黑。`loop`/`finish` 标签。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `fire_ing`：`xg_fire_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[-255,-255,-255]`。hitType 7 的 `specialEffectId`。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | F12 | `renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | F13 | `SpecialEffectView` 在 idle/倒地/弹起时跳到这里，停止跟随并 `resumeColor` |\n\n25 帧 → 缓存 24。被打 21 / 击飞 22 **不**结束，火跟到落地或回 idle。死亡 30 不在 case 里，可能跟尸体到播完。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfllor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地火花（原拼写 fllor）\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2 的重砸地火花。符号名少一个 o：`fllor`。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_heavy`：`className=xg_hitfllor_heavy`（必须逐字匹配），`snd_hitfloor_heavy`。\n\n[`EffectCtrl.hitFloorEffect(2)`]({ctrl}) **同时**再播 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md)（lighten 烟、无声）。本剪辑本身 normal 混合。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL, ctrl=E_CTRL),\n    extra=\"引擎注释已标明这是原拼写，不是反编译错误。\",\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地火花\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1 的轻着地火花。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_low`：`xg_hitfloor_low` + `snd_hitfloor_low`。`hitFloorEffect(1)`。无烟。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitfloor_yan\",\n    \"重砸地烟（lighten）\",\n    \"重砸地额外一层烟。`blendMode=lighten`，无声。只在强度 2 时和 heavy 火花一起播。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_floor_yan`：只有 lighten。`hitFloorEffect(2)` 在 heavy 之后再 `doEffectById`。两份 View 同坐标叠画。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_hitover\",\n    \"KO 收招火花\",\n    \"KO 演出收招时的火花。裸 VO：无声、无 add。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `hit_end`：`xg_hitover`。\n\n[`FightUI`](../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) KO：关 `freezeEnabled`、`doEffectById(\"hit_end\")`、shine、可选 `BGEffect(\"kobg\")`、shake、`slowDown(2,0)`。24 帧。\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n)\n\nadd_mc(\n    \"xg_ice_ing\",\n    \"冰冻持续环绕\",\n    \"冰属性命中后挂在受击者身上。角色加蓝。`loop`/`finish` 在很靠前的帧。\",\n    \"\"\"[`EffectModel`]({model}) id `ice_ing`：`xg_ice_ing`，add，`isSpecial`，`targetColorOffset=[0,0,255]`。hitType 8。\n\n### 时间轴标签\n\n| 标签 | MC 帧 | 运行时 |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `loop` | **F5** | 三条 special 里 loop 最早。`renderFrameLabel` → `gotoAndPlay(1)` |\n| `finish` | **F6** | 倒地/idle 跳结束段 |\n\n26 帧（special 里最长）→ 缓存 25。loop 在 F5 意味着循环体很短，前面 4 帧是入场。?\"\"\".format(model=E_MODEL),\n    view=\"SpecialEffectView\",\n)\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Sounds\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSNDS = {}\n\n\ndef add_snd(name, title, purpose, hook, unused=False):\n    SNDS[name] = {\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"purpose\": purpose,\n        \"hook\": hook,\n        \"unused\": unused,\n    }\n\n\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi\",\n    \"爆气爆炸声\",\n    \"爆气后半段 [`XG_baoqi`](XG_baoqi.md) 的爆炸声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp2` VO.`sound`。`EffectView.start` → [`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) → [`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) `new` 本类。每次 start 新实例，无法 stop。\"\n    % (E_SND, E_AM),\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_baoqi1\",\n    \"爆气起手声\",\n    \"爆气前半段 [`XG_bsq`](XG_bsq.md) 的起手声。\",\n    \"`explodeSp` VO.`sound`。后半段换 [`snd_baoqi`](snd_baoqi.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_bs\",\n    \"必杀火花声\",\n    \"普通必杀火花 [`XG_bs`](XG_bs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha` VO.`sound`。超必用 [`snd_cbs`](snd_cbs.md)。黑底/特写无独立声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_cbs\",\n    \"超必/万解火花声\",\n    \"超必与万解火花 [`XG_cbs`](XG_cbs.md) 的一声。\",\n    \"`bisha_super` VO.`sound`。本库 22 kHz 里较长的一条。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash\",\n    \"死神辅助出场声（名义冲刺）\",\n    \"导出名像冲刺，实际绑在死神辅助出场 [`XG_fz_bleach_mc`](XG_fz_bleach_mc.md)。\",\n    \"`fz_bleach` VO.`sound`。地面/空中 dash **不用**本类，用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。样本数与 `snd_dash_air` 同为 17952，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_dash_air\",\n    \"冲刺声（地面+空中共用）\",\n    \"地面 `dash` 与空中 `dash_air` 共用这一声。\",\n    \"`XG_rush` / `XG_rush_air` 的 VO.`sound` 都是本 id。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_def\",\n    \"轻防格挡声\",\n    \"轻拳防、轻法防共用。\",\n    \"`defense_2` [`XG_fyq`](XG_fyq.md)、`defense_4` [`XG_mffy`](XG_mffy.md)。轻斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykan`](snd_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_defx\",\n    \"重防/属性防格挡声\",\n    \"重拳防、重法防、火/冰/电防都用这一声。\",\n    \"`defense_3/5/7/8/9`。重斩防用专门的 [`snd_fykanx`](snd_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykan\",\n    \"轻斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住轻斩的专门格挡声。\",\n    \"`defense_1` [`XG_fykan`](XG_fykan.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fykanx\",\n    \"重斩防御声\",\n    \"挡住重斩的专门格挡声。本库较长的防御音。\",\n    \"`defense_6` [`XG_fykanx`](XG_fykanx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fz\",\n    \"火影辅助出场 / 替身声\",\n    \"火影助战进场与替身第一段共用。\",\n    \"`fz_naruto` [`XG_fz_naruto_mc`](XG_fz_naruto_mc.md)、`replaceSp` [`XG_tishen`](XG_tishen.md)。死神助战用 [`snd_dash`](snd_dash.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_fzbs\",\n    \"遗留辅助必杀声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_fzbs`](XG_fzbs.md)。没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写这个 id。\",\n    \"[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`](%s) 仍能 `getEffect` 到本类，但引擎从不调。\" % E_SND,\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_ghost_step\",\n    \"鬼步火花声\",\n    \"`ghost_step` VO 自带的一声。与主 SWF 的 `snd_ghost_jump` 不是同一个。\",\n    \"[`XG_ghost_step`](XG_ghost_step.md) `EffectView.start` 播本类；[`EffectCtrl.ghostStep`](%s) 另外 `playSwcSound(snd_ghost_jump)`（main 嵌入）。走路循环反复 start 就会反复本声。\"\n    % E_CTRL,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit1\",\n    \"遗留轻击声（未引用）\",\n    \"短命中音。现行轻拳/轻法用 [`snd_hit2`](snd_hit2.md)，轻斩用 [`snd_kan1`](snd_kan1.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO 绑定。样本数与 [`snd_hit_cache`](snd_hit_cache.md) 同为 5344，像同一条音两份导出。?\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit10\",\n    \"遗留命中声（未引用）\",\n    \"中等长度命中音。表里没有 `snd_hit10`。钢体用 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。命名像旧编号序列 `hit1`…`hit11` 的第十号。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit11\",\n    \"钢体受击声\",\n    \"三条钢体火花共用这一声。\",\n    \"`steel_hit_kan` / `steel_hit_qdj` / `steel_hit_mfdj` 都是 `snd_hit11`。普通命中不用。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit2\",\n    \"轻拳 / 轻法命中声\",\n    \"轻打击与轻法共用。\",\n    \"`hit_2` [`XG_qdj`](XG_qdj.md)、`hit_4` [`XG_mfdj`](XG_mfdj.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_cache\",\n    \"抓取命中声\",\n    \"抓技打中的一声。id 是 cache（抓住）不是 cache 缓存。\",\n    \"`hit_11` [`xg_catch_hit`](xg_catch_hit.md)。样本数与未用的 [`snd_hit1`](snd_hit1.md) 相同。?\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_dian\",\n    \"电属性命中声\",\n    \"电属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_9` [`XG_leidian`](XG_leidian.md)。防御电用 [`snd_defx`](snd_defx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_fire\",\n    \"火属性命中声\",\n    \"火属性打中的一声。本库最长的 MP3。\",\n    \"`hit_7` [`XG_fire`](XG_fire.md)。约 2.3 s@22 kHz，可能含燃烧尾。持续 [`xg_fire_ing`](xg_fire_ing.md) 无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_heavy\",\n    \"重拳命中声\",\n    \"重打击（hitType 3）的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_3` [`XG_qdjx`](XG_qdjx.md)。11 kHz。重斩用 [`snd_kan2`](snd_kan2.md)，重法用 [`snd_mfdjx`](snd_mfdjx.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hit_ice\",\n    \"冰属性命中声\",\n    \"冰属性打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_8` [`XG_ice`](XG_ice.md)。持续冰环无声。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor\",\n    \"普通砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 0。\",\n    \"`hit_floor` [`XG_hitfloor`](XG_hitfloor.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_heavy\",\n    \"重砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 2。烟层 [`xg_hitfloor_yan`](xg_hitfloor_yan.md) 无声，只有本声。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_heavy` [`xg_hitfllor_heavy`](xg_hitfllor_heavy.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_hitfloor_low\",\n    \"轻砸地声\",\n    \"受击落地强度 1。\",\n    \"`hit_floor_low` [`xg_hitfloor_low`](xg_hitfloor_low.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_jump\",\n    \"跳跃声\",\n    \"地面跳与空中跳共用。11 kHz 短音。\",\n    \"`jump` [`XG_jump`](XG_jump.md)、`jump_air` [`XG_jump_air`](XG_jump_air.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan1\",\n    \"轻斩命中声\",\n    \"轻斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_1` [`XG_kan2`](XG_kan2.md)。钢体斩改 [`snd_hit11`](snd_hit11.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_kan2\",\n    \"重斩命中声\",\n    \"重斩打中的一声。\",\n    \"`hit_6` [`XG_kanx2`](XG_kanx2.md)。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_luodi\",\n    \"主动落地声\",\n    \"自己触地。本库最短的一条。\",\n    \"`touch_floor` [`XG_luodi`](XG_luodi.md)。约 180 ms。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_mfdjx\",\n    \"重法 / 破防声\",\n    \"重法命中与破防火花共用。11 kHz。\",\n    \"`hit_5` 与 `break_def` 都是本 id（剪辑都是 [`XG_mfdjx`](XG_mfdjx.md)）。\",\n)\nadd_snd(\n    \"snd_xdash\",\n    \"遗留冲刺声（未引用）\",\n    \"配对未登记的 [`XG_xdash`](XG_xdash.md)。现行冲刺用 [`snd_dash_air`](snd_dash_air.md)。\",\n    \"无 VO。SWF 里 char id 1，像最早导出的音。\",\n    unused=True,\n)\n\n\ndef labels_md(labels):\n    if not labels:\n        return \"无帧标签、无 `addFrameScript`。\"\n    rows = \"\\n\".join(f\"| {fr} | `{name}` |\" for fr, name in labels)\n    return \"有标签：\\n\\n| 帧 | 标签 |\\n|----|------|\\n\" + rows\n\n\ndef write_mc(name):\n    meta = MCS[name]\n    cid, frames, places, labels = SPRITES[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    cache_n = frames - 1\n    lab = labels_md(labels)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未登记**：`EffectModel` 从不 `getEffect` 本 `className`。启动不烘焙。仍导出，[`AssetManager.getEffect`](%s) 能 `new`。\"\n        % E_AM\n        if unused\n        else f\"运行时 **不**再 `new` 本 MC：只在 `EffectModel.initlize` → `cacheBitmapData` 时实例化一次，画成 {cache_n} 张位图（**最后一帧不烘**，见 [`EffectVO`]({E_VO})）。之后 [`EffectView`]({E_VIEW}) 只播 Bitmap。\"\n    )\n    extra = meta[\"extra\"]\n    extra_sec = f\"\\n{extra}\\n\" if extra else \"\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n{status}\n\nSWF：`assets/effect.swf` DefineSprite **char {cid}**（FFDec `symbol{cid}`），**{frames} 帧** @30fps，约 {places} 次 Place。{lab} 运行时无帧脚本。\n\n{extra_sec}\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends MovieClip`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol{cid}\")]`：FFDec 把 sprite {cid} 链到本类。真正运行不走 Flex Embed，靠 ZIP 里整份 `effect.swf` 的 SymbolClass。\n- **L6** 类名必须与 `EffectVO.className` / `AssetManager.getClass` 逐字相同（大小写敏感）。\n- **L9–12 ` {name}()`**：`super()`。无字段、无 `stop`、无标签脚本。时间轴默认从 F1 播到尾；烘焙时 `gotoAndStop(1)` 再 `nextFrame` 扫。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_snd(name):\n    meta = SNDS[name]\n    cid, embed, samples, rate, datalen = SOUNDS[name]\n    src = f\"{SRC_ROOT}/{name}.as\"\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / f\"{name}.md\"\n    unused = meta[\"unused\"]\n    hz = RATE_HZ[rate]\n    d = dur(samples, rate)\n    status = (\n        \"**本表未引用**：没有任何 `EffectVO.sound` 写本 id。`playEffectSound` 仍能 `getEffect` 到。\"\n        if unused\n        else \"运行时每次 `EffectView.start` 都 `new` 一份再 `Sound.play(0,0,transform)`，不循环、不 stop、不进对象池。\"\n    )\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).{name}` — {meta['title']}\n\n一句话目的：{meta['purpose']}\n\n源文件：`{src}`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n{meta['hook']}\n\n声音和 MC 走同一条 [`AssetManager.getEffect(className)`]({E_AM})：从 `\"assets/effect.swf\"` `getClass` 再 `new`。[`SoundCtrl.playEffectSound`]({E_SND}) 把返回值当 `Sound`。`playAssetSound` 走另一套 `sounds/` 加载器，**不**进本库。\n\n{status}\n\nSWF DefineSound **char {cid}**：MP3（fmt=2），{hz} Hz，16-bit mono，{d}，payload {datalen} B。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class {name} extends Sound`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/{embed}\")]`：FFDec 拆出的 MP3。运行时是 SWF 里的 DefineSound，不是单独文件。\n- **L6** 类名 = `EffectVO.sound` 字符串。\n- **L9–12 `{name}()`**：`super()`。无循环点、无音量。音量靠 `SoundCtrl._sndTransform`。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_bisha():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"bisha_face_mc.md\"\n    md = f\"\"\"# `(无名包).bisha_face_mc` — 必杀特写脸底 MC\n\n一句话目的：必杀/万解黑底上的特写容器。左右槽 `facemc1`/`facemc2` 给角色 SWF 导出的脸 Bitmap；时间轴 71 帧，F71 标签 `destory` 且 `stop()`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/bisha_face_mc.as`（25 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不走** `EffectModel` / `EffectView` 光栅化。唯一实例化：[`BishaFaceEffectView`]({E_FACE}) 构造 `AssetManager.I.getEffect(\"bisha_face_mc\")` → 每次 `new` 一份活 MC。\n\n链：\n\n```\n$effect_ctrler.bisha / startWanKai\n  → FighterEffectCtrl.getFace (new 角色 bsface BitmapData)\n  → EffectCtrl.bisha / wanKai → showFace\n       比双方 display.x：自己在右 → 槽 2，否则 1\n  → BlackBackView.showBishaFace\n       第一次 new BishaFaceEffectView（本 MC）\n       setFace(slot, bmp) 拉伸 254×180 塞进 facemcN\n       fadIn → gotoAndPlay(2)\n```\n\n见 [`BlackBackView`]({E_BLACK})、[`EffectCtrl.showFace`]({E_CTRL})。替身/爆气/鬼步只有黑底，**不**挂本 MC。\n\n`fadOut` 拆特写；`BlackBackView` 把 `_bishaFace` 置 null，下次必杀再 new。多次必杀可能在黑底上堆停住的旧 MC。?\n\n## 时间轴\n\nSWF DefineSprite **char 926**（`symbol926`），**71 帧** @30fps，约 168 次 Place。嵌套未导出 sprite 922（5 帧）、923（1 帧空，F1 两个 depth 先放着）。\n\n| 帧 / 标签 | 行为 |\n|-----------|------|\n| F1 | 默认停在这里（构造未 play）。多半空/准备。槽位实例已在。 |\n| F2 | [`BishaFaceEffectView.fadIn`]({E_FACE}) `gotoAndPlay(2)` 入场起点 |\n| F2–F70 | 入场动画。无其它脚本 |\n| **F71 标签 `destory`**（原拼写） | `addFrameScript(70, frame71)` → `stop()`。之后停在末帧直到下次 fadIn 或黑底被摘 |\n\n无 `loop`。退场不是时间轴倒放，是整块 `BlackBackView` 从 `GameState` 摘掉。\n\n公开实例：\n\n| 字段 | 用途 |\n|------|------|\n| `facemc1` | 左槽（自己 x ≤ 对手，或无对手） |\n| `facemc2` | 右槽（自己 x > 对手） |\n\n脸图来自各角色 SWF `defineBishaFace` 的 BitmapData 类，不是本库。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class bisha_face_mc extends MovieClip`。\n\n### 字段（L9–11）\n\n- **L9** `facemc1:MovieClip`\n- **L11** `facemc2:MovieClip`\n\nFLA 实例名。`BishaFaceEffectView.setFace` 用 `mc[\"facemc\" + slot]` 动态取。槽号不是 1/2 或时间轴还没建实例则脸丢掉。\n\n### `bisha_face_mc()`（L13–17）\n\n- **L15** `super();`\n- **L16** `addFrameScript(70, this.frame71);` — 0-based 70 = 时间轴 **F71**。\n\n### `frame71`（时间轴 F71，L19–23）\n\n- **L21** `stop();` — 停在特写停留帧。标签名 `destory` 引擎不读；真正销毁是 `BishaFaceEffectView.destory` / 黑底 fadOut。\n\n无 `gotoAndPlay`、无 COMPLETE 事件。引擎也不听 COMPLETE。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef write_main():\n    out = OUT / \"scripts\" / \"effect_fla\" / \"MainTimeline.md\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    md = f\"\"\"# `effect_fla.MainTimeline` — effect.swf 文档类（F1 停）\n\n一句话目的：`assets/effect.swf` 的文档类。根时间轴 8 帧、30fps；F1 `stop`。引擎从不 `new` 本类，只把整份 SWF `addSwf` 进 `KyoClassLoader`，按 **链接名** `getClass`。\n\n源文件：`{SRC_ROOT}/effect_fla/MainTimeline.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`AssetManager.loadBasic`]({E_AM}) 拉 ZIP 内 `assets/effect.swf`，完成后 [`KyoClassLoader.addSwf`](../../engine/kyo/loader/KyoClassLoader.md)`(\"assets/effect.swf\", loader)`。之后：\n\n- `getEffect(className)` → `getClass(name, \"assets/effect.swf\")` → `new`\n- [`MainGame.loadGameBack`](../../engine/game/bvn/MainGame.md) → [`EffectModel.I.initlize`]({E_MODEL}) 对表里每个 `className` `cacheBitmapData`\n\nLoader 的 `content` 才是本 `MainTimeline`。引擎只留 domain，不把 content 加到舞台。F1 `stop` 防止这份 content 在内存里空转 8 帧循环。\n\n根时间轴 8 帧、无场景标签、无导出实例。真正用的是 SymbolClass 里那 88 个链接（57 个 MC + 31 个 Sound；本类是 char 0）。\n\n对照：UI 的 `common_ui_fla.MainTimeline` 同样 F1 停、同样只灌域。\n\nABC 调试路径习惯与 UI 相同（FLA 在 `…/fla/`）。本文件无 `[Embed]`——它就是这份 SWF 自己。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\nFLA 文档包 `effect_fla`。`public dynamic class MainTimeline extends MovieClip`。无公开字段。\n\n### `MainTimeline()`（L9–13）\n\n- **L11** `super();`\n- **L12** `addFrameScript(0, this.frame1);` — 0-based 0 = 时间轴 **F1**。\n\n### `frame1`（时间轴 F1，L15–18）\n\n- **L17** `stop();` — 文档停在空白。F2–F8 空，到不了。\n\n无其它函数。\n\"\"\"\n    out.write_text(md, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(f\"PROGRESS: wrote {out}\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    (OUT / \"scripts\").mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    # order: XG_* then bisha, MainTimeline, kobg, snd_*, xg_*\n    # write all MCS except bisha (custom)\n    for name in sorted(MCS, key=lambda n: n.lower()):\n        write_mc(name)\n    write_bisha()\n    write_main()\n    for name in sorted(SNDS):\n        write_snd(name)\n\n    # verify count\n    mds = list((OUT / \"scripts\").rglob(\"*.md\"))\n    print(f\"TOTAL md under scripts: {len(mds)}\")\n    expected = 89\n    if len(mds) != expected:\n        print(\"WARNING expected\", expected, \"got\", len(mds))\n        listed = {p.stem for p in mds}\n        print(\"files\", sorted(listed))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\"\"\"\n# end\n)\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}},"locations":[]}
