mffy.md\nfixed XG_dian_fy.md\nfixed xg_hitfloor_low.md\nfixed XG_fykanx.md\nfixed XG_tishen.md\nfixed XG_kan2.md\nfixed xg_buff_power.md\nfixed XG_tishen2.md\nfixed XG_ice2.md\nfixed XG_hitfloor.md\nfixed XG_fz_naruto_mc.md\nfixed XG_bdj.md\nfixed XG_rush.md\nfixed xg_ice_ing.md\nfixed XG_kan.md\nfixed XG_rush_air.md\nfixed XG_kanx2.md\nfixed XG_jump.md\nfixed XG_bsq.md\nfixed xg_catch_hit.md\nfixed xg_buff_effect_power.md\nfixed XG_ghost_step.md\nfixed XG_qdjx.md\nfixed XG_mffyx.md\nfixed XG_baoqi.md\nfixed XG_fyqx.md\nfixed XG_fz_bleach_mc.md\nfixed XG_qdj.md\nfixed XG_mfdj.md\nfixed XG_jump_air.md\nfixed XG_bs.md\nfixed xg_hitfllor_heavy.md\nfixed XG_fzbs.md\nfixed xg_dian_ing.md\nfixed xg_buff_effect_defense.md\nfixed XG_fykan.md\nfixed XG_xdash.md\nfixed xg_hitover.md\nfixed XG_fire_fy.md\nfixed xg_fire_ing.md\nfixed XG_leidian.md\nfixed XG_qdjx2.md\nfixed xg_dian_ing2.md\nfixed XG_kanx.md\nfixed kobg_effect_mc.md\nfixed XG_mfdjx.md\nshared XG_kan2.md\nshared XG_qdj.md\nshared XG_mfdj.md\nshared XG_mfdjx.md\n运行时 **不**再 `new` 本 MC：只在 `EffectModel.initlize` → `cacheBitmapData` 时实例化一次，画成 24 张位图（**最后一帧不烘**，见 [`EffectVO`](../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectVO.md)）。之后 [`EffectView`](../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/EffectView.md) 只播 Bitmap。\n\nSWF：`assets/effect.swf` DefineSprite **char 73**（FFDec `symbol73`），**25 帧** @30fps，约 12 次 Place。有标签：\n\n| 帧 | 标签 |\n|----|------|\n| F12 | `loop` |\n| F13 | `finish` |\n\n运行时无帧脚本。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class xg_fire_ing extends MovieClip`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol73\")]`：FFDec 把 sprite 73 链到本类。真正运行不走 Flex Embed，靠 ZIP 里整份 `effect.swf` 的 SymbolClass。\n- **L6** 类名必须与 `EffectVO.className` / `AssetManager.getClass` 逐字相同（大小写敏感）。\n- **L9–12 `xg_fire_ing()`**：`super()`。无字段、无 `stop`、无标签脚本。时间轴默认从 F1 播到尾；烘焙时 `gotoAndStop(1)` 再 `nextFrame` 扫。\n\n无其它函数。\n---\n遗留 [`XG_kan`](XG_kan.md) 不用。\n\n运行时 **不**再 `new` 本 MC：只在 `EffectModel.initlize` → `cacheBitmapData` 时实例化两次（hit_1 与 steel_hit_kan 各一份 VO），各画成 9 张位图（**最后一帧不烘**，见 [`EffectVO`](../../engine/game/bvn/data/EffectVO.md)）。之后 [`EffectView`](../../engine/game/bvn/views/effects/EffectView.md) 只播 Bitmap。\n\nSWF：`assets/effect.swf` DefineSprite **char 519**（FFDec `symbol519`），**10 帧** @30fps，约 5 次 Place。无帧标签、无 `addFrameScript`。\n\n运行时无帧脚本。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n无名包。`public dynamic class XG_kan2 extends MovieClip`。\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol519\")]`：FFDec 把 sprite 519 链到本类。真正运行不走 Flex Embed，靠 ZIP 里整份 `effect.swf` 的 SymbolClass。\n- **L6** 类名必须与 `EffectVO.className` / `AssetManager.getClass` 逐字相同（大小写敏感）。\n- **L9–12 `XG_kan2()`**：`super()`。无字段、无 `stop`、无标签脚本。时间轴默认从 F1 播到尾；烘焙时 `gotoAndStop(1)` 再 `nextFrame` 扫。\n---\n\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol911\")]`：FFDec 把 sprite 911 链到本类。真正运行不走 Flex Embed，靠 ZIP 里整份 `effect.swf` 的 SymbolClass。\n- **L6** 类名必须与 `EffectVO.className` / `AssetManager.getClass` 逐字相同（大小写敏感）。\n- **L9–12 `XG_baoqi()`**：`super()`。无字段、无 `stop`、无标签脚本。时间轴默认从 F1 播到尾；烘焙时 `gotoAndStop(1)` 再 `nextFrame` 扫。\n\n","exit_code":0,"command":"python3 << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot=Path('/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/effect/scripts')\nfor p in root.rglob('*.md'):\n    t=p.read_text()\n    orig=t\n    # stray space in ctor heading\n    t=t.replace('L9–12 ` ', 'L9–12 `')\n    t=t.replace('L9–12 `{name}()`', 'L9–12 `')  # no-op safety\n    # labels table glued to 运行时\n    t=t.replace('| 运行时无帧脚本。', '|\\n\\n运行时无帧脚本。')\n    t=t.replace('。 运行时无帧脚本。', '。\\n\\n运行时无帧脚本。')\n    # collapse 3+ blank lines\n    while '\\n\\n\\n' in t:\n        t=t.replace('\\n\\n\\n','\\n\\n')\n    if t!=orig:\n        p.write_text(t)\n        print('fixed', p.name)\nPY\n# fix \"实例化一次\" for shared classNames\npython3 << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot=Path('/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/effect/scripts')\nfor name, n in [('XG_kan2.md','两次（hit_1 与 steel_hit_kan 各一份 VO）'),\n                ('XG_qdj.md','两次（hit_2 与 steel_hit_qdj 各一份 VO）'),\n                ('XG_mfdj.md','两次（hit_4 与 steel_hit_mfdj 各一份 VO）'),\n                ('XG_mfdjx.md','两次（hit_5 与 break_def 各一份 VO）')]:\n    p=root/name\n    t=p.read_text()\n    t=t.replace('时实例化一次，画成', f'时实例化{n}，各画成')\n    p.write_text(t)\n    print('shared', name)\nPY\n# spot check fire_ing and kan2 ctor\nsed -n '20,40p' /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/effect/scripts/xg_fire_ing.md\necho '---'\nsed -n '18,32p' /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/effect/scripts/XG_kan2.md\necho '---'\nsed -n '26,30p' /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/effect/scripts/XG_baoqi.md\n","truncated":false,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"description":"Fix label-table glue and shared-VO bake wording","current_dir":"/workspace/bvn-3.3","output_file":"/home/box/.grok/sessions/%2Fworkspace%2Fbvn-3.3/01a06f2c-c951-7252-80a7-8fcae6fd0cc7/terminal/call-9ddf65f4-86b0-46ee-aa70-26d1ac0c92bd-73.log","total_bytes":3894},"locations":[]}
